<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremia</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin ram chhûnga Anathot khaw puithiam pakhat, Hilkia fapa Jeremia thute chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judai ram lal Amona fapa Josia lal kum sâwm leh pathumna kumin a hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal lai pawhin a lo thleng ṭhîn, Josia fapa Zedekia lal kum sawm leh pakhat kum, a thla nganaa Jerusalem mite sala an hruai thleng khân Lalpa thu chu a hnênah a lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pum chhûnga ka siam hma chein ka hria che a, Chhûl ata i chhuah hma pawhin ka serh hrang tawh che, Hnamte hnêna zâwlnei atân ka ruat che a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei chuan, “E khai, Lalpa P athian , naupang mai ka ni a, Thu sawi pawh ka thiam lo,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah: “Naupang mai ka ni ti suh, Ka tirhna che apiang hnênah kal la, Thu ka pêk che apiang i sawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni chu hlau suh, i hnênah ka awm ang a, Ka chhanhim zêl ang che,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a han ban a, a kutin ka kâ a khawih a, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah: “Ngai teh, i kâah ka thute ka dah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vawiinah hian hnamte leh lalram chungah te Thu ka pe a che: Pawt chhuak tûr te, ṭhiat tûr te, tichhe tûr te, paih tûr te, siam ṭha tûr te, phun tûr tein,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a: “Jeremia, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. “Theite ṭang ka hmu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “I hmu fuh hle mai, ka thute hlen chhuah a nih theih nân ka mitmei reng asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a, “Eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. “Hmâr lamah bêl so bawrh bawrh ka hmu, he lamah a lo liam ṭêp a ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Ram chhûng mi zawng zawng chungah hmâr lam aṭangin chhiatna ka thlentîr dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmâr lam ram hnam zawng zawng ka khâwm ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “An lalte an lo kal ang a, Jerusalem kulh bang hualin Kawngkaahte an lalṭhutthlêng an hûng ang a, Judai ram khawpui dangte pawh an hual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka miten pathian dang an bia a, Inthawina hlânin min phatsan a, An kutchhuakte an bia a, thil sual an tih tâk avângin Anni chu ka hrem dâwn tih thu ka puang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tûnah i kâwng hrêng la, inring rawh. Tho la, thu ka pêk apiang che chu hrilh rawh. An hmaah zâm suh; chutilo chu, an hmâah ka tizâm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Judai ram lal te, hotute, puithiam te, ram mipuite leh ram pum pui ep tûrin khawpui kulh nghet tak nei, thîr ban leh ngên bang nei angah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An bei ang che a; mahse, an hneh lo vang che. I hnênah ka awm a, ka chhan zêl ang che,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah heti hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kal la, Jerusalem mite hriat theih tûrin thu sawi rawh; Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I tleirâwl laia mi ngainatzia te, I mo thar laia mi hmangaihzia te, Eng mah chîn lohna ram thlalêra min zui dânte kha ka hre reng a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel chu Lalpa tân a thianghlim a, A rah thar hmasa a ni. A rawn eichhetu apiang chuan thiam loh an chang ang a, An chungah chhiatna a lo thleng ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Jakoba chhûngte leh Israel hnam zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In thlahtuten ka lakah thil ṭha lo eng nge an hmuha, Hla taka min kalsan tâk daih le? Milem, eng mah ni lo an bia a, engmahlo an nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuak a, Thlalêr, ram ro, khuarkhurum hmun, Tui vânna leh ram thim tak, tu ma kal ngai lohna, Tu ma chên ngai lohna hmuna min hruai tlangtu, Lalpa chu, ‘Khawi lamah nge a awm?’ tih nachâng an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram ṭha takah, a rah eia, a ṭhatna tlân tûrin Ka hruai thleng che u a. Mahse, in han luh chuan ka ram chu in tibawlhhlawh a, ka ram pêk che u chu in tibawrhbâng zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiamten Lalpa chu lam nachâng an hre lo va, Dân vawngtuten min hre lo va, Rorêltute ka lakah an hel a. Zâwlneiten Baal hmingin thu an puang a, Milem, hlutna nei lo, an ûm ta zâwk a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tichuan, ka khing ang che u a, In tute thlengin ka khing zêl ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kupra thliarkârahte va kal ula, en teh u, Kedar hmunahte mi tîr ula, ngun takin thlîr vêl rawh u, Hetiang thil hi a awm tawh ngai em? Ngun takin chhui teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian tak ni lo mah se, Hnamten an pathian chu an thlâk ngai em ni? Ka mite erawh chuan anmahni tiropuitu chu, Milem, hlutna nei lovin an thlâk ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw vânte u, he thil hi mak ti ula, Hlauvin mangang rawh u,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka miten thil pahnih an tisual: Kei, nunna tuihnâr hi, min kalsan a, Tuikhur an inhiah chawp a, tuikhur khi, Tui tling thei lo tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel chu chhiahhlawh a ni lo, Sal atân rênga piang pawh a ni hek lo, Engati nge mi kut a tuar tâk si le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sakeibakneiten an rûm khum a, ring takin an hâhum a, A ram an tichhe zo vek a, A khawpuite pawh luahtu awm lovin a ram zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nof mite leh Tapanhes mite chuan I lu an tikawlh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa , i Pathianin kawnga a hruai lai che I nawrhsan avângin, He thil hi i chungah a thlentîr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nail tui in tûra Aigupta pan i hlâwkpui em? Eufretis tui in tûra Asuria i pan pawh a hlâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I suahsualna avângin hrem i ni a, I hnungtawlh avângin thiam loh i chang ang a, Lalpa , i Pathian mi hawisan hi A sualzia leh ṭhat lohzia Ngaihtuah la, i hre chhuak ang. Mi ṭihna rêng i nei si lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hmânah khân i nghâwngkawl ka titliak a, An phuarna che ka tichat a, Mahse, ‘I rawng ka bâwl lo vang,’ i ti a, Tlâng sângah te, thingbuk hnuaiah te I mu vei a, nawhchizuar ang mai i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chi dik tak, grep ṭha chi chu ka phun che a, Engtizia nge min inlehsana, Grep suak, eng maha tlâk lo i nih tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chingal leh sahbawnin insil chiam mah la, I sual hnuhma chu ka hmu reng tho a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa P athian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“ ‘Ka bawlhhlawh lo va, Baal-te pawh ka ûm hek lo,’ Engtin nge i tih theih le? Ruama i chet dânte kha ngaihtuah la, I thil tih ṭhinte kha hre reng rawh, Sanghâwngsei hur, awm ngaihna hre lo anga i zat ruai kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlalêra sabengtung hur, a hnâr lên ruai ṭhîn chu, A châkna tu nge dang zo vang? Pan hah a ngai lo va, Hmuh mai theihin a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dang ro hial khawpa pathian dang panin I ke rap na suh; Nang chuan, ‘Bei a dawng ta, ram dang mite ka ngaina a, Anni chu ka zui dâwn,’ i ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Rûkru man angin Israel chhûngte an zak ang, An lal te, an hotu te, an puithiam te leh An zâwlnei te chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thingbul hnênah, ‘Ka pa i ni,’ an ti a, Lung hnênah, ‘Mi hringtu i ni,’ an ti a; Ka lam hawi lovin an tukkhum chhah min chhawn a, An manganin, ‘Tho la, min chhan rawh,’ an ti leh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />In siam chawp, in pathiante chu khawiah nge? Lo tho sela, in manganna ata An chhan thei mahna che u, Aw Juda, i khawpui zât zet pathian i neih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Engtizia nge ka chungah in vui fo le? In vaiin ka lakah in hel hi,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“In fate ka hrem a, a sâwt lo, An ṭhat phah chuang lo; Sakeibaknei nghal angin zâwlneite khandaihin in that ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nangni tûnlai mite u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh u. Thlalêr leh ram thim tak ang, Israel-te tân ka lo ni em ni? Engtizia nge ka miten, ‘Kan zalên ta, i hnênah kan lo kal tawh lo vang,’ an tih hial le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nulain a incheina a theihnghilhin Movin a inneih thawmhnaw a theihnghilh thei em ni? Ka miten min theihnghilh chhûng nite erawh chu Chhiar sên rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngaihzâwngte lêm dân i va thiam êm? Hmeichhe suaksualte pawhin i tih dân an zir tâk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I puanah pawisawilo, mi retheite thisen a kai e, Rawk tum che i lo that pawh a ni si lo, Nimahsela, hêng zawng zawng ti chung hian
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Pawi ka khawih lo va, Ka lakah a thinur hek lo vang,’ i ti a. ‘Ka sual lo ve,’ i ti tlat a, Ngai teh, i chungthu ka rêl dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Engtizia nge i awm dân i thlâk zung zung mai le? Asuria i mualpho phah ang khân Aigupta pawh i mualpho phah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kut khumin chuta ṭang pawh chuan i chhuak ang a, I innghahna ṭhinte chu Lalpa chuan a paihthla tawh a, Chûngho chuan an pui hauh lo vang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Miin a nupui ma sela, A nupui chuan pasal dang nei sela, Chu hmeichhia chu a pawm leh duh dâwn em ni? Ramin a bawlhhlawh phah vek dâwn lâwm ni? Nang chuan tlangvâl tam tak nei tawh mah la, ka hnênah i lo kîr leh duh lâwm ni?” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlâng kawlh vel vul lam khi hawi la, en vêl teh, An mutpui lohna che hmun a awm em? Arab tleirâwlhovin mi an châng angin Tlangvâl nghâkin kawng sîrah i ṭhu reng ṭhîn; I nawhchi zawrh avâng leh i suahsualna avângin Ram i tibawlhhlawh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng avâng hian ruah a sûr lo va, Ruah hnuhnûng a sûr hek lo; Nawhchizuar hmêl i pu a, i zak duh hauh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ka pa, ka tleirâwl lai ata min kaihruaitu,’ Mi ti zo chauh a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘A thinur reng ang maw? A thinrim kumkhua dâwn em ni?’ ti reng chung siin Ngai teh, a sual thei ang berin thil i ti ta si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josia lal laiin Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Mi rinawm lo Israel-te thiltih hi i hmu em? Tlâng sâng tinah te chhovin, thingbuk tin hnuaiah te chuan thil sual an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi an tih hnuah ka hnênah an lo kîr ang chu ka ti a; mahse, an lo kîr chuang lo. An laizâwn Juda, mi bumhmangte pawhin an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi rinawm lo Israel-te chu an uirena sual ka hmuh vek avângin inmâkna lehkha ka pe a, ka hnawt chhuak a. A laizâwn, bumhmang Juda-te pawhin hlauh nachâng an hre lo va; an chhuak a, nawhchi an zuar ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eng mah pawisa lova nawhchi an zawrh avângin ram chu an tibawlhhlawh zo ta a. Thingbulah te, lung bulah te chuan an uire ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin an laizâwn, hel hmang Juda-te chu thinlung takin an lo kîr lo va, a der maiin a ni an lo kîr,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Mi rinawm lo Israel chu bumhmang Juda ai chuan fel zâwkah an inngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kal la, hêng thu hi hmâr lamah va sawi rawh: ‘Rinawm lo Israel, lo kîr rawh, Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; Thinrimin ka en reng lo vang che, Zahngai thei tak ka ni si a, Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; ka thinur reng dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian laka in hel hi Thil sual in ti a ni tih hre rawh u. Thingbuk tin hnuaiah ram dang mite lakah in inphalrai a, ka thu in zâwm si lo, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw, mi rinawm lote u, lo kîr leh rawh u, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti; In pasal ka ni a, khawpui tin aṭangin mi pakhat, Hnam tin zîng ata mi pahnih, Ka thlang chhuak ang a, Zion-ah ka hruai ang che u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka lungdum zâwng tak berâmpute ka pe ang che u a, annin hriatna te, hriatthiamna tein an châwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng ni-ahte chuan in lo pung ang a, ram chhûngah in tam hle ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Mite chuan Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm an lam tawh lo vang a, an ngaihtuah tawh lo vang a, an hre reng tawh hek lo vang; an mamawh tawh lo vang a, a dang an siam tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan Jerusalem chu Lalpa lalṭhutthlêng an vuah ang a, Jerusalem-ah chuan hnam tinrêng Lalpa hming fak tûrin an kal khâwm ang a, rilru sual puin luhlul takin eng mah an ti tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng ni-ahte chuan Juda chhûngte leh Israel chhûngte chu an inzawm ang a, in pute hnêna rochan atân ka pêk ramah chuan hmâr lam aṭangin an lo haw ho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ti hian ka ngaihtuah a, “Ram nuam tak, hnam tin rochan zînga ram ṭha ber pe chein, Fa atân neih che ka duh a; ‘Ka pa,’ tia min kohva, Min hawisan loh ka lo beisei tehlul nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasal laka rinawm lo hmeichhia ang hian Israel chhûngte u, Ka lakah in rinawm lo a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tlâng kawlh vul lamah au thâwm a awm e, Israel fate ṭap thâwm leh dîlna au thâwm chu, An Pathian, Lalpa chu an theihnghilh a, An pênsan tâk avâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Fa rinawm lote u, lamlêt ula, In rinawm lohna chu ka tireh ang a, “En teh, i hnênah kan lo kal hi, Nang, Lalpa chu kan Pathian i ni si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ni, tlânga milem biak te hi a sâwt lo va, Tlâng chunga rîk bûng bûng te hi bumna mai a ni; Lalpa , kan Pathian chauh hi a ni Israel-te chhandamtu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, kan tleirâwl lai ata kan pate thawhrim rah, an berâm rual te, ran rual te, an fanu leh fapate chenin, hêng thil zahpuiawm, milem biak nân te hian an hmang zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zak takin i mu mai teh ang u, kan mualpho tâwpkhâwk ta a nih hi, kan Pathian lakah thil sual kan ti a. Keini leh min thlahtute nên, kan tleirâwl lai ata vawiin thlengin Lalpa kan Pathian aw kan pawisa duh si lo,” in ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel-te u, lo kîr in duh chuan ka hnênah ngei in lo kîr tûr a ni. In milem tenawm takte kha ka hma ata in dah bo va, In vah bo tawh loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rinawm taka in awma, dik tak leh fel faka ro in rêla, Mi nung Lalpa hming in chhâl chuan, Hnamte chu mal ka sâwm ang a, Annin mi chawimawi ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda mite leh Jerusalem mite hnênah Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In lei khêkte let ula, Hlîng zîngahte chi theh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a awmte u, Lalpa tân serh tan ula, In thinlung serh tan rawh u. Chutilo chu, in thil sual tih avângin Ka thinur ang a, mei angin a alh chhuak ang a, Tu ma ṭhelh rual lohvin a alh dah ang e.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai ramah hril ula, Jerusalem-ah puang rawh u, Ram pumah tawtawrâwt hâm ula, lo tlân khâwm rawh u; ‘Kulh nei khawpuiahte i tlân lût ang u,’ tiin Ring takin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion kâwkin chhinchhiahna târ rawh u, Himna zawngin tlân ula, muang suh u, Hmâr lam aṭangin thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen dâwn, Chhiatna râpthlâk tak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tawmbûk aṭangin sakeibaknei a lo chhuak e, Hnamte tichhetu chu a lo lang ta. I ram tichhe tûrin a bûk a rawn chhuahsan, I khawpuite luah tlâk lohvin a tichhe dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, saiip puan sin ula, Lungchhe takin ṭap vak vak rawh u, Lalpa thinur nasa tak chuan min kiansan si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chumi ni-ah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lal leh hotute thinlung chu a zâm ang a, Puithiamte an buai hle ang a, Zâwlneite pawh an mangang hle ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei chuan, “E heu! Lalpa P athian , he mite leh Jerusalem mite hi i bum let dêr a lo nih hi, ‘Muanna a awm ang,’ i ti a, Khandaih an hmachhawn tâk hi,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan he mite leh Jerusalem-a mite hi heti hian hrilh rawh: “Thlalêr tlâng kawlh vel vul aṭangin thli lum ka mite lamah a lo tleh ang a, a si chhêm lênga chhêm faitu mai ni lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />thli na tak, ka thu pêkin a lo tleh dâwn; tûnah, kei pawhin an chungthu ka rêl dâwn,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En teh, chhûmpui angin hmêlmate an lo thawk e, An tawlailîrte chu thlipui ang, an sakawrte pawh mupui aiin an chak, Kan chung a va pik êm! Kan râlthûm a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, i thinlung sual sil fai la, Chhan chhuah i ni dâwn nia, Eng chen nge thil sual i ngaihtuah dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan ram aṭangin thu a lo thang vêl, Chhiatna thleng tûr Efraim tlângram aṭangin an puang e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnamte hrilh ula, Jerusalem-ah puang rawh u, Ram hla tak ata hualtute an lo kal, Judai ram khawpuite beih tumin an au ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lo vêngtute ang maiin a vêlin an hual, “Ka laka an hel vâng a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I awm dân leh i thil tihten hêng hi i chungah a tithleng ta, I sual vang a ni, a na ngei mai. I thinhnûn a chhun ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A va na êm, a va na êm, a va na tak êm! Aw ka rilru a va na êm, ka thin a phu zawih zawih, Ka awm hle hle thei lo. Tawtawrâwt ri te, indo thâwm te ka hre ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chhiatna a lo thleng zut zut a, Ram pum a chhe zo ta, Kan puan inte kârlovah a chhia a, Kan puanzârte a thlêr zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eng chen nge indo lai ka hmuh anga, Tawtawrâwt ri ka hriat ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mite zawng an â êm a, min hre lo a ni, Naupang â ang maiin Thil sual tih zawng an thiam hle, Thil ṭha tih an thiam si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilung ka han en vêl a, ngai teh, Eng mah a awm lo va, a ruak huai mai a ni, Vân lamah pawh êng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlângte ka han en chuan, ngai teh, a nghîng dur dur a, Mual tinrêng pawh a insâwi hlawk hlawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka han hawi vêl chuan mihring rêng an awm lo va, Chunglêng sava zawng pawh an thlâwk bo zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka han hawi vêl a, ram ṭha tak chu thlalêr a chang zo ta, Khawpui zawng zawng pawh a chhe zo ta, Lalpa thinurna nasa tak hmaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />(Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ram pum a chhe nasa hle ang a; Mahse, ka tichhe vek lo vang.”)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan lei hi a ngui ruai ang a, Chung lam vânte pawh a thim vek ang. Thu ka sawi tawh a, ka sût lo vang. Ka tiam tawh a, ka hlen ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sakawr chungchuang mite leh thal kengtute thâwmah Khawpuia mi zawng zawng an tlânchhia a, Ṭhenkhat ngawah an tlân lût a, A ṭhen lung hmunahte an lâwn a, Khawpui zawng zawng a ram zo va, Luahtu rêng an awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang, tihchhiata awm tawh hnu, Engtizia nge puan senlâr sina rangkachaka incheiin I mitte i hnawih dûr? I inchei thlâwn mai a ni, I ngaihzâwngten an hmusit che a, thah an tum che asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zion fanu thaw huam huam ri chu ka hria, Hmeichhe nau vei rûm thâwm, Fa tîr vei ṭê vawng vawng thâwm chu, A bân a phar a, “Ka chung a va pik êm! Tualthattuten min nang ta a nih hi,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem kawtthlêrah tlân vêl ula, Hawi vêlin ngaihven rawh u; A tual zâwl zawng zawngte pawh zawng ula, Mi pakhat tal dik taka tia, Thu dik zawng rêng in hmuh chuan He khawpui hi ka ngaidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa , mi nung hming chu chhâl mah se, Dâwt an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , thu dik chu i zawng a ni lâwm ni? Anni chu i vua a, an pawisa chuang si lo, Anni chu i chîl a, i thununna chu an zâwm duh chuang lo, An hmêl chu lung aiin a chang zâwk a, An sim duh hlawl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, keiin, “Hêngho hi an â êm a, an rethei hle bawk a, Lalpa kawng pawh an hre lo va ni, An Pathian remruat an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miliante hnênah ka kal ang a, ka va bia ang, Anni chuan Lalpa dân leh an Pathian remruat, An hriat ngei kha,” ka ti a. Nimahsela, anni pawh chu an inthurual a, An Pathian thu chu an hnâwl a, A phuarna hruite an tichat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngawa sakeibakneiin anni chu a seh ang a, Thlalêr chinghniain a ei zo vang. Khawpuia mite chu keitein a châng ang a, A vâkchhuak apiang a lo pawt sawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“An bawhchhe nasa a, an hnungtawlh thui êm avângin, Engtin nge ka ngaihdam theih ang che u? In faten min phatsan a, Pathian tak ni hlei lo hming an chhâl a. Puar taka ka hrai pawhin uire an chîng a, Nawhchizuar inahte an vir huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sakawrpa châwm thau za chung angin Ṭhenawmte nupui îtin an za ruai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng thil avâng hian ka hrem lo vang maw?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Hetiang hi keimah ngeiin ka hrem lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An huanahte chuan lût ula, tichhe rawh u, Amaherawhchu, tichhe vek suh u. A zârte la bo ula, chûngte chu Lalpa ta an ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel chhûngte leh Jakoba chhûngte chu Ka lakah an rinawm lo hle a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu dâwtah an ngai a, “Chutin a ti lo vang, Kan chungah chhiatna a thlentîr lo vang, Ṭâm te, khandaih te kan tuar lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Zâwlneite pawh thli mai an ni a, Anmahniah thutak rêng a awm lo, An sawi ang chu an chungah thleng rawh se,” an ti bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa , Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Hetianga thu an sawi avângin ka thu i puante chu Meiah ka chantîr ang a, mite hi thingah ka chantîr bawk ang, Tichuan, an kâng ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Israel chhûngte u, nangmahni do tûrin ram hla taka hnam chu ka rawn hruai e,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti; “Hmasâng ata hnam hlun chak tak, an ṭawng pawh i hriat loh, An thu sawi pawh i hriatthiam lohte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An thal bâwmte chu thlân inhawng a ni a, An za-in mi chak, huaisen an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I thlai te, i chaw te an ei zo vang a, I fanu leh fapate chu an that ang. I ran rual te, i berâm rual te an ei ang a, I grep te, i theipui te an ei zo vek ang a, I rinchhan, khawpui kulh neite chu Hmêlmate chuan an chhu chhe vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chûng ni-ah te chuan, Ka tiboral vek lo vang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Engtizia nge Lalpa kan Pathianin kan chungah hêng thil hi a tih le?’ i miten an tih chuan. Hetiangin chhâng ang che: ‘Min phatsan a, in ramah ram dang pathian in bia a, Chuvângin, in ram ni lovah ram dang mite rawng in bâwl ang, a ti,’ tiin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Jakoba thlahte chu hei hi hrilh ula, Judai ramah puangzâr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangni mi â, hriatthiamna nei lote u, Hei hi lo hre teh u: Mit in nei a, in hmu si lo, Beng in nei a, in hre thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi hlau lo vang maw?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Ka hmaah in khûr lo vang maw? Tuipui chîm chin atân ṭiaupho ka dah a, A liam lohna tûra daidanna nghet chu, Tuifâwn chuan a chîmpil lo vang a, A fâwn chu ko bûr bûr mah se, A kuang a liam hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, hêng mite hi mi luhlul, hel hmang an ni, An pêng a, an kal bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Lalpa , kan Pathian chu i ṭih ang u, A hun takah ruah min pe a, Ruah hmasa leh ruah hnuhnûng a sûrtîr a, Buhseng hunbi min ruatsaktu a ni,” Thinlung takin an ti ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng thil hi in thil sual tih avângin a bo zo va, In sualna avângin thil ṭha in chân ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka mite zîngah misual an awm, Thangkamtu angin mite an châng a, Thang an kam a, mite an âwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Savaa khat bâwm angin An inte pawh bumnain a khat, An lo hausa a, thil an tithei ta hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An lo thau va, an lo mûm a, Tâwk chin nei lovin thil sual an ti. Fahrahte hmakhua an ngai lo va, Retheite chan ṭhatna tûr an ngaihtuah hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng thil avâng hian ka hrem lo vang maw?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Hetiang hnam chungah hian phuba ka la lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />He ramah hian thil râpthlâk tak leh hlauhawm tak a lo thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zâwlneiten dâwtin thu an hril a, Puithiamten an thu thuin ro an rêl a, Chutiang chu ka mite lawmzâwng tak a ni, Ni kin ni-ah chuan engtin nge in awm tâk ang?
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin mite u, Jerusalem chhûng ata himna zawngin Tekoa khuaah tawtawrâwt hâm ula, Beth-hakarem aṭangin hriattîrna phêt rawh u, Hmâr lam ata thil ṭha lo a lo thleng ṭêp Chhiatna râpthlâk tak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion fanu, hmêlṭha leh no tak chu ka tichhe dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalte, an sipai rualte nên an lo thawk ang a, Khawpui hualin an puan in an rawn kaih ang a, Mahni duhna hmun ṭheuhvah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bei tûrin inpuahchah rawh u, Tho ula, chhûnah i bei ang u, E khai, ni a hniam ta a, khua a tlai ta, A thim mai dâwn alâwm le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tho ula, i bei ang, kulhte i tichhe vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Thingte kit ula, Jerusalem-a luh nân lei chhûng pâwng rawh u, Hnehchhiahnaa khat khawpui hi tihchhiat vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuikhurah tuihna a chhuak angin, Suahsualna a chhuak reng a ni. Tharum thawh leh inrawk a chhûngah a hluar a, Na tuar leh hliam tuar hmuh tûr an awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, ka hawisan loh nân che leh I ram chu luahtu awm lova ka siam loh nân Zilhna hi pawisa teh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel awm chhunte chu grep angin lo fai ula, Grep lotuin a rahte a vai nawn angin vai nawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An awih theih nân tu nge ka hrilh ang a, Tu nge zilhna ka pêk ang? Ngai teh, an beng an chhungawng tlat a, Eng mah an hre thei lo.” Lalpa thu chu an huatzâwng a ni a, an lâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa thinurnain ka thinur êm êm a, Ka insûm zo lo a ni. “Naupang tualchaite chungah hrithla la, Tlangvâl awm khâwmte chungah pawh; A pasal rualin a nupui man ni rawh se, Upa leh tarchhiate pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An inte chu mi dang pêk a ni ang a, An ram leh an nupuite pawh, Chu rama chêngte chungah ka kut ka lek dâwn,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A te ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin duhâmnain an khat a, Zâwlneite leh puithiamte pawhin mi bum an chîng hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite hliam chu duhdah takin an tuam a, “A ṭha e, a ṭha e,” an ti a, a ṭha hauh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil tenawm an tih pawhin an zak lo va, Zah nachâng an hre rêng rêng lo. Chûng mite chu mi dang tlute zîngah an tlu ve ang a, Anni chu ka hrem hunah an thal dêr ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kawng pengṭhuamahte ding ula, en vêl rawh u, Kawng hlun leh ṭha chu zâwt ula, Tah chuan, kal rawh u. Tichuan, in thla a muang ang,” a ti a. Anni erawh chuan, “Kan kal lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“In tân râlvêngtu ka ruat a, An tawtawrâwt ri chu ngaithla rawh u,” ka ti a, Anni erawh chuan, “Kan ngaithla lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw hnamte u, ngaithla ula, nangni, pungkhâwmhote u, An chunga thil lo thleng tûr chu lo hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw leilung, ngaithla teh, Hêng mite chungah hian chhiatna ka thlentîr dâwn, Ka thute an ngaihthlâk lohva, ka dânte an hnâwl avângin An suangtuahna rah chu an seng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Seba aṭanga beraw rimtui te, Ram hla tak aṭanga fu thlum tak mi rawn lâkte hi Eng atân nge ka tih ang? In hâlral thilhlante chu pawm tlâk a ni lo va, In inthawinate chuan min tilâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hêng mite hmaah hian tlûkna tûr ka dah ang a, Tah chuan, pate leh an fate chu an tlu za ang a, An ṭhenawmte leh an ṭhiante pawh an boral ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, hmâr lam aṭangin mi an lo kal e, Kâwlkila hnam ropui chu chawhthawh a ni ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thal leh a ngul an keng a, Mi nunrâwng tak, lainatna nei lo an ni; an thâwm chu tuipui ri hum hum ang a ni, Sakawr chungahte an chuang a, Indo tûrin an intlar ṭhut mai, Aw Zion fanu, nangmah bei tûrin an lo thawk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An chanchin kan hriat chuan kan bânte a zawi zo va, Hrehawm chuan min nangchîng ta, Hmeichhe nau vei ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lo lamah kal suh ula, kawngah pawh kal hek suh u, Tah chuan hmêlma an awm a, kil tinah râl a ṭi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw, ka mite u, saiip puan sin ula, Vaivutah tâl rawh u. Fapa mal sûn ang maiin lungchhe takin ṭap rawh u, Tichhetu chuan min rawn nang thut dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kulh bangah leh râlvênbûkah ka siam a che, Ka mite hi fiah la, i thu an awih emaw chhin rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An vaiin mi luhlul, hel hmang an ni, Mi rêlin an vâk ruai a, Dâr leh thîr anga sak an ni a, An za-in dik lo takin thil an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Suan chu titui tûrin pûmin an zâp ṭhîn a, Mahse, a tithianghlim thei lo, Mi sualte chu lâk bo an nih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anni chu tangkaraw êkchhia an ti ang, Kei, Lalpa hian ka hnâwl tawh si a.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa in kawngkaah ding la, hetiang hian thu sawi rawh: ‘Nangni Lalpa be tûra hêng kawngkaa lo lût, Juda mi zawng zawngte u, Lalpa , thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: in thiltih te, in awm dân te siam ṭha ula; tichuan, he hmunah hian ka awmtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hei hi Lalpa in, Lalpa in, Lalpa in ngei a ni’ tih ringawt hi innghahna tlâk a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In awm dân te, in thil tihte in siam ṭha takmeuh a nih chuan dik takin mi dangte thu pawh rêlsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram dang mi te, fahrah te, hmeithai te hnehchhiah suh u; thil sual ti lote thisen he hmunah hian chhuah suh ula, in chhiatna tûrin pathian dangte be hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, he ram, hmasâng ata in thlahtute ka pêk ramah hian, kumkhuain ka awmtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, dâwt thu, eng mah ni lo chu in ring zâwk si a le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rûk in ru a, tual in that a, in uire a, dâwtin chhia in chham a, Baal hnênah rimtui in hâl a, in hriat ngai loh pathiante in be ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In lo kal a, he in, ka hming lam ṭhinna hmunah, ka hmaa dingin, ‘kan him ta,’ ti chungin hêng thil bawlhhlawh hi in ti zêl ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He in, ka hming lamna hmun hi, suamhmangte pûk emaw in ti elo? Mahse, keimah ngeiin ka hmu reng che u asin,’ ” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A tîra ka hming lamna hmun atâna ka thlan Silo khuaah kal ula; ka mi, Israel-te sualna avânga ka thiltihte en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hêng thil sual hi in tih avângin zîng tak takah in hnênah thu ka sawi a, ka ko che u a, in chhâng si lo,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Silo khua ka sawisak ang khân ka hming lamna in, in muanpui ṭhin, nangni leh in thlahtute ka pêk hmunte hi ka sawisa dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Efraim thlah, in unaute ka hnawt chhuak vek ang khân nangni pawh ka hnên ata ka hnawt chhuak dâwn che u a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chuvângin, hêng mite hi ṭawngṭaisak suh, an tân dîl suh la, ngensak hek suh; i dîlsak pawhin ka ngaithla lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judai ram khawpuia an thiltihte, Jerusalem kawtthlêra an thiltih te hi i hmu lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangin thing an fawm a, paten mei an chhêm a, nuten vân lalnu hnêna hlan tûr chhang an hmet a, pathian dangte tân in tûr thilhlan an thli chhuak a; chûng avâng chuan ka thinur takzet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mi tithinur mai em ni an nih?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. An zahna tûr an insiam zâwk a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thinurna nasa tak chu he hmunah hian ka leihbua ang a, mihring te, ramsa te, ramhnuai thing te, huana theirahte a kâng ang a, a mit tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Hâlral thilhlante chu inthawina pangngaiah belh ula, a sate pawh ei law law rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In thlahtute Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah lai khân hâlral thilhlan te, inthawina te eng mah ka phût lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka thupêk chu hei hi a ni zâwk, ‘Ka thu zâwm ula, in Pathian ka ni ang a, ka mite in ni ang. In hnêna ka thupêk zawng zawng hi in zawm chuan in hmuingîl zêl ang,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, an ngaithla lo va, an pawisa hek lo, luhlul chhuahin sual lam an âwn tlat a, hma lam pan lovin an hnungtawlh ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In thlahtuten Aigupta an chhuahsan ni aṭanga vawiin thlengin in hnênah ka chhiahhlawh te, zâwlnei te, ni tin zîng tak takah ka tîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mahse, min ngaihsak lo va, min pawisa hek lo. Luhlul an chhuah a, an thlahtute aiin an sual ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hêng thu zawng zawng hi i hrilh ang a; mahse, an ngaithla duh lo vang. Anni chu i ko vang a, an chhâng lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hmaah heti hian sawi rawh: ‘He hnam hian Lalpa , an Pathian aw an ngaithla lo va, a kaihhruaina an zâwm hek lo. Thu dik a bo va, sawi pawh an sawi ngai tawh lo,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“I lu ziat kawlh la, i sam paih rawh, tlâng kawlh vulahte chuan lusûn angin awm rawh. He chhuan chungah hian kei Lalpa hi ka thinur a, ka paihthla ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Juda mite chuan ka mite hmuhah thil sual an ti ta,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Ka hming lam ṭhinna inah an milem tenawm tak chu an hûng a, an tibawlhhlawh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An fanute, an fapate hâl nân Ben-Hinom ruamah Tofet in sâng an sa a; chu chu ka thupêk a ni lo va, ka ngaihtuah ngai loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, fîmkhur la, nite a lo thleng dâwn e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Miten chu hmun chu Tofet an vuah tawh lo vang a, Ben-Hinom ruam an ti tawh hek lo vang. ‘Inthahna ruam’ an ti tawh zâwk ang. Inphûmna tûr hmun dang a awm loh avângin mitthite chu Tofet-ah chuan an phûm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />He mite ruang hi chunglêng savate leh ramsate chaw a ni ang a, tu man an hnawt darh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judai ram khawpuiah te, Jerusalem kawtthlêrah te chuan hlim thâwm te, lâm ri te, mo leh moneitu hlim ri te a reh ang a, ram chu a ṭiau vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chutih hunah chuan Judai ram lal ruh te, Jerusalem-a chêng ruh te chu an thlân aṭangin an phawrh chhuak ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thlahlel taka a rawng an bâwl, an zawna an zuia chibai an bûk ṭhin ni te, thla te leh vâna arsi zawng zawngte hmaah chuan an pho chhuak ang. An senghawi lo vang a, an phûm hek lo vang; leia bawlhhlawh tling khâwm ang an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He hnam sual tak zînga la dam chhunte chuan ka hnawhdarhna hmunahte chuan dam aiin thih an thlang tawh zâwk ang,” tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti’ tiin an hnênah sawi rawh: Mi an tlûkin an tho leh lo vang em ni? Kawng bo pawh an kîr leh lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engati nge Jerusalem mite hi an vah bova, An bo hlen dâwn? Kawng dik lo an zawh tlat a, kîr zai rêng an rêl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngun takin an thu ka ngaithla a, kîr zai rêng an rêl lo. ‘Eng nge ka tih tâk?’ tiin Tu man an sual an sim duh lo; Indona hmun pana sakawr lîm angin, Mahni kawng ṭheuh zawhin an tlân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vân sânga vacha pawhin pêm hun bi a hria a, Ṭhuro te, vamûr te, kanghlai te pawh A hun takah an lo lang ṭhîn a, Ka mite erawh hi chuan Lalpa remruat an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Kan fing a, Lalpa Dân pawh kan hria,’ Engtin nge in tih theih le? In hriat chu lehkhaziaktuten phuahchawpa an ziak mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi fingte chu an zak ang a, Mangannain a nangchîng ang, Lalpa thu an hnâwl a, eng finna nge an neih tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An nupuite mi dang ka pe ang a, An lote pawh mi dangin an nei ang. A tê ber aṭangin a lian ber thlengin duhâmnain an khat a, Zâwlneite leh puithiamte pawhin Mi bum an chîng hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mite hliam chu duhdah takin an tuam a, ‘A ṭha e, a ṭha e,’ an ti a; mahse, a ṭha hauh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil tenawm in tih pawhin in zak lo va, Zah nachâng rêng rêng in hre hek lo. Chuvângin, tlute zîngah chuan in tlu ve ang a, Ka hrem hun che u chuan in tlu dêr ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan, “Anni chu seng khâwm ka duh êm êm a ni, Mahse, grep rah lo leh theipui rah lo ang an ni, An hnahte pawh a vuai vek a, An hnêna ka pêk chu ka chhuhsak leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian mite chuan, ‘Engati nge kan ṭhut reng le? Kal khâwm ila, kulh nei khawpuiahte lût ila, Tah chuan i thi dial ang u. Lalpa laka kan sual avângin Lalpa , kan Pathian chuan, Thi tûrin min ti a, tûr in tûr min pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muanna kan zawng a; mahse, thil ṭha eng mah a thleng lo, Tihdam hun kan thlîr a, ngai teh, thlaphânna mai a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan aṭangin an sakawr hnâr tum ri a hriat a, An sakawr hrâm ri chuan ram pum pui a tizâm ta, Ram leh a chhûnga awm tinrêng, Khawpui leh a chhûnga chêng zawng zawng tichhe tûra lo kal an ni,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in zîngah rûl tûr nei ka rawn tîr ang, Rûl khawi ngam theih loh chu, Chûng chuan a chuk ang che u,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungngaihzia hi hnem rual ka ni lo, Ka rilru a va na tak êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ram dung leh vânga ka mite ṭap thâwm chu ngaithla teh u, ‘Zion-ah Lalpa a awm lâwm ni, A chhûngah a lal a awm na nge?’ ‘Engati nge an milim chher, ram dang pathiante chuan nasa taka min tihthinur tâk le?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipuite mangang chuan, ‘Buh an seng zo va, nipui pawh a tâwp ta a, Chhandam kan la ni si lo,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite lungngaihna ka ṭâwmpui a, Ka ṭap a, mangang takin ka awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead-ah thinghnai damdawi a awm lâwm ni? Tah chuan tidamtu a awm na nge? Engati nge ka mite an dam theih loh?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lu hi tuiin khat se, ka mit hi mittui hnâr ni se, Ka mi, an thahte sûnin a chhûn a zânin ka ṭap tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khualzinte tân thlalêrah thlenna khualbûk awm sela, Ka mite ka kalsan ang a, ka inthiarfihlîm daih tûr. An vaiin an uire a, bumhmang awm khâwm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei chu dâwt sawi tûrin Thal ngul kawih kûl angin a inpeih reng a, “Ram chhûngah dikna aiin dâwt a lal ta. Thil sual an ti zui zêl a, kei mi hre si lo,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭhiante lakah fîmkhur ṭheuh ula, In unaute tu mah ring suh u. Unaute chu bumhmang an ni, Ṭhian pawh chu hêkhmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ṭhian leh ṭhian an inbum a, thu dik sawi rêng an awm lo, Dâwt sawi an inzirtîr a, suahsual bâwlin an hmanhlel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inbum a hluar, bumna hlîr bumna hlîr, Kei mi hre duh si lo.” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, anni chu rangkachak rawh thianghlim angin ka fiah ang, Ka mite chungah hian eng dang nge ka tih tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An lei chu thihna thal ang hi a ni, Mi bumhlum an hnial lo. Ṭhenawmte thlum takin an bia a, Mahse, an chhiatna tûr an zawng ru rân si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng thil avâng hian ka hrem lo vang em ni? Hetiang hnam lakah hian phuba ka la lo vang maw?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lusûn angin tlângte ka ṭah ang a, Hnimhring hmunte a ro zawh tâk avângin Ka ṭap vawng vawng ang. Tu mah an kal tawh lo vang a, Ranrual thâwmte pawh hriat a ni tawh lo vang. Chunglêng savate leh ramsate pawhin an rauhsan dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Jerusalem chu thil chhe vawm khâwm, Sihalte tualchaina hmun a ni ang, Judai ram khawpuite ka tichhe vek ang a, Tu man an luah tawh lo vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei hi hrethiam khawpa fing tu nge awm? Lalpa chuan tu nge puang tûra a hrilh le? Eng vângin nge ram chu a chhiata, Tu ma tlawh loh thlalêr ram ro ang mai a nih tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “An hnêna ka pêk, ka dân chu an hnâwl a, ka aw an ngaithla lo va, an zâwm duh hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />luhlul an chhuah a, an paten an lo zirtîr tawh angin Baal pathian an be ta zâwk a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, he mite hi hnim kha ka eitîr ang a, an in atân tui kha ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anmahni leh an thlahtute pawhin an hriat ngai loh hnam dang zîngah ka hnawt darh ang a, ka tihboral vek hma loh chu khandaihin ka ûm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngaihtuah teh u, mitthi sûn mi hmeichhiate ko ula, Ṭap thiamte pawh lo kal teh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipuite chuan, “Lo kal thuai sela, min rawn ṭahpui teh se, Kan mittui a tlâka, a sûr zung zung theih nân,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion-a ṭap thâwm an hria: “Kan chhe zo va, kan mualpho ta dêr mai; Kan ram kan rauhsan dâwn ta, Kan inte a chhe zo ta si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmeichhiate u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla ula, A sawi hi hre teh u. In fanute ṭah zirtîr ula, Anni chuan an ṭhiante khawhar zai zirtîr ṭheuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kan tukverhahte thihna a lo lâwn a, Kan lal inahte pawh a lût ta a, Kawtthlêra naupangte a la bo va, Tualzâwla tlangvâlte pawh a man ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian sawi rawh a ti: “Bawlhhlawh angin tualah mi ruang a thal pheng phung ang, Buh seng hmaih angin tu man an khâwm lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Mi fingin a finna chhuang suh se, mi chakin a chakna chhuang hek suh se. Mi hausa pawhin a sum leh pai chhuang suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi, leia mite khawngaiha, an chunga dik tak leh fel taka rorêl ṭhîntu ka ni tih hriat chianna chu a chhuang duh chuan chhuang zâwk rawh se chu chu ka lawmzâwng tak a ni si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, nite a lo thleng e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Tisa maia serh tanho zawng zawng ka hrem dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta mi te, Juda mi te, Edom mi te, Amon mi te, Moab mi te leh thlalêra chêng bak ziat kâwnghote chu ka hrem dâwn; chûngho chu serh tan tak an ni lo va, Israel-te ngei pawh thinlung lama serh tan loh an ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite u, In hnêna Lalpa thu sawi hi lo ngaithla teh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hnam dangte awm dân zir suh ula, Vâna chhinchhiahnate hlau hek suh u, Hnam dangten chûng thil chu hlau mah se, Hlau ve suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng mite sakhua hi eng mah a ni lo, Ngawa thing an lâk chu, themthiamin hreiin a tuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangkarua leh rangkachakin a cheimawi a, A tlâk loh nân thîrkilhnain a kilh nghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlai hmuna ṭihkhai an siam ang chauh hi a ni, An ṭawng thei lo va, an kal thei hek lo, Lâk sawn an ngai a ni. Chûng chu hlau suh u, Thil sual an ti thei lo va, thil ṭha an ti thei hek lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang ang tu mah rêng an awm lo; I chak a, i hming a ropui a, thil i tithei bawk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw hnamte Lalber, tu nge ṭih lo vang che? Ṭih chu i phu rêng a ni. Hnam dang mi fingte zîngah leh an lal zawng zawng zîngah Nang ang tu mah rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An chhawih a, an â hle mai, Thing milim, engmahlo chu an zirtîrtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tarsis aṭangin tangkaraw den phêk an rawn la a, Upaz aṭangin rangkachak, Kut themthiamte leh rangkachak chher thiamte siam chu, Puan dumpâwl leh senduk an sintîr a, Chûng zawng zawng chu mi themthiam kutchhuak mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chu Pathian dik, Pathian nung, chatuan lal a ni. A thin a ur chuan lei a nghîng a, Hnamten a thinur an tuar zo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(An hnênah heti hian sawi rawh u: Hêng pathian, lei leh vân siamtu ni lote hi lei ata an la bo vang a, vân hnuai ata an boral ang.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thiltihtheihnain lei a siam a, A finnain khawvêl a din, A hriatnain vân a kai pharh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu a pe a, vâna tuite chu a ri hum hum a, Kâwlkil aṭangin chhûm a chhohtîr a, Ruah leh kâwlphe a siam a, A dahna hmun ata thli a tlehtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An za-in an mâwl a, hriatna rêng an nei lo, Rangkachak chhertuten an milim an zahpui ang a; an milim chhûn chu a lem, nunna nei lo a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hlutna nei lo, hmuhsitawm mai an ni, Hrem an nih hunah an boral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoba Pathian chu hêngte ang hi a ni ve lo, Ani zawng engkim siamtu a ni, Israel pawh a rochan hnam an ni, A hming chu Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In ram chhuahsan tûrin in thawmhnaw tel fel rawh u, An hual reng tawh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chutih hunah chuan ram chhûnga awmte hi ka pawt chhuak ang a, Chek tlawk tlawk khawpin ka tihrehawm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem mite chu, “Kan nâ avângin kan va rethei êm! Kan hliam hi tihdam rual a ni lo. Kan tuar chhuak zo dâwn emaw kan lo ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan puan in a chhia a, a kaihna a chat vek a, Kan faten min kal bosan a, tu mah an awm tawh lo. Kan puan in kaihtu tûr leh A puante kai pharhtu tûr an awm ta lo,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Berâm vêngtute an ngawng a, Lalpa râwn nachâng an hre lo, Chuvângin, an hmuingîl lo va, an berâm rual zawng zawng an darh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai teh u, thu a lo thleng a, Hmâr lam mite inpun khâwm thu chu, Judai ram khawpuite tirama, Sihal chênna hmuna siamtu tûrte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tu mah mahni nun chunga thunei an awm lo tih ka hre ta. Tu man mahni awm dân tûr an rêl thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , min thunun la; mahse, a tâwk têin, Thinur lovin; chutilo chu, kan bo hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hnam dang, nangmah hre ngai lote leh I hming lam ngai lote chungah i thinurna leihbua ang che, Jakoba chu an ei a, an ei zo va, an ei fai ta vek a, A chênna pawh an tiram ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu hei hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />He thuthlung thute hi ngaithla ula, Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hnênah heti hian sawi rawh: “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He thuthlung thu pawisa lote chu ânchhedawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu thuthlung chu in thlahtute, Aigupta ram, thîr rawhtuina thuk ata chu ka hruai chhuah nia ka pêk a ni. Ka thu chu zâwm ula, in hnêna ka thupêk apiang in tih chuan ka mite in ni ang a, kei pawh in Pathian ka ni ang,’ tia ka sawi kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In thlahtute hnêna ka tiam, ‘khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ram, tûna in awmna hi ka pe ang che u,’ tiin ka lo tiam tawh chu ka hlen ang,” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Amen, aw Lalpa ,” tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Hêng thu zawng zawng hi Judai ram khawpuiah te, Jerusalem kawtthlêrah te puang rawh. He thuthlung thute hi ngaithla ula, zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In thlahtute Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah ni aṭanga vawiin thlengin anni chu ṭhahnemngai takin ka zilh reng a, ‘Ka thu ngaithla ula, zâwm rawh u,’ tiin zîng tak taka thovin ka hrilh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, an ngaithla duh lo va, an zâwm hek lo. Luhlul takin ni tin an sual zui zêl a. Ka thupêk an zawm loh avângin ka thuthlunga ânchhia an chungah ka thlentîr ta a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a awmte chu an inthurual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An thlahtu, ka thu ngaithla duh lote sualnaah chuan an kîr a, pathian dangte zuiin an rawngte an bâwl a, Israela chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte chuan an thlahtute hnêna thuthlung ka siam chu an bawhchhe ta,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hre rawh u, an pumpelh theih loh tûr chhiatna an chungah ka thlentîr dâwn, anni chuan min au mah sela, ka ngaithla lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judai ram khawpuia mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte chuan, an pathian, rimtui an hlan ṭhinnate chu panin ṭanpuina an dîl ang a; mahse, an chunga chhiatna a lo thlen hun chuan an ṭanpui thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Juda, i khawpui zât zet pathian i nei a, zahthlâk taka Baal pathian hnêna rimtui hâlna tûr maichâm pawh Jerusalem kawtthlêr zât lai i din ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, hêng mite hi ṭawngṭaisak suh, an tân dîl suh la, ngensak hek suh. An chunga chhiatna a lo thlen hunah min au mah se ka chhâng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka duh tak chuan mi tam tak nêna thil sual ti chungin Ka Tempulah chanvo eng nge a neih tawh ang? Inthawina sa a hlante chuan hrem a pumpelhtîr thei ang em? Suahsual bâwl reng chungin a hlim thei dâwn em ni?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Oliv thing mawi, rah duh tak,’ Lalpa chuan a ti che a, Mahse, thlipui ri hum hum anga nasa mei a kantîr ang che, I zârte pawh a kâng ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngten thil ṭha lo tak tiin Baal hnênah rimtui an hâl a, min tihthinur avângin Engkim Lalpa chuan in chhiatna tûr a puang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi min phiarna chu min hrilh a, ka hre ve ta, An thil sual tihte chu min hmuhtîr ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei zawng berâmno ngam tak, talh tûra an hruai ang ka lo ni, ‘Thing chu a rah chawpin kit ila, Mi nung ram ata i sawn bo daih ang u; Tichuan, a hming pawh an hre tawh dâwn lo nia,’ Ti-a min phiarrûkna chu ka lo hre rêng rêng lo mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang zawng, Engkim Lalpa , dik taka rorêltu, Rilru leh thinlung enfiahtu i ni. An chunga phuba i lâk chu mi hmuhtîr ang che. I hnênah ka inkawltîr tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anathot mi, nangmah thah tuma, ‘ Lalpa hmingin thu sawi tawh suh, i sawi chuan kan that ang che,’ titute chungchâng chu Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, anni chu ka hrem dâwn, an tlangvâlte chu indonaah an thi ang a, an fanu leh fapate pawh ṭâm tuarin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hrem an tuar kumah Anathot mite chungah chuan chhiatna ka thlentîr ang a, thi bâng rêng an awm lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chungah phunnawi fo mah ila, Nang zawng i dik ṭhîn a ni. Mahse, i rorêl dân hi ka zâwt a che, “Engati nge mi suaksualte an hmuingîl viauva, Mi rinawm lote nuamsa taka an khawsak le?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chu i phun a, zung an kai a, An ṭhang lian a, an lo rah ṭhîn. An awkain an fak che a, An thinlung erawh chuan a hlat si che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin kei chu mi hria a, I chunga ka rilru put dânte i hre vek a, Anni erawh chu berâm talh tûr angin hnûkchhuak la, Talh hun tûr ruatsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eng chen nge ram chuan a tuar anga, Hmun tina hnimte chu a vuai ang? A chhûnga chêngte sualna avângin Ramsate leh savate chu an boral a, Chûng mite chuan, “Kan awm dân hi a hmu hlei nem,” an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihring pawhin an ûm chauh hle che chuan, Engtin nge sakawrte chu i tluk tehlul ang? Hmun râlmuangah pawh i him loh chuan Jordan ngawah engtin nge i awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I unau, in chhûngkaw zînga mi ngei chuan an bum che a, Ring takin an aukhum che, Ṭha taka an biak che pawhin anni chu ring suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka in ka chhuahsan a, ka rochan chu ka hnâwl, Ka duh tak chu a hmêlmate kutah ka pe ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka rochante chu ka tân ngawa sakeibaknei ang an ni, Mi rûmkhum a; chuvângin, ka hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka rochante chu sava ang mai an ni, Muin a hêl a hêl mai; Ramsa kawlhte ko khâwm ula, an sa rawn ei zo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Berâmputen ka grep huan an tichhia a, An chîl hrep a, Ka lo ṭha tak chu ram rovah an chantîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram hluihlâwnah an siam zo va, a ro vawng vawng mai, Ram pum pui chu an tiro zo va, tu man pawi an ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlalêr tlâng kawlh vel vulahte chuan Tichhetu an lo pung khâwm a, Lalpa khandaih chuan ram dung leh vânga mite a that ang a, Tu mah him an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Buh an tuh ang a, hlîng an seng ang, Thawk tam hle mah se, hlâwkna eng mah an hmu lo; Lalpa thinurna nasa tak avâng chuan, Buh an seng chhunte chu an zahpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi Israel-te hnêna rochan tûr ka pêk lâksaktu, ka ṭhenawma mi sualte chungthu chu Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “An ram aṭangin ka pawt chhuak ang a, Juda chhûngte chu an zîng ata ka la chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anni chu ka pawh chhuah hnuah chuan ka khawngaih leh ang a, mi tin an rochan ṭheuh ka pe leh ang a, anmahni ram ngeiah ka hruai kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mite chu Baal hming chhâlin thutiam an lo zirtîr ṭhîn a, chutiang bawkin ‘ Lalpa , mi nung hming chhâla thutiam’ an zir ve hunah ka mite awm dân an la ang a, an zîngah an tel ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, ngaithla duh lo hnam apiang chu ka pawt chhuak ang a, ka tiboral ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian min hrilh a, “Kal la, hrênpuan zai sîn lei la, i kâwngah vêt la, tuiah chiah suh ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thupêk angin puan zai sîn chu ka lei a, ka kâwngah ka vêt ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tho la, i hrênpuan ven lai kha keng la, Eufretis luiah kalpui la, chuta lung keh kârah chuan thukru rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa min hrilh ang chuan Eufretis luiah ka kal a, ka thukru ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni rei tak hnuah chuan Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Tho la, Eufretis luiah kal la, hrênpuan ka thuhrûktîr che kha la leh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Eufretis luiah chuan ka kal a, ka han hai a, ka thuhrûkna hmun ata puan chu ka la chhuak a; mahse, a lo mawih vek a, eng atân mah hman tlâk a ni tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hetiang tak hian Juda-te chapona leh Jerusalem inchhuanna chu ka tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng mi suaksual, ka thu ngaithla duh lova, luhlul taka khawsa ṭhîn, pathian dang rawngbâwla be ṭhînte hi he hrênpuan, eng maha tlâk lo ang hi an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miin hrênpuan an kâwnga an vêt reng ṭhîn ang hian, Israel chhûngkua leh Juda chhûngkua zawng zawng chu ka hnêna awm tlat tûr leh min faka min chawimawia ka mi ni tûrin ka ruat a; mahse, an ngaithla duh lo,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hetiangin an hnênah thu sawi rawh: “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Uain bûr zawng zawngah uain thun khat rawh u.’ Anni chuan i hnênah, ‘Bûr zawng zawng uaina thun khah tûr tih kan hre ve lo vem ni?’ an tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />heti hian hrilh ang che, ‘Ngai teh u, he rama chêng, Davida ṭhutthlêng luahtu lal te, puithiam te, zâwlnei te leh Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawng te chu ka hrai rui hnêp dâwn, Lalpa chuan a ti.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chu ka inchaltauhtîr ang a, pa leh fate pawh an intauh ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Khawngaihna te, lainatna te, hmangaihnate tel hauh lovin ka tiboral ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa thu sawi hi ngaithla ula, pawisa rawh u, Inchhuang suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian hi chawimawi ula, Khua a tihthima, tlâng hliah thimah in tlûk hma hian, êng in nghâkhlel a; Mahse, khawdur thim chhah mup a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hei hi in ngaihthlâk duh loh chuan In chapo avângin a rûkin ka ṭap ang, Ka mittui a far zawih zawih ang, Lalpa berâmte sala an man dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Lal leh lalnu heti hian hrilh rawh u. ‘In lalṭhutthlêng ata chhuk rawh u, In lallukhum ropui chu in lu ata hlih thlâk a ni dâwn e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim lam ram khawpui zawng zawng an hual tlat ta, Chhuahna rêng rêng a awm tawh lo; Juda mi zawng zawng salah an man ang a, An hruai fai vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dâk ula, hmâr lam ata hmêlma lo kalte saw, I ranrual vên lai, i berâm duhawm takte kha khaw nge an awm tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭhian ṭhaa i ngaihin a rawn rûn thut che chuan Eng nge i sawi tâk ang? Hmeichhe nau vei angin na i ti hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Eng vângin nge hêng hi ka tuar?’ I ti rilru a nih chuan, i sual vâng a ni, I pawnfên an hlihsak che a, an sawisa che a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ethiopia mi hângin a vun a tidanglamin Keitein a zia a thup thei em? Nangni thil sual tiṭhangte hian thil ṭha in ti thei ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlalêr thliin buhsi a lên darh angin Ka tidarh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Min theihnghilh a, dâwta in innghah avângin, Hei hi i chan ve, i tâna ka ruat chu a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin i pawnfên chu i hmai khuh vek khawpin ka hlîm ang a, I lang fai vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I uire hrâtzia te, i nuamtâwl ri te, Zah nachâng hre lova i inphalraizia te ka hria. Daipâwna tlângah te i chêt bawlhhlawhzia pawh ka hmu, Aw Jerusalem, i chung a pik e, Eng hunah tak thianghlim leh ang che maw?
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawkhêng chungchânga Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judai ram chuan a tuar a, A kulh kawngkhârte a chhe rem rum mai. Mite chu lungngaiin leiah an bawk a. Jerusalem-ah an ṭap chuah chuah e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An mi ṭhaten an chhiahhlawh tuichawi tûrin an tîr a, Tuikhuah an pan, tui an hmu lo, Tuibêl ruak an hâwnpui, zak tak leh beidawng takin An lu an khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramah ruahtui a tlâk loh avângin lei a khichat ta, Lo neitute an mangang a, an lu an khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ramhnuaia zukpuiin no a nei a, Hnimhring awm loh vângin a tlânsan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlâng chârah ramsabengtung a ding, Sihal angin a thaw hlawp hlawp; Hnimhring peh tûr a awm loh avângin An mit a vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan sualnaten min timualpho mah se, I hming avângin, aw Lalpa min pui teh, Nasa takin kan hnungtawlh a, i chungah kan lo sual ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw nang, Israel-te nghahfâk, mangan laia chhantu, Engtizia nge he ramah hian khualzin, Zan khat riak ang leka i awm le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engati nge phâwk hmêl i puta, Mi dang hum thei lo mi chak ang mai i nih tâk le? Mahse, aw Lalpa , kan hnênah i awm a, I hming putu kan ni a, min kalsan suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hêng mite chungchâng hetiang hian a sawi: ‘Vah bo an châk hle a, an insûm thei hauh lo.’ Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan anni chu a lâwm lo va, An thil sual tih a hre reng a, An sual avângin a hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng mite ṭhatna tûr hi dîlsak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chaw nghei mah sela an au ka ngaithla lo vang. An hâlral leh an thilhlante chu ka pawm lo vang a; anni chu khandaih te, ṭâm te leh hripui tein ka tiboral zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei chuan, “E, Lalpa P athian , zâwlneiten ‘khandaih leh ṭâm in tuar lo vang, hemi hmunah hian muanna kumhlun in nei zâwk ang,’ tiin an sawi si a!” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah: “Chûng zâwlneite chuan ka hmingin dâwtin thu an hril ṭhîn a ni; anni chu ka tîr lo va, thu ka pe lo va, an hnênah thu ka sawi hek lo. Inlârna lem te, aien rin tlâk loh te, an rin thu phuahchawp te in hnênah an puang zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ka hminga thu sawia, ‘he ramah hian indona leh ṭâm a thleng dâwn lo’ titu zâwlneite chu ka tirh an ni lo. Chûng zâwlneite chu khandaih leh ṭâmin ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An thu hril lo dawngsawngtute pawh chu Jerusalem kawtthlêrahte chuan khandaih leh ṭâm tuarin an tlu phung ang a, tu man an phûm lo vang. Chutiang thil chu an nupui te, an fapa te, an fanute chungah pawh a lo thleng ang. An sual avângin chhiatna nasa tak an chungah ka thlentîr dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He thu hi an hnênah hrilh rawh mi ti a: A chhûn a zân ka mittui luang se, hul lai rêng nei suh se; Ka mi, ka fanu, nula thianghlim chuan Hliam a tuar e, hliam na tak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Daipâwna ka kal leh khandaiha thah mi tam tak ka hmu a, Khaw chhûnga ka luhin ṭâmpui tuara thi ka hmu bawk si; Zâwlnei leh puithiamte meuh pawhin An hriat ngai loh ram an pan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda chu i paihthla ta dêr em ni? Zion pawh i ten ta em ni? Dam rual lovin engati nge min hliam le? Muanna kan beisei a, thil ṭha eng mah a thleng lo, Tihdam hun kan nghâk a; mahse, thlaphânna kan tawng si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan sual tih kan hria e, Min thlahtute bawhchhiatna pawh kan hria, I lakah kan lo sual takzet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hming a chhiat loh nân min hmusit lo la, I lalṭhutthlêng ropui chu timualpho suh, Kan hnêna i thuthlung hre reng la, bawhchhe suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnam dang pathiante zîngah Ruah tisûr thei an awm em ni? A nih, vânte pawh khian ruah an titla thei em ni? Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian, nang chauh hi kan innghahna i ni a, Hêng thil zawng zawng titu hi nang hi i ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Mosia leh Samuela pawh ka hmaah hêng mite tân lo ding mah se, ka ngaihsak chuang lo vang. Ka hma ata hnawt chhuak ula, kal botîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Khawiah nge kan kal ang?’ an tih chuan hei hi an kalna tûra Lalpa sawi chu a ni tih hrilh rawh u: Ṭhenkhat hripuiin an thi ang a, Ṭhenkhat indonaah an thi ang a. Ṭhenkhat tâm tuarin an thi ang a, Ṭhenkhat salah an man ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichhetu tûr thil pali ka ruat chu hêng hi a ni, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: Thattu tûr khandaih te, an sa pu bo tûr ui te, chunglêng sava te leh ramsa, anmahni tihluma an sa ei zotu tûr te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Juda lal Hezekia fapa Manasea thiltih avângin khawvêl lalramten râpthlâk an tih atân anni chu ka siam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Jerusalem, tu nge khawngaih ang che? Tu nge ṭah ang che? ‘Eng nge i chanchin?’ tiin tu nge chiauau ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangin min duh lo va, min hawisan ta,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Chuvângin, i chungah kut ka thlâk ta a ni, ka tiboral ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ram chhûng khaw tin aṭangin ka zâp darh ang a, Ka mite chu ka tiboral ang, an fate pawh ka tihlum ang, An nun sual an sim loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipui kama ṭiau aia tam hmeithai ka awmtîr ang a, An vânglaiin an tlangvâlte ka tihlum a, An nuten an tuar. Lungngaihna leh manganna an chungah ka thlentîr thut ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fa pasarih hringtu nu chu a chau va, A thidang a, chhûn laiin a ni a liam a, A mualpho va, a chan a chhe hle, A dam chhunte pawh an hmêlmaten khandaihin an that ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram puma mi tin hnialkalhtu leh dodâltu atân ka nuin mi lo hring hi ka va han vânduai tak êm! Ka pûktîr lo va, ka batsak hek lo; mahse, an za-in ânchhia min lawh si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Chhan ṭha tak avângin ka hum ngei ang che. Mangan ni leh chhiatna ni a lo thlen hunin i hmêlmate chu i hmaah ka kûntîr ang a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thîr, hmâr lam thîr ngên pawlh chu a tihtliah theih em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram puma in suahsualna avângin in hausakna te, in ro hlu zawng zawngte chu râllâk sumah a thlâwnin ka pe vek dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I hmêlmate sal atân ka siam ang che, i hriat ngai loh ramah chuan. Ka thinur chu mei angin a alh ang a, a kâng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin i hria a, Min hre reng la, min ngaihsak ang che, Min tiduhdahtute chungah phuba la la, I dawhtheih êm avângin min tiboral suh se. Nangmah avângin hau ka tuar tih hria ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I thu lo thleng chu ka zâwm a, I thute chu ka tân hlimna, ka thinlung tilâwmtu ber a ni, Aw Lalpa , Engkim P athian , i hming chu ka lam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nuam tâwlho zîngah ka tel lo va, ka hlimpui hek lo, Mahni chauhvin ka awm hi nangin min chelh tlat si a, Min tithinur hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Engtizia nge ka na a dam theih loh? Ka hliamte pawh tihdam rual loh a nih tâk hi? Ka tân kawrte rin tlâk loh, ṭhâla kang leh mai ang hi i ni em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “I lamlêt chuan ka tungding leh ang che a, Ka rawng i bâwl ang, Dâwt sawi lova thutak i sawi ṭhin chuan Ka thu puangtu i ni ang a, Miten an rawn pan ang che a, I pan a ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />He mite hmaah hian ngên kulh bangah ka siam ang che, An bei ang che; mahse, an hneh lo vang che. Chhan tûr leh humhim tûr chein i hnênah ka awm,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mi sualte kut ata ka chhan ang che a, Mi nunrâwngte lakah ka humhim ang che.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah heti hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nupui i nei tûr a ni lo va, he hmunah hian fanu fapa i nei tûr a ni hek lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hemi hmuna fanu fapa piangte leh anmahni hringtu nu leh pate chungthu chu heti hian Lalpa chuan a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Râpthlâk takin an thi ang a, tu man an ṭah lo vang a, phûm lohvin bawlhhlawh angin an awm phung ang. Khandaih leh ṭâm tuarin an thi ang a, an ruangte chu chunglêng savate leh ramsate chaw a ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Khawhar inah lêng suh la, sûnpui tûr leh ṭanpui tûrin kal hek suh. Ka thlamuanna te, ka khawngaihna te, ka lainatna te hêng mite lak aṭang hian ka la kiang tawh si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“He rama mi hausa leh retheite chu an thi ang a, tu man an phûm lo vang. Anmahni sûnin tu mah an inzai lo vang a, an inziat kawlh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lusûn chhûngte chu thlamuan tûrin tu man ei tûr an hlui lo vang; an nu leh pate hnêm tûrin tu man in tûr an pe hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ruai ṭhehna inah lût suh la, an zîngah eiin in hek suh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, in dam chhûng ngei hian in mit hmuhah hlim leh lâwm thâwm te, mo leh a pasal hlim thâwm te he hmun ata hi ka titâwp vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hêng thil zawng zawng hi hêng mite i hrilh hunah annin, ‘Engati nge hetiang chhiatna nasa tak hi Lalpa chuan kan chunga a thlentîr le? Thil dik lo eng nge kan tiha, kan Pathian chungah eng nge kan tihsual?’ an tih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />heti hian hrilh ang che: ‘In pate chuan min hawisan a, pathian dang biain an rawng an bâwl a, min theihnghilh a, ka dânte an zâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangni phei chu in pate aiin in la sual sauh va, tu man ka thu in zâwm lo va, luhlul takin in thu thuin in awm tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni leh in pate hriat loh ramah ka hnawt chhuak ang che u; tah chuan a chhûn a zân pathian dangte rawng in bâwl ang a, ka duhsak tawh dâwn lo che u a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “ ‘Aigupta ram ata Israel-te hruaichhuaktu Lalpa chu a nung alâwm,’ an ti tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘A tihdarhna hmun, hmâr lam ata hruaikhâwmtu Lalpa chu a nung alâwm,’ an ti tawh zâwk ang. An pate ka pêk ram ngeiah ka hruaikîr leh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngai teh, sangha man mi tam tak anmahni man tûrin ka tîr dâwn e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Chumi hnuah chuan tlâng tin leh mual tin lung keh kâr chen khawrh chhuak tûr sapêl mi tam tak ka tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An awm dân zawng zawng ka hmu reng a, hmuh loh rêng rêng ka nei lo; an sualnate ka hmuh phâk loh a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ram chu milem pathian, nunna nei lo leh pathian lemtein an tihbawlhhlawh avângin an khawlohna leh an sualnate chu a lehhnihin ka thungrûl ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi tichaktu leh mi hum ṭhîntu, Mangan nia ka phen tûr, Hnamte chu kâwlkil ata i hnênah an lo kal ang a, Kan pate chuan pathian lem, Hlutna leh ṭangkaina rêng nei lo milem An rochung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihringin pathian a siam thei dâwn em ni? Chutiang pathian chu Pathian tak a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chuvângin, tûn ṭum na na na chu ka thiltihtheihzia leh chakzia anni chu ka han hriattîr leh teh ang; tichuan, ka hming chu Lalpa a ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda-te sualna chu thîr kawlawm leh lunghlu zumin an thinlungah fiah taka ziak a ni, an maichâm kiahte pawh ker a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chuan an pathian Aseri, tlâng sâng thingbuk hnuaia awmte chu an bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang, daipâwn tlânga milem betu, i hausakna leh i ro hlu zawng zawng chu ram chhûng hmun tina i sualna avângin râllâk sum atân ka sem ral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I chanpual atâna ka pêk che kha i sual avângin i chân ang. I laka ka thinrim mei anga a alh reng avângin i hriat ngai loh ramah i hmêlmate rawng i bâwl ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Mihring rinchhana, mihring bân tha chakna ringa, Lalpa hmusittu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chu thlalêr hnim ro rire ang a ni, Thil lo thleng tûr, thil ṭha a hmu lo vang, Thlalêr ram ro, lei al, tu ma luah lohvah chuan a chêng zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa ringtu, innghah nâna Lalpa hmangtu chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu mi chu tui kianga thing phun, lui kama zung kai, Khaw lum lo thleng pawh hlau lo, a hnah hring reng, khawkhên kum pawh pawisa lo, Rah ṭhulh chuang lo ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thinlung hi thil dang zawng aia bumhmang, Siam ṭhat harsa khawpa chhia a ni a, Tu nge hrethiam thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi rilru entu, thinlung fiahtu ka ni; Mi tin an thiltih ang zêlin lâwmman ka pe ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kut tling lova hausa chu varung, mahni tui ni lo awp keu ang a ni, A vânglai takin a hausakna chuan a kalsan ang a, A âtzia a la lang mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng ropui tak, a tîr ata chawisân chu, Kan Hmun Thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Israel-te nghahfâk, Nangmah kalsantu zawng zawng chu an mualpho vang, Lalpa , nunna tuikhur chu an kalsan che avângin Vaivuta hming ziak angin an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi tidam la; Tichuan, ka dam viah ang; Mi hum la; tichuan, ka him ngei ang, Nang zawng ka chawimawi ṭhîn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka hnênah heti hian an ti ṭhîn: ‘Khawiah nge Lalpa thu chu? Tûnah lo thleng ang hmiang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhiatna thlentîr tûrin ka nawr lo che, Chhiatna thlentîr hi ka duhzâwng a ni lo tih i hria, Ka ṭawngka chhuakte chu nangin i hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tân ṭihbaiawm ni suh la, Mangan nia ka inhumhimna i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Min tiduhdahtute chu mualpho sela, Kei erawh chu mualpho lo ila, Anni chu zâm sela, kei erawh chu zâm lo ila, An chungah chhiatna thlentîr la, Tiboral hmiah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Kal la, kulh kawngka lûn ber, Juda lalte an luha an chhuahnaah va ding la, Jerusalem luhna kawngka dang zawng zawngah pawh ding zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An hnênah heti hian sawi rawh: ‘Nangni Juda lal te, Judai rama chêng zawng zawng te, Jerusalem-a awm, hêng kawngkaa lût ṭhînte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Sabat nia thil phur lo tûrin in nun vawng ṭha rawh u, Jerusalem kawngkaahte chuan thil phur chungin lût rêng rêng suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sabat niin in in ata eng mah phur chhuak hek suh u, hna pawh thawk suh u. In pute hnêna ka thupêk ang khân sabat ni hi serh thianghlim ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni chuan ka thupêk chu an ngaithla lo va, an ngaihven hek lo. An beng an chhungawng a, zilhna an pawm duh lo va, an ngaithla duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: Tihtakzetin ka thu pawisa ula, Sabat niin he khawpui kawngkaahte hian thil phur lût suh ula, Sabat ni serh thianghlim ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tichuan, Davida ṭhutthlênga ṭhu lalte leh hotute chu sakawr-tawlailîr leh sakawr chunga chuangin Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte nên he khawpui kawngkaah hian an lo lût ang a, he khawpui hi an luah hlen tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judai ram khawpui aṭang te, Jerusalem chhehvêl khua aṭang te, Benjamin bial aṭang te, thlang lam phaikin aṭang te, tlângram aṭang te leh chhim lam aṭang te chuan hâlral thilhlan leh chhangphut thilhlan te kengin mite chu an rawn inthawi ang a; rimtui te, lâwmthu sawina inthawina te Lalpa inah an rawn hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Sabat hman thianghlim thu-ah te, Sabat nia Jerusalem kawngkaa thil phurh luh khap thu-ah te ka thu in zawm loh chuan Jerusalem kawngkaahte mei mit thei lo ka dah ang a, lal inte nên a kâng ral vek ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho la, bêlvawtu inah zu kal la, tah chuan thu ka hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, bêlvawtu inah ka zu kal a, ani chuan khâwl hmangin bêl a lo vua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a bêl siam chu ṭha a tih loh chuan bêl dangah a siam leh mai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw Israel fate u, he bêlvawtu tih ang hian in chungah ka ti thei lo vem ni? tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Nangni Israel fate u, bêlvawtu kuta hlum ang mai hian ka kutah in awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eng hunah pawh, hnam emaw, lalram emaw chungthuah, ‘ka pawt chhuak ang a, ka ṭhiat ang a, ka tichhe vek ang’ tiin lo sawi tawh mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />chu hnam chuan an thil tihsual an sim chuan an chunga thil ṭha lo tih ka tum chu ka ṭhulh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eng hunah pawh hnam emaw, lalram emaw chungthuah ‘ka din ang a, ka siam ang’ lo ti mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka mit hmuha thil sual an tiha, ka thu an ngaihthlâk loh chuan thil ṭha tihsak ka tum chu ka sût leh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte hnênah Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, in chungah thil ṭha lo tih ka tum a, ka ruahman mêk a. Chuvângin, mi tinin in thil tihsualte sim ula, in awm dân leh in thiltih ṭha lote hawisan rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chuan, “A ho êm mai, kan duh duhin kan awm ang; kan duh leh luhlul kan chhuah ang a, kan duh leh suahsual kan chhuah ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hnam dangte zâwt teh rêng u, Tu nge hetiang thil hi hre tawh ngai le? Nula, Israel chuan thil râpthlâk tak a tih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng lungpuite chu vûrin a kiansan ngai em? Tlâng aṭanga tui vâwt tak lo chhuak chu a kang ngai em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite erawh chuan min theihnghilh a, Milem tlâktlailo hnênah rimtui an hâl. Hmasânga an kal ṭhinna kawng chu an pênsan a, Kawngpui zawh lovin ṭumkawngah an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An ram an tirâlṭi zo va, kumkhuaa hmusitawmin a awm ta, Veivâk apiangin mak an ti a, an lu an thinkhum ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawchhak thliin vaivut a lên darh angin, Anni chu hmêlma hmaah ka tidarh ang, An mangan ni-ah ka tukkhum chhah ka chhawn ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mite chuan, “Hawh u, Jeremia hi i phiar ang u, dân min zirtîrtu tûr puithiam te, thurâwn min petu tûr mi fing te, thu min hrilhtu tûr zâwlneite an awm zêl tho vang. Hawh u, sawichhe bawrh bawrh ila, a thu i ngaithla duh lo vang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min ngaihsak teh, aw Lalpa , Min beitute hi hria ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil ṭha suala thungrûlh tûr em ni? Anni chuan ka tlâk nân khur an lai a, An laka i thinur la kiang tûra I hnêna ka ngensak kha hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An fate chuan ṭâmpui mitthi tuar sela, Khandaih hriam tawng rawh se, An pate chu hripuiin thi sela, An nute chuan an fa sûn sela, hmeithai rawh se, An tlangvâlte pawh indonaah sah hlum ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka tlâk nân khur an lai a, Ka kalnaah thang an kam avângin Râlin bei thut sela, an inah ṭap chuah chuah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi thah tuma min phiar dân zawng zawng i hria a, An bawhchhiatnate ngaidam suh la, I mit hmuha an sualnate thai bo hek suh, I hmaah thehthal dêr la, Thinur ni-ah sawisa hrep ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kal la, bêlvawtu hlum bêl va lei la, mipui zînga puipa te, puithiam zînga puipate hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harsit kawngkhâra chhuakin Ben-Hinom ruamah chuan kal la; tah chuan, thu ka hrilh tûr che chu puang ang che.fate an hlanna hmun hi ngaisâng tawh lovin a nihna tak ‘inthahna ruam’ an ti dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heti hian sawi ang che: ‘Juda lalte leh Jerusalem-a awmte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u. Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, he hmunah hian chhiatna râpthlâk tak ka thlentîr dâwn, a hria apiang an khûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite chuan min kalsan a, hemi hmun hi ram dang pathian biak nân an hmang a, anmahni leh an thlahtu te, Juda lalte pawhin an hriat ngai loh pathian lem hnênahte rimtui an hâl a, pawi sawi lo thisenin he hmun hi an tikhat ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baal hnêna hâlral thilhlana an fate an hlanna tûr, Baal hmunsâng an siam a; chûng thil chu ti tûrin thu ka pe lo va, ka hrilh hek lo, ngaihtuah pawh ka ngaihtuah ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh, ni te a lo thleng dâwn e, tih hi Lalpa thu chhuak a ni. He hmun hi Tofet ruam an ti tawh lo vang a, Ben-Hinom ruam an ti tawh hek lo vang, inthahna ruam an ti tawh zâwk ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hemi hmunah hian Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a mite remruatte chu ka tichhia ang a, an hmêlma, anmahni thah tumtute chuan khandaihin an sât hlum ang. An ruang chu chunglêng savate leh ramsate ei atân ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He khawpui hi mite hmuhsit atân ka tichhe vek ang a, a kal apiangin a chhiat nasatzia an hmuhin mak tiin an chek tlawk tlawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thah tumtu, an hmêlmate chuan an hualbet tlat ang a; tichuan, an fanu leh fapate sa an ei hial ang. Anmahni ngei pawh an sa an ineisak ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I kalpuite mit hmuhah hlumbêl chu tikeh la, an hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He hmun leh he khawpui hi he bêl ang hian ka tichhia ang a, siam ṭhat theih rual a ni tawh lo vang. Phûmna tûr hmun dang a awm loh avângin mitthite chu Tofet-ah an phûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />He hmun leh a chhûnga chêngte chungah he thil hi ka ti dâwn,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. He khawpui hi Tofet angin a siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem in te, Judai ram lal inte leh vân arsite hnêna rimtui hâla; pathian dangte hnêna thil an hlanna ṭhin hmun zawng zawng chu Tofet hmun anga tenawm an ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeremia chu Lalpan thu sawi tûra a tirhna hmun Tofet aṭang chuan a lo kîr a, Lalpa in hung chhûngah a ding a, chuta awm zawng zawng hnênah heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Chhiatna lo thleng tûr ka sawi zawng zawng kha he khawpui leh a chhehvêl khuaahte hian a thleng dâwn e, ka thu in ngaithla duh lo va, luhlul in chhuah luih tlat avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam Pasura, Imera fapa, Lalpa ina hotu ber chuan chûng thute chu Jeremian a sawi tih a lo hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tichuan, Pasura chuan zâwlnei Jeremia chu a vua a, kawl a buntîr a, Lalpa in, Benjamin kawngkhâr chhakta zâwk bulah chuan a tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tûkah Jeremia kawl bun chu a phelhsak a, a chhuah ta a. Jeremia chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan i hmingah Pasura ti tawh lovin Magor Misabib a ti tawh zâwk a che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh, i tân leh i ṭhiante zawng zawng tân hlauhawmah ka siam ang che. I mit hmuhah anni chu i hmêlmaten khandaihin an that ang a, Juda mi zawng zawng Babulon lal kutah ka pe ang. Ani chuan Babulon-ah salah a hruai ang a, khandaihin a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, he khawpui hausakna zawng zawng te, a deh chhuah ro hlu zawng zawng te, Juda lal sum leh pai zawng zawngte pawh an hmêlmate kutah ka hlân ang. Anni chuan an rawk ang a, an lâksak ang a, Babulon-ah an phur hâwng ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang pawh, Pasur, i ina awm zawng zawng nên salah an man ang che a, Babulon-ah i kal ve ang. Chutah chuan i thi ang a, an phûm ang che; nang leh i ṭhian dâwt thu i lo hrilhte nên khân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin min bum a, bum ka nih tâk hi, Nang chu kei aiin i chak a, min titlâwm ta, Nilêngin min deusawh a, mi tin nuihzatbûr ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu ka sawi apiangin Inpâwngnêkna leh intihchhiatna nasatzia ka aupui ṭhîn, Lalpa thu ka hnêna lo thleng avâng chuan Nilênga hmuhsit ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Ani chu ka hre reng lo vang a, A hmingin thu ka sawi tawh hek lo vang,’ ka tih pawhin Ruh chhûnga mei sa awm ang maiin Ka thinlungah mi tûr ut ut a. Ka pai hle hle thei ngang lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tam tak phun ru ka hria, Kil tinah hlauhawmin min hual, ‘Hêk rawh u, keini pawhin kan hêk ang,’ an ti. Ka ṭhenrual zawng zawng, ka tlûk hun châng rengte chuan ‘Thlêm thlûk a nih hunah kan ngam ang a, A chungah phuba kan la ang,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa , mi chak, mi huaisen chu ka hnênah a awm a. Mi tiduhdahtute chu an tlu ang a, min hneh lo vang; An mualpho hle dâwn, an hlawhtling dâwn si lo, An hmingchhiatna chu kumkhuain theihnghilh a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rilru leh thinlung hmu vektu, An chunga i phuba lâk lai mi hmuhtîr la, Kei erawh chu i kutah ka inkawltîr tawh si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa fak ula, Lalpa chu chawimawi rawh u, Mi sualte kut ata chanhaite a chhanhim si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pian ni chu ânchhedawngin awm se, Ka nuin min hrin ni chu chawimawi ni suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa hnêna, ‘Fapa i nei ta,’ tih thu hrilha, Tilâwmtu pawh chu ânchhedawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lainat hauh lova Lalpan khawpui a tihchhiat angin Chu mi chu awm sela, Zîngah ṭap thâwm, chhûnah râlkhêl thâwm hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhûlah khân min lo tihlum se, Ka nu chhûl chu ka thlan a ni mai tûr, A chhûlah chuan ka awm reng mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Engah kher nge chhûl ata ka lo chhuah, Thawkrim leh lungngaia awm mai tûr leh Mualpho rêng rênga ka dam chhûng hmang ral tûr hian?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Zedekian Malkia fapa Pasura leh Maaseia fapa puithiam Zefania te chu Jeremia hnênah a kaltîr a, chutih laia Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu thu min zawhsak teh, Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chuan min bei ta si a. Lalpa chuan kan tân thil mak tiin a hnawtkîr dâwn em?” an va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeremia chuan an hnênah, “Zedekia chu heti hian va hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh, Babulon lal leh in kulh hualtu Kaldai-ho i dona hriamhrei hman lai chu ka chelhbehsak ang che a. Khawpui chhûngah chuan hmêlmate ka hruai lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin ka bân chak tak pharin thinrim tâwpkhâwk leh diriam tak chungin ka bei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He khawpuia chêng, mihring leh ran zawng zawng ka nghaisa ang a, hripuiin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan, he khawpuia chêng Juda lal Zedekia leh a chhiahhlawhte hripui leh khandaihte leh ṭâm tuartea thi bâng zawng zawng chu Babulon lal Nabukadnezara kutah te, anmahni thah tumtu, an hmêlmate kutahte ka pe ang. Anni chuan khandaih hriamin an that ang a, an khawngaih lo vang a, an lainat hek lo vang,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hêng mite hnênah heti hian va sawi rawh: Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh u, thihna kawng emaw, nunna kawng emaw, in duh zâwk thlan tûr ka siam a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He khawpuia awm reng duh chu ṭâm te, khandaih te, hripui te tuarin an thi ang. Amaherawhchu, kal chhuaka, nangmahni hualtu Kaldai-ho hnêna inpete chu râlin an man ang; mahse, an nun chu a him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He khawpui hi a ṭhat nân ni lovin a chhiat nân ka hawisan tawh,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Babulon lal kutah ka pe ang a, anin meiin a hâl chhe vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Juda lal chhûngte chuan hei hi hre rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chhûngte u, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Tûk tin dik takin ro rêl ula, Rawk tuar chu a tiduhdahtu kut ata chhan rawh u; Chutilo zawng, in thil sual tihte avângin Ka thinrim mei angin a alh dah ang e, Tu ma tihmih theih a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangni tlângchhîp zâwl, lungpui chunga chêngte u, ‘Tu nge min bei tûr lo kal anga, Kulh chhûngah lo lût ang?’ tite u, Ka ngei hle che u a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“In thil tih ang zêlin ka hrem ang che u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “An ram ngaw chu ka hâl ang a, A chhehvêl ram zawng zawng a kâng chhia ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda lal inah zu kal la; tah chuan he thu hi sawi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Aw nang, Juda lal, Davida ṭhutthlêng luahtu, i ṭhuihruai, he kawngkhâra lût ṭhînte leh i mite nên Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Dik tak leh fel takin ro rêl ula, rawk tuarte chu tiduhdahtu kut ata chhan rawh u. Mikhual te, fahrah te, hmeithai te chungah dik lo taka tiin tharum thawh suh u, he hmunah hian pawi sawi lo thisen in chhuah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thute hi ṭha taka in zawm chuan Davida lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu lalte chu an chhiahhlawhte leh an mite nên sakawr-tawlailîrah te, sakawr chungahte chuangin he in kawngkhârah hian an vei tlang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hêng thute hi in zawm loh chuan he in hi a ram vek ang, tiin mahni hming chhâlin ka tiam a ni,’ ” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Juda lal chhûngkaw chungchâng heti hian a sawi: “Nang chu ka tân Gilead ang, Lebanon tlângchhîp ang i ni; Mahse, thlalêrah ka siam ang che a; Luahtu awm lo khawpui ram ang mai i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah tichhetu tûr hriamhrei keng ka rawn tîr ang, I sidar thing chhuante an kit ang a, Meiah an paih lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hnam dang miten he khawpui hi an paltlang ang a, ‘Engati nge he khawpui ropui tak chungah he thil hi Lalpa chuan a tih le?’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘ Lalpa , an Pathian thuthlung an hawisan a, pathian dangte biain an rawng an bâwl vang a ni,’ tiin an chhâng ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thi ta chu ṭah suh ula, sûn hek suh u, Kal bo ta tân erawh chuan lungchhe takin ṭap ula, a lo kîr leh dâwn tawh lo. A pianna ram a hmu leh dâwn tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda lal, Saluma, a pa Josia aiawha rorêltu, he hmun ata kal bo ta chungchâng thu chu Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “A lo kîr leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sala an hruaina hmunah a thi ang a, he ram hi a hmu leh tawh lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dik lo taka thil tia in satu, Thil ṭha lo tia in chhâwng siamtu, Mite chhawra, an thawhhlawh pe duh lotu chu A chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘In ropui tak, chhâwng zau tak nei ka tân ka sa ang a, Tukverh zau tak tak ka hawng ang a, Sidar thingin ka thuah chhuak ang a, Rawng sen ka hnawih vek ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sidar thinga in i sak theih avângin Lal ṭha zâwk i ni em ni? Sidar thing i ngah avâng khân Lal ta viauvah i inngai maw? I pa kha chuan dik tak leh fel takin thil a ti a, A duh tinrêng a eiin a in a, Tichuan, a lo hmuingîl ta hle a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rethei leh chanhaite a ngaihsak a; Tichuan, a lo hmuingîl ta a ni. Chutiang chu nang pawhin min hriat dân tûr a ni lâwm ni? Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, dik lo taka hlêp tumin i mit i lên a, Pawi sawi lote thisen i chhuah a, Mi dang i hnehchhiah a, thil i phût ṭeuh ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, Juda lal, Josia fapa, Jehoiakima chungthua Lalpa thu chhuak chu hei hi a ni. ‘Aw ka pu, aw ka nuṭapa,’ tiin ani chu an ṭah lo vang. ‘Aw ka pu, chhuanawm ber,’ an ti hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An hnûk ang a, Jerusalem kulh pâwnah an theh chhuak ang a, sabengtung ang lekin an phûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lebanon-ah chho la, Basan-ah hriat khawpin au chiam rawh, Abarim aṭangin ṭap chiam rawh, Lainattu che an chhe ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hmuingîl laiin i hnênah thu ka sawi a, Mahse, ‘Ka ngaithla lo vang,’ i ti a. Hei hi i tleirâwl lai ata i awm dân a ni, Ka thu i awih loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In hotute thliin a lên bo vang a, lainattu che pawh salah an tâng ang a, I sualna avângin mualpho leh mangang takin i awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang, Lebanon-a chêng, sidar ina khawsa, Nauvei nâ ang natna i chunga a lo thlen hun chuan I va rûm nasa dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Mi nung ka nih hi. Nang Juda lal Konia, Jehoiakima fapa, lal atân ka kut ding lamin lo chhinchhiah tawh che mah ila, chuta ta chu ka pawt chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangmah thah tumtu, i hlauh êm êm Babulon lal Nebukadnezara kutah leh Kaldai-ho kutah ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hringtu che i nu nên i pianna ram ni lo, ram dangah ka theh chhuak ang che u; tah chuan in pahnihin in thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kîr leh an châkna ramah chuan an kîr leh tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei chuan, “He Konia hi bêl keh, hmusitawm tak a ni lo vem ni? Tu man an ngaihsak loh hi. Engati nge amah leh a fate an paih chhuaha, An hriat loh rama theh chhuah an nih le?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw ram, aw ram, aw ram, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “ ‘He mi hi fa nei lo tûr, dam chhûnga hlawhtling lo tûr a ni. A thlahte tu mah an hmuingîl lo vang a, Davida lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr leh Judai rama rorêltu tûr an awm leh tawh lo vang,’ tiin ziak rawh,” min ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka ran tlatna hmuna berâmte tidarha tiboraltu berâmpute chung chu a pik e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan ka mite enkawltu, berâmpute chungthu chu hetiangin a sawi: “Ka ran rual in ngaihsak lo va, in tidarh a, in ûm bo zo ta. Ngai teh u, in thil sual tih avâng hian ka hrem dâwn che u a ni!” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka ran rual la dam chhunte chu ka hnawh darhna ram tin aṭangin keiin ka hruai khâwm ang a, an huangah ka khalh khâwm ang a, fa an ngah ang a, an chak hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmahni enkawltu tûr berâmpu ka dah ang a, hlau leh mangangin an awm tawh lo vang a, pakhat mah an bo tawh lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng mêk e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Davida thlah aṭangin lal dik tak a lo chawr chhuak ang a, Chu lal chuan fing takin ro a rêl ang. Ram pumah dik tak leh fel takin thil a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lal chhûng chuan Juda chu a him ang a, Israel pawh thlamuang takin a awm ang. A hmingah, ‘ Lalpa , kan dikna’ tih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tichuan, ngai teh, nite a lo thleng mêk e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Mite chuan, ‘Aigupta ram ata Israel fate hruaichhuaktu Lalpa chu a nung alâwm,’ an ti tawh lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Israela thlahte hmâr lam ram ata leh a ûm darhna ram tin aṭanga hruai chhuaka hruai hâwngtu Lalpa chu a nung alâwm,’ an ti tawh zâwk ang. Tin, anmahni ram ngeiah an chêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zâwlneiho chung thu chu: Ka rilru a va na êm; Tirilah ka khûr, Lalpa leh a thu thianghlim avâng hian Zu rui ang mai ka ni, rui hnêp ang mai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram chu uirenain a khat a, Ânchhia avângin a ngui zo ta. Kawng dik lo an zawh a, Dik lo takin an thiltihtheihna an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Zâwlneite leh puithiamte chuan serh leh sâng an nei lo va, Ka in chhûngah ngei pawh an sualna ka hmu,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chuvângin, an kawng chu zân thim kawng nâl ang a ni ang a, Tah chuan an tlânchhia ang a, an tlu ang a. Anmahni ka tlawh hunah An chhûngah thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samari khaw zâwlneite zîngah thil tenawm tak ka hmu, Baal hmingin thu an puang a, Ka mi Israel-te an hruai bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem-a zâwlneite zîngah pawh thil râpthlâk tak ka hmu, An uire a, dâwt an sawi a, thil sual titute an thlâwp a, Tu man an sual sim an tum loh phah a, A chhûnga chêngte chu ka tân Sodom khua leh Gomora khaw mite ang maia sual an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, zâwlneite chungchângah Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, anni chu thil kha ka eitîr ang a, Tui kha ka intîr bawk ang. Jerusalem-a zâwlneite avângin ram pumah serh leh sâng pawisak lohna a punlun ta si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Engkimtitheia chuan heti hian a ti: “In hnêna thupuangtu zâwlneite thu chu ngaithla suh u. Engmahlo mai mai an hrilh che u a, Lalpa thu sawi ni lo, an thu phuahchawp an sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa thu ngainêptute hnênah chuan, ‘In ti ṭha e,’ an ti châmchi a; mahni thuduhte hnênah pawh ‘In chungah thil ṭha lo a thleng chuang lo vang,’ an ti.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa remruatnaah tute nge tela, A thu hre tûra ngaithla le? Tu nge a thu hriatthiam tuma ngaichâng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa thinur thli chu a tleh dâwn, Thli na tak chuan mi sualte lu chu a nuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa thinur chu a reh dâwn lo, A thiltumte a hlena a tih zawh hma chu, Nakin hnuah hei hi in la hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka tirh ni lo zâwlneite chu an vâk vêl a, Eng mah ka hrilh lo va, ka hrilh ni âwm takin an puang si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka remruatnaah tel ve ni sela, Ka mite hnênah ka thu an puang tûr; Tichuan, an awm dân sualte an bânsan ang a, An thil tihsualte an sim ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hla taka awm Pathian ni lovin hnai têa awm Pathian ka ni lâwm ni?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka hmuh loh tûra hmun rilah tu nge biru thei?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Lei leh vân ka awh khat lo vem ni?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka hming chhâla dâwt sawi zâwlneite chuan, ‘Mumangah kan mang a, mumangah min hrilh a ni,’ an tih chu ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêng zâwlnei dawthei, mahni phuahchawpa mi bum ṭhînte hian eng chen nge an bum zêl dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An paten Baal an bia a, ka hming an theihnghilh ta ang khân, ka hming an theihnghilh thei mahna tiin mite chu an mumangte an hrilh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mang nei zâwlnei chuan a mumang a ni tih sawi sela, chutiang bawkin ka thuchah dawngtu pawhin dik takin sawi rawh se. Buhpâwl leh buhfang an inang em ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka thu chu mei ang a ni a, lung chhutkehna tuboh ang hi a ni lo vem ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ngai teh, zâwlnei, ka thu anga an ṭhiante thu sawi chhâwngte chu ka hua a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngai teh, zâwlnei, mahni phuahchawp sawia, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti’ titute chu ka hua a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Ngai teh, an mumang, dâwt thu puangtu chu ka hua a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Eng mah pawisa lovin dâwt an sawi an sawi a, ka mite an hruai bo ta. Anni chu ka tirh an ni lo va, ka ruat an ni hek lo. Hêng mite tân hian ṭangkaina rêng rêng an nei lo,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Hêng mite hian emaw, zâwlneiin emaw, puithiamin emaw, ‘ Lalpa phurrit chu eng nge ni?’ tia an zawh che chuan, ‘Nangni hi phurrit chu in ni, ka paih bo dâwn che u,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, tiin hrilh rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zâwlnei emaw, puithiam emaw, tu pawhin, ‘Hei hi Lalpa phurrit a ni,’ an tih chuan chu mi leh a chhûngte chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni ṭhenawmte leh unaute hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chuan eng nge a hrilh che? Lalpa chuan eng nge a lo sawi?’ tiin an zâwt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />‘ Lalpa phurrit chu,’ in ti tûr a ni lo, in tih chuan ka thu chu in tân phurrit a ni takmeuh vang. Pathian nung, Engkim Lalpa , kan Pathian thu chu in kailek zo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zâwlnei hnênah chuan, ‘Eng nge Lalpa chuan a hrilh che? Lalpa chuan eng nge a sawi?’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />‘Hei hi Lalpa phurrit chu a ni,’ in tih chuan hetiangin Lalpa chuan a ti, ‘Hei hi Lalpa phurrit chu a ni, ti lo tûra ka hrilh che u pawhin, hei hi Lalpa phurrit chu a ni,’ in la tih cheu avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />ngai teh u, ka pawt chhuak ang che u a, ka hnên ata ka paih chhuak dâwn che u a ni, he khawpui, in pate leh in tâna ka lo pêk tawh nên hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, kumkhuaa zahna leh mualphona, theihnghilh rual loh in chungah ka thlentîr ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Jehoiakima fapa Jekonia leh Juda hotute, mi themthiamte, thîrdêngte Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon-a sala a hruai hnu khân Lalpa chuan theipui bâwm pahnih, Lalpa in kawta inhûng chu mi entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bâwm pakhatah chuan theipui hmin ṭha tak tak, a rah hmasa chi ang hi a awm a, pakhat zâwkah chuan theipui rah chhe tak, ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Jeremia, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Theipui rah ka hmu, a ṭhate chu an ṭha hle a, a chhiate erawh chu chhe tak, ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia an ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda saltâng, Kaldai rama ka tirhte chu hêng theipui rah ṭha ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An tâna ṭha tûrin an chungah ka mit a fu ang a, he ramah hian ka hruai kîr leh ang. Anni chu ka tungding ang a, ka ṭhiat tawh lo vang. Ka phun ang a, ka pawt tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa ka ni tih an hriat theihna tûr thinlung ka pe ang. Ka mite an ni ang a, kei an Pathian ka ni ang, an thinlung zawng zawng nên ka hnênah an lo kîr dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda lal Zedekia te, a upa te, Jerusalem-a awm te, he rama la chêngte leh Aigupta rama awmte chu theipui rah ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia ang hi an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chu ram tina lalte tân ṭihkhaiah ka siam ang. Ka hnawhdarhna hmuna mite chuan hmusitin an nuihzat ang a, deusawh takin hmun tinah an hming chu ânchhe inlawh nân an hmang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An pate leh an hnêna ka pêk ramah chuan an boral vek hma chu an chungah khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri te ka lêntîr ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Jehoiakima, Josia fapa a lal kum linaa Juda mi zawng zawng chungchâng thu-a Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu: he hun hi Babulon lal Nebukadnezara lal kum khatna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremia chuan Juda mi zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawng hnênah heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kum sawmhnih leh pathum chhûng, Amona fapa Josia, Judai rama a lal kum sâwm leh pathumna aṭanga vawiin thlengin Lalpa thu ka hnêna lo thleng ṭhîn chu zîng taka thovin ka hrilh ka hrilh che u a; mahse, in ngaithla duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a rawngbâwltu zâwlneite chu zîng tak takah a tîr fo va, in pawisa lo va, hriat tumin in beng in dawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi tinin in awm dân sual te, in thil chin ṭha lote bânsan ula; tichuan, in pate leh in hnêna Lalpa pêk ramah hian kumkhuain in awm thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian dangte rawngbâwl tûr leh chibai bûk tûrin kal suh u. In kuta in thil siam chuan min tithinur lo ula; tichuan, ka hrem lo vang che u, tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, mi ngaithla lo va, in kuta in thil siamte chuan min tithinur a, nangmahni in intichhe ta zâwk a ni, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thu in ngaihthlâk duh loh avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hmâr lama hnamte chu ka ko dâwn,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Babulon lal Nebukadnezara, ka chhiahhlawh chu, he rama chêngte leh a chhehvêl rama awm zawng zawng bei tûrin ka rawn hruai ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Anni chu ka tichhe vek ang a, miin mak an ti ang a, râpthlâk an ti hle ang, an chhe hlen hlauh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hlim thâwm te, an lâm ri te, moneitu aw leh mo aw te, buh dêng thâwm te, khâwnvâr êngte ka titâwp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He ram hi a pumin a ram ang a, a chhe vek ang a; hêng hnamte hian kum sawmsarih chhûng Babulon lal rawng an bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kum sawmsarih hu a ral hnuah Babulon lal chu a mite nên an sual avângin ka hrem ang a, Kaldai ram chu ka tichhe hlen ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Anmahni dema thu ka sawi zawng zawng, he lehkhabua chuang zawng zawng, Jeremian hnam zawng zawng kalha thu a lo puan tawhte chu he ram chungah hian ka thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnam tam tak leh ram ropui tak takte chuan anni chu salah an siam ang a, an thil lo tih tawh leh an kut hnathawh ang zêlin ka thungrûl ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “He uain no, ka thinurnaa khat hi, ka kut ata la la, ka tirhna che hnam zawng zawng intîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An in ang a, an pai an pai ang a, an â zo vang; an hnênah khandaih ka lêntîr dâwn avângin,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa kuta no chu ka la a, Lalpa mi tirhna hnam zawng zawng chu ka intîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûna a awm ang hian Jerusalem leh Judai ram khawpuite chu a ram vek ang a, an lalte leh hruaitute chu hmuhsit leh nuihzat an ni ang a, ânchhia an dawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aigupta lal Farawa leh a chhiahhlawh te, a rorêltute leh a mi zawng zawngte leh hnam dang awmte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Uz rama lal zawng zawng te, Filistia rama lal, Askelon lal te, Gaza lal te, Ekron-a lal te leh Asdod-a hnutchhiaha awm lal te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom mi te, Moab mi te, Amon mi te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tura leh Sidon lal te, tuifinriat kama awm zawng zawng lal te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dedan te, Tema te, Buz-a chêngte leh lumêt zawng zawng te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arabia lal zawng zawng te, thlalêra chêng hnam inpawlh lal te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zimri lal zawng zawng te, Elam lal zawng zawng te; Media lal zawng zawng te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmâr lam lal, hmun hla leh hnaia awm zawng zawng te leh lei lalram tinrêng te pawh chuan a indawt zêlin an in ang. Chumi zawhah chuan Babulon lal pawhin a in bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan in hnênah heti hian sawi rawh min ti: ‘In ula, luak ula, tho thei lo khawpin tlu rawh u. In zîngah khandaih ka lentîr dâwn si a,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I kut ata no chu an lâk duh loh chuan heti hian hrilh ang che: Engkim Lalpa chuan, ‘In in ngei tûr a ni, a ti,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“En teh u, ka hming chuanna khawpuiah chhiatna ka thlentîr ṭan ta a, nangni pawh hrem in tuar lo vang em ni? In pumpelh bîk hauh lo vang. Leia awm zawng zawng chungah khandaih ka lek dâwn si a,” tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tûnah, anni hi hetiang hian au khum rawh: “Vân sâng aṭangin Lalpa chuan aw a chhuah ang a, A chênna Hmun Thianghlim aṭangin awrâwl a chhuah ang. A ram demin aw a chhuah ang a, Grep sâwrtute angin a au vang, Leia mi zawng zawng an khûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thâwm chuan kâwlkil a thleng ang, Hnamte chungah Lalpa a thinur a ni. Mi zawng zawng ro a rêlsak ang, Mi suaksual chu khandaih a tuartîr ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “En teh u, hnam tin chungah chhiatna a thleng ta, “Kâwlkil ata thlipui na tak a lo thawk dâwn,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Lalpa mi thahte chu Kâwlkil aṭanga a lehlam thlengin Tu man an ṭah lo vang a, an ruang te pawh an hlâwm hek lo vang, An phûm lo vang a, leia bawlhhlawh tling khâwm ang lek an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Berâmpute u, ṭap ula, chiau vawng vawng rawh u, Nangni ran rual vêngtute u, Vaivutah let tawp tawp rawh u, An thah hun che u a thleng dâwn ta, In tlu ang a, hlumbêl ṭha tak keh ang maiin in keh darh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Berâmpute chuan tlânchhiatna tûr rêng an hre lo, Ranrual vêngtute tân pawh pumpelh theih a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Berâmpute ṭap thâwm leh ranrual vêngtute rûm thâwm chu, Ngaithla rawh u, Lalpa chuan an ran tlatna hmun a tichhe tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa thinurna nasa tak avâng chuan, Thlamuang taka an awm ṭhinna ram chu a ṭhing ta ṭhuap mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hnehchhiahtu ngûnhnâm avâng leh Pathian thinurna nasa tak avâng chuan An chênna ram chu an chhuahsan ta, Sakeibakneiin a pûk a rauhsan ang maiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa, Jehoiakima a lal ṭan tirh kumin he thu hi Lalpa hnên aṭangin a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetiangin: “ Lalpa chuan a ti, ‘ Lalpa in kawtzâwlah ding la, Juda khawpui zawng zawng aṭanga Pathian be tûra Lalpa ina lo kalte hnênah thu sawi rawh. Thu ka pêk zawng zawng chu hmaih lovin puang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite chuan an awm dân sual bânsanin an ngaithla mial mahna. Tichuan, an thil sual tihte avânga an chunga chhiatna thlentîr ka tum pawh ka sût leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni,’ tiin anni chu hrilh rawh: In hnêna ka pêk, ka thu in pawisa lo va, ka dân in zâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In hnêna ka tirh fo ṭhin ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite thu in pawisak loh avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />he in hi Silo angin ka tichhia ang a, he khawpui hi leia hnam tinrêng ânchhe dawngtu atân ka siam ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiam te, zâwlnei te, mipui zawng zawngte chuan hêng thu, Lalpa ina Jeremia sawi chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipui hrilh tûra Lalpa thupêk zawng zawng a sawi zawh veleh puithiam te, zâwlnei te, mipui te chuan Jeremia chu an man a, “I thi ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa hming chhâla, ‘He in hi Silo ang a ni ang a, he khawpui pawh hi luahtu awm lovin a ram ang,’ tia i sawi?” an ti a. Lalpa inah chuan mipui zawng zawngin Jeremia chu an bâwr ta huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng thu hi Juda rorêltuten an hriat chuan lal in aṭangin Lalpa inah an chho va, Lalpa in kawngka thar luhnaah chuan an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiamte leh zâwlneite chuan rorêltute leh mipuite hnênah, “He mi hi thi tlâk a ni, in hriat angin ‘he khawpui hi a chhe dâwn’ tiin a sawi a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeremia chuan rorêltute leh mipui zawng zawng hnênah chuan heti hian a ti a: “In ngaihthlâk tâk ang khân he khawpui leh he in chhiat tûr thu hi sawi tûrin Lalpa chuan mi tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In awm dân te, in chetzia te siam ṭha ula, in Pathian, Lalpa thu chu zâwm rawh u. Tichuan, in chunga chhiatna lo thleng tûr a lo puan tawh chu Lalpa chuan a sût dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei chu, hei, in kutah ka awm a, dik leh ṭha nia in hriat angin ka chungah ti mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Min thah chuan he khawpui leh a chhûnga chêngte hian pawi sawi lo thisen mawh in phur ang tih hi hria ang che u. Hêng thu hi in beng hriata sawi tûrin Lalpa chuan min tîr a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rorêltute leh mipuite chuan puithiamte leh zâwlneite hnênah chuan, “He mi hi tihhlum tûr a ni lo; Lalpa , kan Pathian hmingin kan hnênah thu a sawi si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi rama upa tute emaw an lo ding chhuak a, mipui pung khâwm hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Moreset mi, Mika chuan Juda lal Hezekia hun lai khân thu a hril a, Juda mi zawng zawng hnênah: ‘Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Zion chu lo anga leh phut vek a ni ang a, Jerusalem pawh thil chhe vawm khâwm mai a ni ang, Lalpa in tlângte chu a ngaw khung ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ani chu Juda lal Hezekia emaw, Juda mi dangten emaw an that em? Hezekia chuan Lalpa a ṭih a, a tilâwm a. Tichuan, Lalpa chuan an chunga thil ṭha lo tih a tum chu a sût ta a ni lâwm ni kha? Keini zawng keimahni chungah thil ṭha lo tak kan thlentîr dâwn ta a nih hi le!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Mi dang, Semaia fapa Uria, Keriat-jearim mi chuan Lalpa hmingin thu a puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakima leh a milian te, rorêltute chuan a thu sawi an hria a, lal chuan thah a tum ta a. Uria chuan a hriatin a hlau va, Aigupta ramah a tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakima chuan Akbora fapa Elnathana chu mi dangte nên Aigupta ramah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Uria chu Aigupta ram aṭangin an rawn hruai a, lal Jehoiakima hnênah an rawn thlen a. Ani chuan khandaihin a sât hlum a, a ruang chu vântlâng thlânmualah an phûm ta a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Safana fapa Ahikama chuan Jeremia chu a ṭan tlat a, tihhlum tûrin mipui hnênah an pe ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa, Zedekia lal ṭan tirhin Lalpa thu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Nghâwngkawl tuk la, a hrui vuahin i nghâwngah bât rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Edom lal te, Moab lal te, Amona thlah lal te, Tura lalte leh Sidon lal ten Juda lal Zedekia hmu tûra Jerusalem-a an mi rawn tirhte chu thu chah rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thu hi an pute hnênah sawi rawh se: ‘Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: in pute chu heti hian hrilh rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thiltihtheihna ropui tak nên bân phar meuhvin leite, mihringte leh leia rannung zawng zawngte hi ka siam a; chûng chu pêk âwm ka tihte hnênah ka pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah pawh hêng ram zawng zawng hi ka chhiahhlawh Nebukadnezara, Babulon lal kutah ka pe tawh a ni. Ramsate pawh ama rawngbâwl tûrin ka pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ram a chhiat hun a thlen hma chuan hnam tinrêngin amah leh a fate leh a tute rawng an bâwl ang a; chumi hnuah erawh chuan hnam tam takte leh lal ropuite bawihah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Babulon lal Nebukadnezara rawngbâwl duh lo leh a thuhnuaia kûn duh lo tawh phawt hnam leh lalram chu khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui tein ka hrem ang, ka kut chak tak hmangin anni chu ka tiboral vek dâwn a ni,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Babulon lal rawng in bâwl lo vang,’ tia hrilhtu che u in zâwlnei te, in aienthiam te, mumang hrilhfiahtu te, hrilhlâwktu te, thil chhui thiamte thu chu ngaithla suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ram ata hla taka hruai bo in nih theih nân leh ka hnawh darhna che u a in boral theih nân in hnênah dâwt thu an puang ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Babulon thuhnuaia kûna, a rawngbâwltu hnam chu anmahni ram ngeiah ka awmtîr leh ang a, leite an let ang a, chutah chuan an chêng ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia hnênah pawh hetiang hian ka sawi bawk a: “Babulon lal thuhnuaiah kûn la, amah leh a mite rawng bâwl ang che; tichuan, i him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babulon lal rawngbâwl duh lo hnam chungchâng Lalpa sawi tawh ang kha engah nge khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te tuarin nang leh i mite chu in thih ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Babulon lal rawng bâwl suh u,’ in hnêna titu zâwlneite thu chu ngaithla suh u, in hnênah dâwt thu an sawi mai mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Anni chu ka tirh an ni lo, ka hmingin dâwt thu an hril zâwk ṭhîn a ni,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Chuvângin, ka hnawt chhuak ang che u a, in hnêna thusawitu zâwlneite nên in boral ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Puithiamte leh hêng mite hnênah hian hei hi ka sawi a ni: Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘ Lalpa ina bungbêl chu Babulon aṭangin lâk kîr a ni thuai dâwn,’ titu zâwlneite thu sawi chu ngaithla suh u. Dâwt thu an hrilh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An thu chu awih suh u. Babulon lal rawngbâwl zâwk ula; tichuan, in him ang. Engah nge he khawpui hi a chhiat ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zâwlnei an niha Lalpa thu an dawng tak meuh a nih chuan Lalpa ina bungbêl la awm, Juda lal ina awmte leh Jerusalem khuaa awmte hi Babulon-a lâk a nih loh nân Engkim Lalpa hnênah ngên ang hmiang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran Juda lal Jehoiakima fapa Jekonia leh Juda ram leh Jerusalem-a mi ṭha zawng zawng Babulon-a a hruai ṭuma a lâk bângte chu - dâr ban sâng te, dâr tuizêm te, a nghahchhan te leh Lalpa ina bungbêl ṭhenkhat te a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ni, Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan - Lalpa ina bungbêl te, Judai ram lal ina thil hnutchhiah te leh Jerusalem khua a thil hnutchhiah te chungchâng hetiangin a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Babulon-ah lâk an ni ang; tin, ka hruai kîr leh ang a, he hmunah hian ka din thar leh ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi kum vêk, Judai ram lal Zedekia lal tirh lam, a kum lina, thla nganaah chuan zâwlnei Hanania, Azura fapa, Gibeon mi chuan puithiamte leh mipui zawng zawng hriatin Lalpa inah chuan ka hnênah hetiangin thu a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Babulon lal thuneihna chu ka tichhe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran hemi hmun aṭanga Lalpa ina bungbêl a lâk, Babulon-a a phurh hâwn zawng zawng kha kum hnih chhûng ngeiin he hmunah hian ka rawn thlen leh vek dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda lal Jekonia, Jehoiakima fapa leh Juda saltâng, Babulon-a kal zawng zawngte pawh he hmunah hian ka hruai kîr leh vek ang, Babulon lal thuneihna chu ka tichhia ang,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremia chuan puithiamte leh Lalpa ina ding mipui zawng zawng hmaah chuan zâwlnei Hanania hnênah hetiangin a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Amen, Lalpa chuan chutiang tak chuan ti rawh se, Lalpa chuan thu i puan ang chuan thlentîr sela, Babulon-a bungbêlte leh saltâng zawng zawng he mi hmunah hian rawn thlen leh ngei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nang leh mipui zawng zawngin in hnêna ka thu sawi hi lo hre teh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmâsâng ata, nang leh kei kan pian hma aṭangin zâwlneiten, ‘indona te, ṭâm te, hripui te ram tam tak leh lalram ropui tak tak chungah a thleng dâwn,’ an ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Muanna a lo thleng dâwn,’ tih puangtu zâwlnei thu sawi chu a lo thlen hunah chu zâwlnei chu Lalpa tirh a nih leh nih loh a hriat mai ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, zâwlnei Hanania chuan zâwlnei Jeremia nghâwngkawl bah lai chu a la a, a titliak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hanania chuan mi zawng zawng hriatah heti hian a ti a: “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Hetiang tak hian Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran hnam zawng zawng a awpbehna thuneihna chu kum hnih chhûngin ka tichhe dâwn a ni,” tiin. Zâwlnei Jeremia chuan a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zâwlnei Hananian zâwlnei Jeremia nghâwngkawl bah a tihtliah hnuah Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kal la, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, tiin Hanania chu va hrilh rawh: thing nghâwngkawl i titliak a, a aiah thîr nghâwngkawl i siamsak zâwk a nih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Babulon lal Nebukadnezara rawngbâwl tûrin hêng hnam zawng zawng hi thîr nghâwngkawl ka bahtîr ta a ni. Tichuan, a rawng an bâwl ang a. Ramsa hlauhawm pui puite pawh a hnênah ka pe bawk a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremia chuan zâwlnei Hanania hnênah, “Hanani, hre rawh, Lalpa chuan a tîr lo che; hêng mite hi dâwt i rintîr mai mai a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh, lei ata ka la bo daih dâwn che, Lalpa laka hel thu i puan avângin kuminah ngei i thi ang,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi kum, thla sarihnaah chuan zâwlnei Hanania chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukadnezaran Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon-a a hruai, saltâng zînga hruaitu te, puithiam te, zâwlnei te leh mi zawng zawng hnêna zâwlnei Jeremia thu thawn chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu chu lal Jekonia leh a nu te, mi tilreh te, Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a hotu te, themthiam te leh thîrdêng ten Jerusalem an chhuahsan hnu khân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekian Babulon lal Nebukadnezara hnêna a mi tirh, Safana fapa Elasa leh Hilkia fapa Gemaria te kutah chu lehkha chu a thawn a ni. Heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Saltâng zawng zawng, Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon-a ka kaltîr tâkte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />in te sa ula; tah chuan chêng ang che u; huante siam ula, in thlai tharte chu ei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nupui nei ula, fanu fapate nei ang che u. In fapate nupui neihsak ula, in fanute pawh pasal neihtîr ang che u. Tichuan, fanu fapa neiin in lo pung ang a, kiam lam pan suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sala ka tirhna che u khawpui ṭhatna zawnsak ula, Lalpa hnênah dîlsak rawh u. Chu ram hmuingîlna zâr chu nangni pawhin in zo ve dâwn si a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘In zînga zâwlnei te, aienthiam te chuan bum che u suh se. An mumangte pawh ngaithla suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hmingin dâwt an hrilh che u a, anni chu ka tirh an ni hauh si lo,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Kum sawmsarih a tlin hunah Babulon ramah chuan ka rawn tlawh ang che u a, in hnêna ka thutiam nghet tak chu ka hlen ang a, he hmunah hian ka hruai kîr leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In tâna ka remruat chu keimah chauhvin ka hria,’ tih hi Lalpa thu chhuak a ni. ‘Chhiatna ni lo, thil ṭha in beisei chu in chan theih nân ka ruahman a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Min lam ang a, ka hnênah in rawn ṭawngṭai ang a, ka lo ngaithla ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min zawng ang a, tihtakzeta min zawn hunah min hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In hmuh tûrin ka awm ang,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Sal ata ka chhuah ang che u a, ka hnawhdarhna ram hnam zawng zawng leh hmun tinrêng aṭangin ka hruai khâwm leh ang che u,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ ‘ Lalpa chuan Babulon-ah pawh zâwlneite min siamsak a,’ in ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Davida lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr lal chungchâng te, he khawpuia chêng mipui chungchâng te, in unau, in hnêna sala tâng ve lote chungchâng thu heti hian a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, an chungah khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te ka lêntîr dâwn e. Anni chu theipui ṭawih, ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia ang hian ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anni chu khandaih te, tâm te, hripui te nên ka ûmzui ang. Ka hnawhdarhna hnam tin zîngah leia lalram zawng zawngten thil râpthlâk leh ânchhia, mak an tiha an chek khum tlawk tlawkah leh an nuihzat huai huaiah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In hnêna zing tak taka ka tirh, ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite thu in pawisa lo va, in ngaithla duh si lo,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangni, saltâng zawng zawng, Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon-a ka hruaite u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan Kolaia fapa Ahaba leh Maaseia fapa Zedekia, ka hminga dâwt thu puang ṭhînte chungchâng heti hian a sawi: ‘Ngai teh, anni chu Babulon lal Nebukadnezara ka mantîr ang a, in hmuh lai ngeiin a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judai ram aṭanga Babulon-a saltâng zawng zawngte chuan, ‘Babulon lalin Zedekia leh Ahaba meia a rawh ang khân, Lalpa chuan i chungah ti ve rawh se,’ tiin chûng mite hming chuan ânchhia an inlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel ramah â takin thil an ti a, an ṭhenawmte nupui an uiresak a, ka hmingin dawt an sawi a, an hnênah thu ka pe si lo. Kei hi hrechiangtu thuhretu ka ni,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nehelam mi, Semaia hnênah heti hian thu sawi rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, Jerusalem mipui zawng zawng hnênah te, Maaseia fapa Zefania, puithiam hnênah te, puithiam dang zawng zawng hnênah te nangma hmingin lehkha i thawn a, hetiangin i ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Nang Zefania, Lalpa chuan puithiam Jehoiada aiawhtu atân a ruat che a, Lalpa ina â taka thu puang ṭhînte chu kawl te, thîrkawl te buntîrtu atân ruat i ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tûnah, Jeremia, Anathot khaw mi, in hnêna thu puangtu hi engtizia nge i zilh loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babulon-a awmte chu, ‘Saltân chhûng a rei dâwn a, in leh lote bêngbel ula, huante pawh siam ula, in thlaite ei rawh u,’ tiin thu a thawn hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Puithiam Zefania chuan he lehkha hi zâwlnei Jeremia hriatah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah hetiangin a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Hêng hi saltâng zawng zawng hrilh rawh: Lalpa chuan Nehelam mi Zefania chungchâng heti hian a sawi: Semaia hian in hnênah thu a hril a, ani chu ka tirh a ni lo, dâwt a rintîr che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Nehelam mi Semaia leh a thlahte chu ka hrem dâwn. In zîngah thlah pakhat mah a nei lo vang a, ka mite tâna thil ṭha ka tih tûr pawh a chang ve hek lo vang, Lalpa laka hel thu a puan avângin, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: I hnêna ka thu sawi zawng zawng kha lehkhabu-ah ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng mêk e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Ka mi Israel-te leh Juda-te chu an saltânna ata ka chhuah ang a, an pute hnêna ka pêk ramah chuan ka hruai hâwng leh ang a; tichuan, ram chu an luah ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng hi Juda leh Israel chungchânga Lalpa thu sawi chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hlau leh mangang thâwm ka hria, Muanna rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hawiin zâwt vêl teh rêng u, Mipain nau an vei ngai em ni? Engtizia nge hmeichhe nau vei anga, Pachangin a pum a dawma, A hmêl a lo dân tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu ni chu a va han râpthlâk dâwn êm! A ang rêng a awm lo vang, Jakoba mangan hun tûr a ni, Mahse, chhan chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan a nghâwngkawl bah ka titliak ang a, An phuarna hrui ka phelhsak ang a, Ram dang mite chhiahhlawh an ni tawh lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An Pathian, Lalpa leh an lal atâna ka tun din tûr, Davida thlah zînga mi rawng chu an bâwl tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw ka chhiahhlawh Jakob, hlau suh, Aw Israel, zâm hek suh,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “I thlah, ram hla taka saltângte chu ka chhan chhuak dâwn si a, Jakoba chu thlamuang tak leh him takin a awm ang, Tu man an tirâlṭi tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhan chhuak tûr chein i hnênah ka awm reng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Ka hnawhdarhna che rama hnam zawng zawng chu, Ka tichimit vek ang a, Nang erawh chu ka tichimit lo vang che. A tâwk lekin ka thunun ang che a, Hrem loh zawngin i chhuak bîk lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “I hliam chu tihdam rual a ni lo, I tuar hi a na êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I pân tidama i na tidam tûrin Enkawltu rêng i nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I lamṭang zawng zawngten an theihnghilh tawh che a, An ngaihsak tawh lo che. Hmêlma angin ka hliam ta che a, Dim lo takin ka hrem che a ni, I sualna leh i bawhchhiatna a nasat êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I hliam vângin engah nge i phunnawi? I na hi tihdam rual a ni lo; I khawlohna a nasa a, thil tam tak i tihsual avângin Hêng thil hi i chungah ka ti a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eiraltu zawng zawng che chu eiral an ni ang a, I hmêlma zawng zawng salah an hruai ang. Rawktu zawng zawng che u an rawk ang a, Tiramtu zawng zawng che pawh ka tiram ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tidam leh ang che, I hliam tuar pawh ka tidam ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. ‘Hnuchhawn, tu ma ngaihsak loh Zion,’ An tih che avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, Jakob-ho ram chu ka din thar leh ang a, A chênna hmun chu ka lainat ang. Khawpui ram hnu chu ka siam ṭha ang a, Lal inte pawh a hmun ngaiah a ding leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng hmun aṭang chuan lâwmthu sawina leh Hlim thâwm a lo chhuak ang a, Anni chu ka tipung ang a, an kiam leh tawh lo vang, Ka tiropui ang a, an tenau hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An fate chu tûn hma ang khân an awm leh ang a, Ka hmaah ngêlnghet takin an awm ang. Anmahni hnehchhiahtute chu ka hrem zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anmahni mi ngei hruaituah an nei ang a, An zîng aṭangin rorêltu an lo chhuak ang, Anni chu min rawn hnaih tûrin ka sâwm ang a; Tichuan, min rawn hnaih ang. Sâwm lohvin tu nge mi rawn hnaih ngam ang?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mite in ni ang a, in Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa thinurna thlipui chu na takin a tleh ta, Mi suaksualte lu chu a nuai nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thiltumte a hlena a tih zawh hma loh chuan Lalpa thinurna nasa tak chu a reh lo vang, Ni hnuhnûngah hei hi in la hrethiam ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chumi hnuah chuan kei hi Israel chhûngkua zawng zawng Pathian ka ni ang a, Anni pawh ka mite an ni ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Khandaiha thah bângte chuan thlalêrah khawngaih an hlawh ang.” Israel-ten chawlhna ram an pan lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmâna ka hnêna lo lang Lalpa chuan, “Hmangaih tâwp lovin ka hmangaih che a, Ngilnei takin ka hruai zêl ang che,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw nula Israel, ka din thar leh dâwn che, Din ngheh i lo ni ang. Benchhekte kengin hlim taka lâm tûrin i chhuak leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria tlâng tluanin grep huan i siam leh ang a, Phuntute chuan a rah chu an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râlvêngtuten Efraim tlângah mi an auh ni a thleng dâwn, ‘Tho teh u, Lalpa kan Pathian hnênah, Zion-ah i chho vang u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Jakoba tân hlim takin zai ula, Hnam azawnga ropui ber tân au chiam rawh u, Hril vêl ula, chawimawi rawh u, ‘Aw Lalpa , Israel la damte chu humhim ang che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh, anni chu hmâr lam aṭangin ka hruai dâwn, Lei hmun kil tin aṭangin ka hruai khâwm ang a, Mitdelte leh kebaite pawh an tel ve ang, Nau paite leh vei laite nên, Hnam ropui tak chu he hmunah hian an lo kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭap chungin lo kîr mah se, Ka thlamuan ang a, ka hruai hâwng ang. Lui kamah te, kawng tluang an tlûk lohna tûrah te chuan ka hruai ang. Israel-te tân pa ka ni ang, Efraim chu ka fa tîr a ni si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw hnamte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla ula, Tuifinriat kam ram hla takahte hril rawh u. ‘Israel tidarhtu chuan a hruai khâwm leh ang a, Berâmpu angin anni chu a enkawl dâwn,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakoba chu a tlan chhuak ang a, A aia chakte kut ata a chhan chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hlim taka auvin Zion tlângchhîpah an lo lâwn ang a, Lalpa ṭhatna avâng chuan an hmêl a hlim êm êm ang. Buh te, uain te, hriak te, berâm leh ran rual note avâng chuan an lâwm ang, Anni chu hneh taka tuia châwm huan ang an ni ang a, An lungngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nulate chu hlim takin an lâm ang a, Tlangvâl leh tarte pawh an lâwm ang. An lungngaih lâwmah ka chantîr ang a, An lungchhia chu ka thlamuan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiamte chu chaw tui takin ka hrai ang a, Ka mite chu ka ṭhatnain an tlai bawk ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Rama khuaah thâwm an hria, Lungchhe taka ṭap tlawk tlawk thâwm chu; Rakili chuan a fate a ṭah a, An awm tawh loh avângin hnem theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Insûm la, ṭap tawh suh, i mittui pawh hul rawh se, I thawh rah i seng dâwn e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Râl ram aṭangin an lo hâwng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nakinah chuan i chan a la ṭha hle ang, Mahni ram ngeiah i fate chu an lo kîr dâwn,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Efraim rûm thâwm chu ka hre reng a, ‘Nangin bâwngtuai la sâwi loh angin mi sâwi a, Min thunun tâk hi. Min hawi kîrtîr la, ka lo kîr ang, Min hruai la, Ka Pathian, Lalpa chu i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min hawi kîrtîr hnuin ka inchhîr a, Ka hriatthiam hnuin ka sim ta. Ka tleirâwl lai hmingchhiat phurin, Mualpho leh zak takin ka awm a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim chu ka fapa duh tak, Ka duat êm êm chu a ni lâwm ni? Han khak ṭhîn mah ila ka thinlungah a châm reng a, Ani chu ka hre reng a, ka lainat takzet a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kawng chhinchhiahna siam la, Kawng chin hriatna tûr ban phun rawh, I kawngpui zawh chu chhinchhiah ngun rawh. Nula Israel, lo kîr la, I khawpuiah hian lo kîr leh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw nang, fanu lepchiah, Eng chen nge i vah rawlai dâwn le? Lalpa chuan leiah thil a siam thar ta em ni? Hmeichhiain mipa a rîm tâk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “An saltânna ata ka hruai kîr leh hun chuan Judai ram leh a khawpuiahte chuan hetiang ṭawngkam hi an hmang leh ang: ‘Aw, mi dikte chênna hmun, Aw, tlâng thianghlim, Lalpa chuan malsâwm che rawh se,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judai ram leh a khawpuiahte chuan loneitute leh berâm vêngtute an chêng ho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi chaute chu ka tiharh ang a, ṭâmchhâwlte chu ka hrai tlai ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka mu chu ka han ṭhanharh chuan ka han hawi vêl a, ka lo mutui hle a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng dâwn e, Israel chhûngte zîngah leh Juda chhûngte zîngah mihring leh ran ka tipung ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anmahni pawtchhuaka tichhe tûr te, tithlua tiboral tûr te leh timangang tûr tein ka châng reng ṭhîn a; mahse, tungding leh tinghet tûrin ka ngaihven ta reng zâwk a ni, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chûng ni-ahte chuan miten ‘Paten grep thûr an ei a, An fate hâ a ṭim e,’ An ti tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni sualna an thihpui ang a, Tu pawh grep thûr ei apiang an hâ a ṭim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng dâwn e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte nên thuthlung thar ka siam ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“An thlahtute Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuak tûra an kut ngeia ka chelh laia ka thuthlung ang kha a ni lo vang. An tân hotu ka ni chungin ka thuthlung chu an bawhchhe si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Chûng ni hnua Israel chhûngte nêna ka thu thlun tûr chu hei hi a ni: An rilruah ka Dân ka dah ang a, an thinlungah ka ziak bawk ang. Kei hi an Pathian ka ni ang a, anni chu ka mite an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chu hre rawh u,’ tiin tu mahin an ṭhenawmte leh an unaute an zirtîr tawh lo vang. A tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin min hre dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Tichuan, an bawhchhiatnate ka ngaidam ang a, an sualnate ka hre reng tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chhûn tiêngtu atâna ni daha, zân tiêngtu atâna thla leh arsite ruattu, ri hum hum tûra tuifinriat tichetu chu a hming Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hêng thil awmphung ruatte hi ka tihtâwp hma loh chu Israel hnamte pawh an ral lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chung lam vân khi in tehchhuah theiha, hnuai lama lei nghahchhante in zawn chhuah theih hunah, Israel thlahte chu an thil lo tih zawng zawng avângin ka paih ve ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng mêk e, Hananela in sâng aṭanga kulh kil kawngka bul thlengin khawpui chu Lalpa tân din thar a ni ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ramri chu Gareb tlâng thlengin ngîl takin a kal ang a, Goa lamah a kawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mitthi phûmna leh bawlhhlawh paihna ruam pum pui leh a vêl ram zawng zawng, Kidron lui thlengin, chhak lam panga sakawr kawngka kil thleng chu Lalpa tân tihhran a ni. Chu chu engtikah mah tihdarh leh tihchhiat a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia lal kum sâwmnaah Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a; chu chu Nebukadnezara lal kum sâwm leh kum riatna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Babulon lal sipaite chuan Jerusalem an hual a, zâwlnei Jeremia pawh Juda lal in vêngtute chênna hmunah an tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia chuan chutah chuan a tântîr a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan, ‘Ngai teh, he khawpui hi Babulon lal kutah ka pe ang a, a la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia pawh Kaldai mite kut ata a chhuak lo vang, Babulon lal ka pe ang. Inhmatawnin an inbia ang a, chiang takin an inen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekia chu Babulon-ah a hruai ang a, amah ka tlawh hma chu chutah chuan a awm reng ang. Kaldai-ho chu do mahsela a hlawhtling chuang lo vang, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti,’ tiin engati nge i sawi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngai teh, i pami, Saluma fapa Hananela chu i hnênah a lo kal dâwn a, ‘Nang chhûngkhat laina hnai i ni bawk a, Anathot-a ka lo hi lei rawh’ a rawn ti ang che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu ang chuan ka pami fapa Hananela chu vêngtu hung chhûngah ka hnênah a lo kal a, ‘Benjamin bial chhûnga Anathot khuaa ka lo chu lei ta che, rokhâwm thei i ni a, i chan tûr a ni, i tân lei mai rawh,’ mi rawn ti ta a. Hei hi Lalpa thu kha a ni tih ka hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anathot khuaa ka pami fapa Hananela lo chu ka lei a, a man atân tangka ka han bûk a, tangkarua sekel sâwm leh pasarih lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan thiltih chu lehkhaah kan ziak fel a, kan châr a, hretute kan ko va, tangka chu kan bûk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram leina, inlei dân ziakna chu châr leh châr loh ka siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pami fapa Hananela mit hmuhah leh hretu, ram leina lehkhaa hming ziaktute leh hung chhûnga vêngtu, Juda ṭhuhote mit hmuhah Neria fapa Baruka, Maaseia tupa chu ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An beng hriatah Baruka chu hetiangin thu ka pe a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Hêng lehkha, ram inlei dân chhinchhiahna châr leh châr lohte hi la la, a chhiat theih loh nân hlumbelah dah ṭha rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: He ramah hian in te, lo te, grep huante an la lei dâwn,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Neria fapa Baruka hnêna ram leina lehkha ka pêk hnu chuan heti hian ka ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa P athian , i thiltihtheihna nasa tak hmanga bân phar meuhva lei leh vân siamtu, i tân thil tih harsa lutuk eng mah a awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang zawng sâng tam tak chunga khawngaihna lantîra, pate sualna fate thlenga thungrûltu, aw Pathian ropui leh thiltithei, i hming chu Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang, remruattu ropui leh thil tithei tak, mihringte khawsak dân tinrêng i hre reng ṭhîn. Mi tin an awm dân leh an thiltih ang zêla rûltu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aigupta rama thil mak leh chhinchhiahnate tia, vawiin thlenga Israel ramah leh hnam dang zînga ti zêltu, tûn thlengin i hming i chher a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil makte leh chhinchhiahnate, kut chak tak leh bân phar meuhva thil râpthlâk takte tiin i mi Israel-te Aigupta ram ata i hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />He ram, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ram hi an thlahtute hnêna pêk i lo tiam tawh angin i pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An lo kal a, an luah a; nimahsela, i thu an awih lo va, i Dân an zâwm hek lo. Tih tûra i thupêk rêng rêng eng mah an ti lo va. Chuvângin, hêng thil ṭha lo hi an chungah i thlentîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En teh, khawpui lâk nân lei an chhûn pâwn tâk hi. Khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te an tuar avângin khawpui pawh a rawn rûntu Kaldai-hovin an la ta a ni. I hmuh ang hian i lo hrilh lâwk kha a lo thleng ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw Lalpa P athian , nang lahin ka hnênah, ‘Lo chu tangkain lei la, thuhretute ko vang che; khawpui erawh zawng Kaldai-ho kutah pêk a ni ta,’ i ti si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah heti hian a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, kei Lalpa hi mi zawng zawng Pathian ka ni a, ka tâna tih harsa lutuk eng nge awm?’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, he khawpui hi Kaldai-ho leh Babulon lal kutah ka pe ang a, an la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />He khawpui beitu Kaldai-ho chu an lo lût ang a, khua hi an hâl vek ang. Min tithinur tûra an in chunga Baal hnêna rimtui an hlanna te, pathian dang hnêna in tûr thilhlan an leih buakna zawng zawngte chu a kâng vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An tleirâwl chhuah ata Israel fate leh Juda mite chuan ka mit hmuhah thil ṭha lo hlîr an ti si a. Israel fate chuan an thilsiamte chuan min tithinur a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />He khawpui hi, an din tirh ni aṭanga tûn thlengin min tithinurtu leh min tihlim lotu a ni reng a, ka hmuh loh tûrin ka sawn bo dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel mite leh Juda mite chuan thil ṭha lo an tih avângin min tithinur a, an lal te, hruaitu te, puithiam te, zâwlnei te leh Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawngte nên min tithinur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka lam hawi lovin tukkhum chhah min chhawn a, ṭhahnemngai taka ka zirtîr chungin an ngaithla duh lo va, ka zilhna an pawm duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An milem tenawm chu ka in thianghlimah an dintîr a, an tibawlhhlawh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Baal biak nân Ben-Hinom ruamah hmunsâng, an fanu te, an fapate, Moleka hnêna an hlanna tûr chu an siam a. Juda-ho hruai sual tûra he thil tenawm an tih hi ka thupêk a ni lo va, an tih duh pawh ka rin ngai loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “He khawpui hi Babulon lal kutah pêk a ni ang a; ‘ṭâm te, khandaih te, hripui te a tuar ang,’ tih a lo ni tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mahse, ngai teh, thinur takin lungnilo leh thinrim chungin anni chu ka hnawt darh a; mahse, ka hnawh chhuahna ram zawng zawng ata ka hruai khâwm leh ngei dâwn. He hmunah hian ka rawn thlen ang a, thlamuang takin ka awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka ta an ni ang a, kei hi an Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thinlung hmun khat puin ka awm hotîr ang a, kumkhuain min ṭih ang a, chu chu an tân leh an thlah zêlte tân a ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kumkhaw thuthlung ka siampui ang a, an tân thil ṭha tih ka bâng lo vang; min ṭih nachâng ka hriattîr ang a, min pên bosan tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An tâna thil ṭha tih chu ka lawmzâwng tak a ni ang a, he ramah hian ngêlnghet taka awmtîr ka tum tlat ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hêng mite chungah chhiatna nasa tak ka thlentîr ang khân an tâna thil ṭha pêk ka lo tiam tawh chu ka thlentîr ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />‘ram ruak, mihring leh ran awm lohna, Kaldai-hovin an lâksak tawh hnu’ tia miten an sawi ṭhin he ramah hian lote in lei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin bialah te, Jerusalem chhehvêl khuaah te, Judai ram khuaah te, tlângram khuaah te, thlang lam tuipui kamah te, chhim lamah te, tangkain lote in lei ang; an ziak fel ang a, an chhinchhiah tlat ang. Anni chu ka tungding leh dâwn a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûnga a la tân laiin a hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leilung siamtu Lalpa , dintu leh tinghettu Lalpa , a hming Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Min ko la, ka chhâng ang che, i hriat ngai loh thil ropui leh ril tak ka hrilh ang che.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan he khaw chhûnga ṭanhmun siam nân in te, Juda lal inte an ṭhiat tâk chungchâng heti hian a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka thinur nasa tak avângin anni chu ka hrem a, Kaldai-hote an beihlêt avângin an ruangte chuan khawpui hi ka tikhat ang. An sualna nasa tak avângin he khawpui hi ka hawisan tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, damna leh hrisêlna ka pe leh thuai ang a, ka mite chu ka tidam ang a, thlamuang tak leh him takin ka awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda leh Israel chu an saltânna ata ka hruai kîr leh ang a, tûnhmaa an awm dân ang khân ka awmtîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka laka an sualna leh khawlohna zawng zawng ka sil fai ang a, ka laka an helna te, an sualna leh khawlohna zawng zawngte ka ngaidam vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He khawpui hi thil ṭha ka tihsak tih hretu khawvêl hnam tinrêng mit hmuhah mi tihlimtu, mi tilâwmtu leh mi chawimawitu a ni ang a, thil ṭha tam tak leh hausakna nasa taka ka vûr avângin chûngho chuan anni chu an hlau vang a, an khûr ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “He hmun ram tawh, mihring leh ran awm tawh lohna tia an sawi ṭhin leh Judai ram khawpui te, Jerusalem kawtthlêr ram tawh, mihring leh ran awm lohna an tihahte chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hlim leh lâwm ri te, mo leh moneitu thâwm te, Lalpa ina lâwmna inthawina rite hriat a ni ang, hetiangin: ‘Engkim Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril ula, Lalpa chu a ṭha a, Kumkhuain ngil a nei dâwn si a,’ tiin. “Tûnhma ang khân ram chu ka dinthar leh dâwn,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “He hmun leh khawpui ram tawh zawng zawng, mihring leh ran awm tawh lohnaah hian berâmpute chu an berâm rual nên an awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlângram khawpuiah te, thlang lam tuipui kam khawpuiah te, chhim lam khawpuiah te, Benjamin bialah te, Jerusalem vêlah te, Judai ram khawpuiah te berâmputen an berâm an chhiar leh mawlh mawlh tawh ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng mêk e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Juda chhûngte leh Israel chhûngte hnêna thu ka tiam tawh chu ka hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng hunahte chuan Davida thlah aṭangin lal ṭha tak ka chawr chhuahtîr ang a, ani chuan ram pumah dik tak leh fel takin ro a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng hunah chuan Juda chu a him ang a, Jerusalem pawh thlamuang takin a awm ang. Chu lal chu a hming atân, ‘ Lalpa chu kan dikna,’ tih a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Davida chuan Israel chhûngte zîngah a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr mi a tlachham lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levia chi, puithiamte pawhin ka hnêna hâlral thilhlan inthawina tûr an tlachham hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah hetiangin a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chhûn leh zân awm tûrin thu ka thlung a, An hun bi vawng tlat tûrin thu ka thlung a, Chu thuthlung chu in tihdanglam theih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Davida hnêna ka thuthlung, ‘A thlahte an lal zêl tûr thu’ leh ‘Levia chi puithiamten ka rawng an bâwl zêl ang,’ Ti-a thu ka thlun pawh a thlâwn a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Davida thlahte leh ka rawng min bâwlsaktu Levia chite chu vâna arsi chhiar sên rual loh leh Tuipui kama ṭiau chhiar sên rual loh zâtin ka tipung ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Chhûngkaw hnih, Lalpa thlante chu paihthlâk an ni ta’ tia hêng miten an sawi chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chhûn leh zân awm tûra ka thu thlung hi a ngheh lohva, lei leh vân awm dân tûr ka ruat hi a nghet lo a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakoba thlahte leh ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu ka paihthla ang a, an fate chu Abrahama thlahte, Isaka thlahte, Jakoba thlahte chunga rorêltu atân ka thlang lo vang. Anni chu ka tungding leh ang a, ka khawngaih dâwn si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara leh a sipai rual zawng zawngte leh a ṭhuihruaia awm, lalram chhûnga hnam tin chi tinten Jerusalem leh a vêl khawpuite an beih laiin Lalpa thu Jeremia hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti, “Kal la, Juda lal Zedekia chu heti hian va hrilh rawh: Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, he khawpui hi Babulon lal hnênah ka pe ta, ani chuan meiin a hâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An man ang che a, a hnênah an pe ang che, a kut ata chu i chhuak lo vang. Babulon lal nên hmaichhanah in inbia ang, Babulon-ah a hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Juda lal Zedekia, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh: I chungthuah chuan Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Khandaihin i thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thih ṭhatin i thi ang a, in thlahtu, tûnhma lalte rimtui an hâlsak ṭhin angin nang pawh an hâlsak ang che. ‘A va pawi êm, ka pu!’ tiin an ṭah ang che.’ He ka thu sawi hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêng thu zawng zawng hi Jeremian Jerusalem-a Juda lal Zedekia a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babulon lal sipaiten Jerusalem leh Judai ram khawpui zawng zawng an beih lai chuan Judai rama khaw kulh nei awm chhun chu Lakis leh Azeka khua chauh hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Zedekia leh Jerusalem mi zawng zawngin bawih chhuah thu an puan hnuin Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi tinin an Hebrai bawih, mipa pawh hmeichhia pawh an chhuah tûr a ni. Tu man a Juda-pui bawihah a nei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, hotute leh mipui, thuthlung pawmtu zawng zawng chuan an bawihnu te, an bawihpate chu chhuaha hrên reng loh an remti tlâng a; an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahse, a hnu lâwkah an lamlêt a, an bawihnu leh bawihpa an chhuah tawhte chu la kîrin bawihah an siam leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “In saltânna, Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah lai che u khân in thlahtute nên thu kan thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu pawhin, kum sarih dan zêlah, a Hebrai-pui bawiha a lei chu a chhuah tûr a ni. Kum ruk rawng a lo bâwl tawh chuan chhuah ngei ngei tûr a ni; in pate khân ka thu an ngaithla lo va, min pawisa hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûn hnai mai khân in inchhîr a, ka mit hmuha thil dik in ti a, mi tinin mahni chipuite in chhuah tâk thu in puang a. Ka hming chuanna inah, ka hmaah thu in thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahse, in lamlêt leh a, ka hming in tichhia a, mi tinin in bawihnu leh bawihpate in chhuah chauh va, in bawiha awm leh tûrin in la lui leh ta a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thu in zâwm lo va, in chipuite tân zalênna thu in puang lo va, kei erawh chuan in tân zalênna thu ka puang ta: khandaih te, hripui te, ṭâm tea in thihna tûr zalênna chu. Khawvêl ram tin tân ṭihkhaiah ka siam ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thuthlung bawhchhiaa ka hmaa thuthlung an siam bawhchhiaa, thuthlung zâwm lo chu bâwngno zai bun, a kâra an kal tlang ṭhinna angin ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda hruaitute, Jerusalem-a hruaitute, rorêltute, puithiamte, ram chhûng mipui, bâwngno tan bun kâra kalte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />an hmêlma, thah tumtute kutah ka pe ang. An ruang chu chunglêng savate leh ramsate chaw a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia leh a upate chu an hmêlma, anmahni thah tumtute leh Babulon lal sipai, anmahni ṭinsantute kutah ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />He khawpuia lo lût leh tûrin thu ka pe ang. An rawn bei leh ang a, an la ang a, an hâl chhe vek ang. Juda khawpuite chu luahtu awm lovin ka tiram ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal laiin Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah hetiangin a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Rekaba chhûngte hnênah kal la, Lalpa in pindan chhûngah hruai la, anni chu uain in tûr pe rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Habazinia fapa, Jeremia fa, Jaazania leh a unaute, a fa zawng zawngte leh Rekaba chhûngte zawng zawng chu ka hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa inah chuan anni chu ka hruai a, Pathian mi Igdalia fapa Hanana fate pindanah ka luhpui a, chu chu hotute pindan kiang, kawngkhâr vêngtu Saluma fapa Maaseia pindan chunga awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Rekaba chhûngte hmaah chuan chawhtawlh khat uain leh no ka dah a. “Uain hi in rawh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Uain kan in ngai lo, kan pa Rekaba fapa Jonadaba chuan, ‘Nangni leh in fate hian kumkhuain uain in reng reng suh u,’ tiin thu min chah a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ ‘In pawh in sa tûr a ni lo, thlai in chîng tûr a ni lo va, grep huan pawh in siam tûr a ni hek lo. He in mikhualna ramah hian in dam rei theihna tûrin in dam chhûng nite chu puan inahte hmang zâwk ang che u,’ tiin thu min pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, kan thlahtupa Rekaba fapa Jonadaba thu min pêk zawng zawng chu kan zâwm a, keini leh kan nupuite, kan fapate leh fanute chenin tu man uain kan in ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan awmna tûr in kan sa lo va, grep huan kan siam lo va, lo leh thlai kan nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puan inahte kan chêng a, min thlahtu Jonadaba thu min pêk chu a kip a kawiin kan zâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran he ram a rûn khân keini chuan, ‘Hawh u, Babulon sipai leh Suria sipai laka kan him nân Jerusalem-ah i chho vang u,’ kan ti a; tichuan, Jerusalem-ah hian kan awm ta a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte hnênah kal la, hêng thu hi sawi rawh, ‘Ka thute ngaithla lovin ka zirtîrnate in pawm lo vang maw?’ Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekaba fapa Jonadaba fate chuan an thlahtuten uain in lo tûra thu an pêk chu zâwmin tûn thlengin an in ta lo va. Kei erawh chuan in hnêna thu ka sawi ka sawi pawhin in ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka rawngbâwltu, zâwlnei zawng zawngte in hnêna zing tak taka ka tirhten, ‘Mi tinin in awm dân sual hawisanin in thiltihte siam ṭha ula, pathian dangte rawng bâwl suh u; tichuan, nangni leh in thlahtute ka pêk ram hi in luah dâwn nia,’ an ti a. Mahse, min ngaihsak lo va, ka thu in ngaithla duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rekaba fa, Jonadaba thlahte chuan an thlahtu thupêk an zâwm a, nangni erawh chuan ka thu in zâwm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawng chunga chhiatna lo thleng tûr ka sawite kha ka thlentîr dâwn e. An hnênah thu ka sawi a, an ngaithla si lo, ka ko va, min chhâng duh hek lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Rekaba chhûngte hnênah, “Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: In thlahtu Jonadaba thupêk leh a thu zirtîr zawng zawng in pawm a, a thupêk zawng zawng chu in zâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Rekaba fapa Jonadaba thlahte chu kumkhuain ka hmaa ding tûr an awm reng ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa, Jehoiakima lal kum linaah Lalpa thu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lehkhabu zial la la, Israel-te chungchâng te, Juda leh hnam dang chungchâng te i hnêna ka sawi zawng zawng chu ziak rawh. Josia lal laia i hnêna thu ka sawi ṭan ni aṭanga vawiin thlenga ka sawite kha ziak vek rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda mite chuan an chunga chhiatna thlentîr ka tumte chu hriain an awm dân sualte an sim mial mahna; an sim chuan an khawlohna leh an sualna chu ka lo ngaidam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chuan Neria fapa Baruka chu a ko va, a hnêna Lalpa thu sawi zawng zawng chu Jeremia chuan a sawi chhuak a, chu chu lehkhabu-ah Baruka chuan a lo ziak zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Baruka hnênah, “ Lalpa ina kal thei lovin min khuahkhirh tlat si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chuvângin, nang, chaw nghei ni-ah Lalpa inah kal la, Lalpa thu, lehkhabu ziala ka ziaktîr che kha, Lalpa ina awmte hnênah chhiar chhuak rawh, Juda mi, an khua aṭanga lo kal zawng zawng hriatah pawh chhiar ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mite chuan an awm dân sualte hawisanin Lalpa hnênah ngaihdam an dil mial mahna. Lalpa thupuan, a mite laka a thinur nasa tak hi a râpthlâk si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Neria fapa Baruka chuan zâwlnei Jeremia hrilh ang zêl chuan Lalpa thu chu Lalpa inah chuan a chhiar chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa, Jehoiakima lal kum ngana, thla kuanaah chuan Jerusalem-a mi zawng zawng leh Judai ram khawpui aṭanga Jerusalem-a lo kal zawng zawngte chuan Lalpa hmaa chaw nghei thu an puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Baruka chuan lehkhabu ziala Jeremia thute chu ziaktu Safana fapa Gemaria pindan, Lalpa inah chuan mi zawng zawng hriatah a chhiar a. Chu hmun chu Lalpa in chuanchung luhna kawngka thar bula awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Safana fapa, Gemaria fapa Mikaia chuan lehkhabu ziala Lalpa thu zawng zawng chu a lo hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />lal inah a chhuk a, ziaktu pindanah chuan a lût a; tah chuan hotu zawng zawng an lo ṭhu a. Chûng mite chu Elisama te, Semaia fapa Delaia te, Akbora fapa Elnathana te, Safana fapa Gemaria te, Hanania fapa Zedekia te leh hotu dang zawng zawngte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Barukan mipui hnêna lehkhabu zial a chhiar aṭanga a thil hriat zawng zawng chu Mikaia chuan anni chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hotute chuan Nethania fapa Jehudia, Selemia tupa, Kusia tupa chu Baruka hnênah an tîr a, a hnênah, “Mite hmaa i chhiar chhuah lehkhabu zial chu rawn keng la, lo kal rawh,” an ti a. Neria fapa Baruka chu lehkhabu zial kengin an hnênah a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hnênah, “Ṭhu la, kan hriatah chhiar ve teh le,” an ti a. Tin, Baruka chuan an hnênah a chhiar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hriatin an inen a, Baruka hnênah chuan, “Hêng thu hi lal hnênah kan hrilh ngei ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baruka hnênah chuan, “Hêng thute hi engtin nge i ziak, Jeremia thuchhuak ngei a ni maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baruka chuan, “Hêng thute hi ka hnênah a sawi a, keiin lehkhabu zialah ka lo ziak chhâwng mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, hotute chuan Baruka hnênah, “Chhuak la, Jeremia nên biru rawh u, tu man in awmna hre suh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, lal in hung chhûngah an lût a, lehkhabu zial chu ziaktu Elisama pindanah an hnutchhiah a, lal hnênah an thu hriat zawng zawng chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal chuan Jehudia chu lehkhabu zial la tûrin a tîr a, ziaktu Elisama pindan ata chu a va la chhuak a. Jehudia chuan lal leh a vêla hotu ding zawng zawng hriatah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thla kuana a ni a, lal chu a thlasik ina awm a ni a, meihawl thuk vâm huam chu a ai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehudia chuan lehkhabu zial thlûr thum emaw, thlûr li emaw a chhiar hnu chuan lal chuan chemtêin a zaibung a, thukah a paih lût a, lehkhabu zial chu a kâng ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal leh a ṭhuihruaiho, hêng thu zawng zawng hretute chuan hlau hmêl an pu lo va, an puante an pawtthlêr hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elnathana te, Delaia te, Gemaria ten lehkhabu zial hâl lo tûra lal chu an ngen chiam pawhin a sâwt chuang lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal chuan, ziaktu Baruka leh zâwlnei Jeremia chu man tûrin lal fapa Jerameela te, Azriela fapa Seraia te, Abdeela fapa Selamia te chu thu a pe ta a; mahse, Lalpa chuan anni chu a thukru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lehkhabu zial, Jeremia sawi chhuah Barukan a ziak zawng zawng chu lalin a hâl ral hnu chuan Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Lehkhabu zial dang la la, lehkhabu zial hmasaa thu zawng zawng, Juda lal Jehoiakiman a hâl ral tâkte kha, ziak leh vek rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Juda lal Jehoiakima chungchâng thu-ah heti hian ti ang che: ‘Babulon lal a lo kal ang a, he ram hi a tichhia ang a, mihring leh rante a tiboral vek ang, tiin engati nge i ziak?’ tiin lehkhabu zial chu i hâl vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, Juda lal Jehoiakima chungthuah Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Davida lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr mi a nei lo vang, a ruang chu chhûn ni sa leh zân khaw vâwt tuar tûrin theh chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An sual avângin amah leh a thlahte leh a rawngbâwltute chu ka hrem ang. An chunga chhiatna lo thleng tûr ka sawi te, Jerusalem leh Judai ram mi tin chunga lo thleng tûr ka sawi te hi an pawisak loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremian lehkhabu zial dang a la a, Neria fapa Baruka, ziaktu hnênah a pe a, ani chuan Jeremia ṭawngka chhuak, lehkhabua ziak tawh zawng zawng, Jehoiakiman a hâl ral tâk thute leh a anpui thu dangte nên a ziak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran Judai ram lal atâna a dah Josia fapa Zedekia chu Jehoiakima fapa Konia aiah a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mahse, amah leh a ṭhuihruaite leh a rama mite chuan Lalpa thu zâwlnei Jeremia sawi chu an pawisa lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan Selemia fapa Jehukala leh Maaseia fapa puithiam Zefania chu zâwlnei Jeremia hnênah, ‘khawngaih takin Lalpa , kan Pathian hnênah min ṭawngṭaisak rawh,’ ti tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jeremia chu vântlâng zîngah zalên takin a la vâk vêl thei a, tân inah an la khung lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Farawa sipaite chu Aigupta aṭangin an lo chhuak chho va. An thâwm chu Jerusalem hualtu, Kaldai-hoten an hriatin Jerusalem chu an ṭinsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu zâwlnei Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda lal, min râwn tûra rawn tîrtu che u hnênah chuan heti hian sawi rawh u: ‘Ngai teh, Farawa sipai, nangmah pui tûra lo chhuakte chu, an ram Aigupta-ah an kîr leh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaldai-ho chu an lo lêt leh ang a, he khawpui hi an bei ang a, an la ang a, an hâl chhe vek ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Kaldai-ho chuan min kalsan ngei ang tiin mahni inbum suh u. An kal bo hlen dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmahni rawn beitu Kaldai sipai rual hi hneh vek mah ula, an zînga hliam tuar, an puan ina mute pawh chu, an lo tho leh ang a, he khawpui hi an hâl chhe vek ang, tiin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farawa sipai rual an lo hnaih avânga Kaldai sipaite Jerusalem aṭanga an tawlh kîr lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeremia chuan a chipuite zînga a ro chanpual la tûrin Jerusalem chhuahsanin Benjamin bialah a kal dâwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Benjamin kawngka chu a thlen chuan vêngtu zînga hotu, a hming Iriza, Selemia fapa, Hanania tupa ni bawk chuan zâwlnei Jeremia chu, “Kaldai-ho hnêna inpêk i tum a nih hi,” tiin a lo man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeremia chuan “Tum lo ve, Kaldai-ho hnênah inpêk ka tum awzâwng lo,” a tih pawhin Iriza chuan a thu sawi chu a ngaithla duh lo va, Jeremia chu a man a, hotute hnênah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hotute chu Jeremia chungah chuan an thinur hle a, an vua a, ziaktu Jonathana inah an tântîr a, chu chu tân in atân an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeremia chu khur thim takah ni rei tak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan a ko chhuak a, ani chu an rawn hruai a. Lal chuan a rûk têin a inah chuan thu a zâwt a, “ Lalpa hnên ata thu eng emaw tal a awm em?” a ti a. Jeremia chuan, “Awm e, Babulon lal kutah i inpe tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremia chuan lal Zedekia hnênah chuan, “I lakah emaw, i ṭhuihruaite lakah emaw, mipui lakah emaw, eng nge ka tihsual, eng vângin nge tân ina min dah?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“ ‘Babulon lal chu nangmah leh he ram do tûrin a lo kal lo vang’ tia thu puangtu i zâwlneite kha khawiah nge an awm tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tûnah, ka pu Lalber, khawngaih takin ngaithla teh, ka dîl che hi min phalsak hrâm rawh. Ziaktu Jonathana inah chuan min kîrtîr lul suh ang che, chumi hmunah zawng ka thi mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan thu a pe a, Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a tântîr a, chhang siamtute hnên aṭangin ni tin chhang tlang khat khawpuia chhang a awm chhûng chu a pe a. Chutiang chuan Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Matana fapa Sefatia te, Pasura fapa Gedalia te, Selemia fapa Jukala te, Malakia fapa Pasura te chuan mi hnêna hetianga Jeremia thu sawi chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘He khawpuia awmte chu khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripuite tuarin an thi ang a, Kaldai-ho hnêna inpete erawh chu an him ang; an man ang a, an nung ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘He khawpui hi Babulon lal sipaite kutah pêk a ni ngei ang a; tichuan, an la ang’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hotute chuan lal hnênah, “He mi hi tihhlum tûr a ni, he khawpuia sipai la awmte leh mipuite hi hêng thu a sawi avângte hian an zâm zo ta si a. He mi hian mipui ṭhatna zawng lovin an chhiatna tûr a zawng zâwk a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan, “Ngai teh u, ani chu in kuta awm alâwm, lal hi in duh loh zâwng ti thei a ni hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chu an hruai a, vêngtu hung chhûnga lal fapa Malkia tuichhunchhuah chhûngah an thlâk a; Jeremia chu hruizênin an thlâk a ni, a chhûngah chuan chirhdiak chauh lo chu tui rêng a tling lo va, chirhdiakah chuan Jeremia chu a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ethiopia mi, mi tilreh, lal ina awm ṭhîn Ebedmeleka chuan Jeremia chu tuichhunchhuah mawngah an thlâk tih a lo hria a. Chutih lai chuan lal chu Benjamin kawngkaah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ebedmeleka chu lal in ata a chhuak a, lal hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pu, lalber, hêng mite hian zâwlnei Jeremia chungah thil sual nasa tak an ti a ni. Tuichhunchhuah chhûngah an thlâk a, rilṭâmin chutah chuan a thi mai ang, khawpuiah chaw a awm tawh si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal chuan Ethiopia mi Ebedmeleka chu thu a pe a, “Heta ṭangin mi sawmthum hruai la, zâwlnei Jeremia chu a thih hmain tuichhunchhuah ata chu la chhuak rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ebedmeleka chuan mite chu a hruai a, lal tangka in hnuai, thawmhnaw hlui dahnaah chuan an lût a, chuta kawr leh puan chhiate chu an la a, tuichhunchhuah chhûnga Jeremia hnênah chuan hruizênin an thlâkthla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ethiopia mi, Ebedmeleka chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Hêng kawr hlui leh puan chhiate hi i zak damah hrên hnan rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chu tuichhunchhuah ata chu hruizênin an khai chhuak a, vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan Jeremia chu a ko va, Lalpa in luhna kawngkhâr pathumnaah an rawn hruai a. Lal chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Thil ka zâwt ang che a, ka hnênah eng mah sawi hreh suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Zedekia hnênah, “Ka hrilh vek che chuan min tihlum mai lo vang maw? Thu râwn che mah ila min ngaithla awm si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan Jeremia hnênah: “ Lalpa , ka nunna siamtu hmingin ka tihlum tawp lo vang che, hêng tihhlum tumtu che hnênah pawh hian ka pe tawp lo vang che,” tiin a rûk têin thu a tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Zedekia hnênah, “Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Babulon lal sipai kuta in inpêk chuan in him ang a, he khawpui hi hâl chhiat a ni lo vang a, nang leh i chhûngte pawh zuah in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon lal sipai kuta in inpêk loh erawh chuan he khawpui hi Babulon mite kutah pêk a ni ang, an hâl chhe vek ang a, nang pawh an kut ata i chhuak lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Babulon mite hnêna inpe Juda-hote hi ka hlau a ni. An kutah min pe ang a, min sawisa hrep mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeremia chuan, “An pe hauh lo vang che, Lalpa thu ka hrilh che hi awih mai rawh; chu chu i tân a ṭha ang, i nun pawh zuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I inpêk duh loh erawh chuan hei hi Lalpa thu min hriattîr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda lal ina hmeichhe la awm zawng zawng chu Babulon lal hotute hnênah an hruai ang a, chûng hmeichhiate chuan i hnênah heti hian an sawi ang: ‘I ṭhian ṭhaten an bum che a, an thuhnuaiah an dah ta che, chirhdiaka i ke a tân laiin an hawisan ta che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“I nupui leh i fate chu Babulon-ah an hruai vek ang. Nang pawh an kut ata i chhuak lo vang; Babulon lalin a man ang che a, he khawpui hi a kâng chhe vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zedekia chuan Jeremia hnênah: “Hêng thute hi tu man hre suh se; tichuan, i thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hotuten ka bia che tih an hriat chuan i hnênah an lo kal ang a, ‘Lal hnênah eng nge i sawia, lalin i hnênah eng nge a sawi, min hrilh rawh, eng mah zêp suh, kan tihlum lo vang che,’ an tih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nangin an hnênah, ‘Lal chu Jonathana ina min tîr kîr lo tûrin ka ngên a ni, i ti dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An vaiin hotute chu Jeremia hnênah an lo kal a, an zâwt ta ngei a, lalin sawi tûra a tih angin anni chu a lo hrilh a. Tichuan, a hnênah eng mah an sawi zêl ta lo va, lal nêna an inbiakna thu pawh tu man an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeremia chu Jerusalem an lâk ni thlengin vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai lal Zedekia lal kum kuana, a thla sâwmnaah Babulon lal Nebukadnezara leh a sipai rualte chuan Jerusalem an rûn a, an hual tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekia lal kum sâwm leh kum khatna, thla lina, ni kua ni chuan kulh chu tihchim a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Babulon lal milianhote chu an lo lût a, kawngka laita bulah chuan awmhmun an rem a. Chûng mite chu: Nergal-serezera te, Samgarneboa te, Sarsekima te, Rab-saria te, Nergal-sarezera te, Rabmaga te leh Babulon lal milian leh hotu dang te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia leh a sipai zawng zawngte chuan anni chu an hmuhin an tlânchhe ta a. Zânah lal huan kawng, kulh bang pahnih inkâr kawngah an relhru a, Arabah lam panna kawngah an tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Babulon sipaite chuan anni chu an ûm a, Jordan phaiah Zedekia chu an ûm pha a, an man a, Babulon lal Nebukadnezara hnênah, Hamat rama Ribla khuaah an hruai a; chutah chuan a chungthu an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon lal chuan Ribla hmunah Juda mi ṭha zawng zawng leh a fate chu Zedekia hmuh lai ngeiin a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekia mitmu a kher chhuak a, thîr kawl a buntîr a, Babulon-ah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaldai-ho chuan lal in leh in dang zawng zawng chu an hâl a, Jerusalem kulh bangte an tichim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal vêngtu hotu, Nebuzaradana chuan khawpuia mipui la awmte, a hnêna inpete nên, an za vaiin Babulon-ah salah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana chuan mi rethei, eng mah nei lote chu Judai ramah chuan a hnutchhiah a, grep huan leh lote a pe nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chuan lal vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana hnênah hetiangin thu a pe a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ani hi chu hruai la, ṭha takin enkawl rawh, tina rêng rêng suh, a ngen apiang tihsak zâwk ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, lal vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana te, sipai lal ber Nebusazbana te, aienthiam hotupa Nergel-Sarezara te leh Babulon hotu lian zawng zawngte chuan Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûng ata an hruai chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Safana fa, Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah, a ina hruai tûrin an hlân a; tichuan, mi dang zîngah a khawsa ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vêngtu hung chhûnga Jeremia a awm lai chuan Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kal la Ebedmeleka hrilh rawh, ‘Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti: He khawpui ṭhatna tûr ni lovin a chhiatna tûr zâwkin ka thute ka hlen dâwn. Chutih hunah chuan, i mit hmuh ngeiah chung thil chu a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan, nang erawh chu ka hum ang che,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. I hlauhte kutah chuan pêk i ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka chhan ang che a, khandaihah i thi lo vang a, i him zâwk ang, mi rin tlat avângin,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana chuan Rama khua aṭanga Jeremia a chhuahtîr hnuin a hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a. Jeremia chu Judai ram leh Jerusalem aṭanga sal man, khaidiat bun chunga Babulon lama an hruai chhohte zîngah a tel ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal vêngtu hotu chuan Jeremia chu a hruai hrang a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa , i Pathian chuan he hmuna chhiatna lo thleng tûr hi a lo puang tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tûnah, a sawi ang ngeiin a thlentîr ta a nih hi. Lalpa chungah thil in tisual a, a thu in awih loh avângin hêng hi a lo thleng ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mahse, nang zawng, vawiin aṭangin i khaidiat bun hi ka phelhsak a che. I duh chuan ka hnênah Babulon-ah kal la, ka enkawl ang che. I duh loh leh lo kal lo mai la, i duh duhnaah i kal thei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jeremian a chhân hmain “Babulon lalin Juda khuate awp tûra a ruat, Safana fa, Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah kîr leh la, a hnênah awm ang che, a nih leh i duh duhnaah i kal dâwn nia,” a ti leh a. Tichuan, lal vêngtu hotu chuan ei tûr leh thilpêk a pe a, a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jeremia chu Ahikama fa Gedalia hnênah Mizpa khuaah a kal a, an rama la châmbângte zîngah a awm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sipai hotute leh mi dang, ramhnuaia awm zawng zawng chuan Babulon lalin Ahikama fapa Gedalia chu ram awptu, ram chhûnga mi retheite leh hmeichhia te, naupang te, Babulon-a sala hruai ve loh te enkawltu atân a ruat tih an lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mizpa khuaah Gedalia hmu tûrin hêng mi, Nethania fapa Ismaela te, Korea fapa Johanana te, Tanhumeta fapa Seraia te, Netofa mi Efaia fapa, Makath mi Jezania leh mi dang te an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Safana fa Ahikama fapa Gedalia chuan an hnênah leh a mite hnênah chuan, “Kaldai-ho rawngbâwl chu hlau reng reng suh u, ram hi luah ula, Babulon lal rawng hi bâwl ula, in tân a ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei pawh in aiawha Babulon mite hmaa ding tûrin Mizpa khuaah ka awm ang a, nangnin uain te, nipui thei te, hriak te la khâwm ula, in bêlahte khung ṭha ang che u; in khaw luahahte chuan chêng reng ang che u,” tiin an hnênah thu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin, Moab rama Juda awm zawng zawng te, Edom rama awmte leh ram danga Juda awm zawng zawngte chuan Babulon lalin mi tlêm tê Judai rama a hnutchhiah thu leh Safana fa, Ahikama fapa Gedalia chu chûngho awptu atân a ruat tih an lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, an darhna ram hrang hrang ata Juda-te chu Judai ramah an lo kîr a, Mizpa khuaa awm Gedalia hnênah an lo thleng a, uain leh nipui thei tam tak an kensak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana leh sipai hotu ramhnuaia la awmte pawh chu Mizpa khuaa Gedalia hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnênah, “Amon mite lal Baalisa chuan Nethania fapa Ismaela chu nangmah that tûrin a tîr tih i hre na nge?” an ti a. Ahikama fapa Gedalia erawh chuan a ring lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana chuan a rûk têin Mizpa khuaa awm Gedalia hnênah chuan “Nethania fapa Ismaela that tûr chuan min kaltîr mai teh, eng vângin nge i nunna a lâk ang? Nangmah bêla Juda mi awm zawng zawng leh Judai rama la châmbângte chu an darhin an boral vek dâwn asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahikama fapa Gedalia erawh chuan Korea fapa Johanana hnênah chuan, “Chu thil chu ti suh, Ismaela chungchâng i sawi hi dâwt a ni,” a tihsan a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla sarihnaah chuan Elisama fa, Nethania fapa Ismaela, lal chi, lal khâwnbâwl zînga mi chu mi sâwm hruaiin Mizpa khuaah Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah a lo kal a, Mizpa khuaah chuan chaw an ei ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nethania fapa Ismaela chu a mi hruai sâwmte nên chuan an tho thut a, Safana fapa Ahikama fa Gedalia, Babulon lalin ramawptua a dah chu, khandaihin an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ismaela chuan Mizpa khuaa Gedalia hnêna Juda awm zawng zawng leh Babulon sipai, chumi hmuna awmte chu a that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gedalia an thah tûkah, tu mahin an hriat hmain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sekem aṭang te, Silo aṭang te, Samaria aṭang tein mi sawmriat an lo thleng a. An khabehmul an mêt a, an kawrte an tiṭet a, an inzai kak a, Lalpa ina chhang leh rimtui hlân tûra lo kal an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nethania fapa Ismaela chu Mizpa aṭangin anmahni lo hmuak tûrin a chhuak a, kawng tluanin a ṭap a. Anni chu a han hmuh chuan an hnênah, “Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah lo kal rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui chhûng an lo luh chuan Nethania fapa Ismaela leh a ṭhuihruaite chuan an lo that a, khuarkhurumah an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng zînga mi sâwmte erawh chuan Ismaela hnênah, “Min that suh, buh te, barli te, hriak te, khawizu te lovah kan thukru ṭeuh a nia,” an ti a. Tichuan, anni chu a zuah a, an ṭhiante zîngah chuan an that ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ismaelan a mi thahte ruang a paihna khuarkhurum chu lal Asa-an Israel lal Baasa laka invên nâna a laih a ni. Nethania fapa Ismaela chuan Gedalia leh a hote a thah ruangin a tikhat tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ismaela chuan Mizpah-a mi la awm zawng zawng, lal fanu te, lal vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradanan Gedalia enkawl tûra Mizpa khuaa a dah zawng zawngte chu salah a man a, Nethania fapa Ismaela chuan Amon ramah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana leh sipai hotu, a hnêna awm zawng zawngte chuan Nethania fapa Ismaelan thil sual a tihte chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nethania fapa Ismaela bei tûrin an mite an khâwm a, an kal ta a. Gibeon khaw kianga dîl lian tak bulah chuan an va ûmphâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ismaela hnêna mipui awm zawng zawngte chuan Korea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna sipai hotu awm zawng zawng chu an hmuhin an lâwm ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ismaelan Mizpa aṭanga sala a hruai zawng zawng chu an lo kîr a, Korea fapa Johanana hnênah an pakai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nethania fapa Ismaela leh a hote pariat chu Johanana lak aṭangin an him hrâm a, Amon mite hnênah an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna sipai hotu awmte chuan Nethania fapa Ismaelan Ahikama fapa Gedalia a thah hnua Mizpa aṭanga sala a man zawng zawng indo mi te, hmeichhia te, naupang te, mi tilreh te chu Gibeon aṭangin an hruai haw ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Aigupta rama kal tumin an kal zêl a, Bethlehem kiang Gerut chhim lam hmunah chuan an châwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon lalin ram awptu atâna a dah Ahikama fapa Gedalia chu Nethania fapa Ismaelan a thah avângin Kaldai-ho chu an hlau hle a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana te, Hosaia fapa Jezania te, sipai hotu zawng zawng leh mipui, a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremia hnênah chuan, “Kan dîl hi min ngaihthlâksak la, Lalpa kan Pathian hnênah mi la dam zawng zawng tân ṭawngṭai rawh. Min hmuh ang hian tam tak ni ṭhîn kha, tlêm tê chauh hnutchhiah kan ni ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , i Pathianin kan kawng zawh tûr te, kan tih tûr te min kawhhmuh rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremia chuan anni chu a chhâng a, “In thu chu ka hria e, tûnah, Lalpa , in Pathian hnênah in ngen angin ka dîlsak ang che u, Lalpa chuan in hnêna a sawi apiang ka hrilh ang che u a, in lakah eng mah ka zêp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chuan Jeremia hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathianin kan tâna thu a hrilh che anga kan tih loh chuan Lalpa chu kan lakah hretu rinawm leh dik tak ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan tirhna che Lalpa thu chu a chhia a ṭha kan zâwm ang. Lalpa , kan Pathian thu kan awih zêl chuan kan tân a ṭha dâwn si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sâwm hnuah Jeremia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna sipai hotu awm zawng zawng te, mipui, a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, a hnêna ṭawngṭai tûra min tirhna khân heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘He rama in awm reng chuan ka tungding ang che u a, ka tidarh lo vang che u. Ka phun ang che u a, ka pawt chhuak lo vang che u. In chungah thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr avângin ka rilru a na a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In hlauh Babulon lal hi hlau tawh suh u, ani chu hlau suh u,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Chhan tûr che u leh a kut ata chhan chhuak tûr che uin kei in hnênah ka awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka khawngaih ang che u a, ani pawhin a khawngaih ang che u; tichuan, in ramah hian in awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Amaherawhchu, Lalpa in Pathian thu zâwm lova, ‘He ramah hian kan awm lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta ramah kan kal zâwk ang; tah chuan, indo thâwm te, tawtawrâwt ri te, ṭâm te hre lovin kan awm ang,’ in tih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda mi la dam chhunte u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u; Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aigupta rama lûta awm in tum tlat chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khandaih in hlauh ngei khân Aigupta ramah a nangchîng ang che u, in hlauh ṭhin ṭâmin Aigupta ramah a ûmzui ang che u a; tah chuan, in thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni, Aigupta rama kala awm tum lui apiangte chu khandaih te, ṭâm te, hrite tuarin an thi ang. Thil ṭha lo an chunga ka thlentîr tûr lak ata tu mah himin an chhuak lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka thinurna nasa tak Jerusalem-a ka leihbua ang khân Aigupta-a kalte chungah pawh ka leihbua ang. Ânchhia te, hmusit te, sawichhiat te leh hau te in tuar ang a, he ram hi in hmu leh tawh lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda mi la dam chhunte u, Lalpa chuan a hrilh che u hi, Aigupta-ah chuan lût suh u. Vawiina ka thu hrilh che u hi ngai pawimawh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thihpui hial khawp thil sual lian tak in ti a ni. Lalpa , in Pathian hnênah min tîr a, ‘ Lalpa , kan Pathian hnênah min ṭawngṭaisak la, a sawi apiang kan ti ang,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûnah, in hnêna ka puan, Lalpa , in Pathianin min hrilh chu in zâwm leh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah, hre rawh u, in awm duhna hmun ngeiah chuan khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri te tuarin in thi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa an Pathianin mi tin hnêna sawi tûra a tirh ang taka Lalpa , an Pathian thu chu, mi zawng zawng hnêna Jeremian a sawi hnu chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hosaia fapa Azaria leh Korea fapa Johanana leh mi chapohote chuan, “Dâwt i sawi a ni, Lalpa kan Pathianin, ‘Aigupta rama awm tûrin kal suh u,’ tia sawi tûrin a tîr lo che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaldai miten min mana min thah emaw, Babulon-a sala min hruai theihna tûrin emaw Neria fapa Baruka chuan a fuihpawrh che a nih zâwk hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Korea fapa Johanana te, sipai hotute leh mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Judai rama awm tûr,’ tia Lalpa thupêk chu an zâwm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Korea fapa Johanana leh sipai hotu zawng zawng chuan Juda mi la dam chhun, hnam tin zînga an hnawhdarhna ata Judai rama awm tûra lo kîrte chu an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûngte chu mipa te, hmeichhia te, naupang te, lal fanu te, lal vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradanan Safana fa, Ahikama fapa Gedalia hova awm tûra a hnutchhiah te, zâwlnei Jeremia te, Neria fapa Baruka te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu zâwm lovin Aigupta ramah chuan an lût a, Tahfanes khua an thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tahfanes-ah chuan Lalpa thu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Juda mite hmuh lai ngeiin lung lian pui pui la la, Tahfanes hmuna Farawa in panna kawng rem sirah hlum chawhdiakah phûm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hnênah heti hian ti ang che, ‘Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ka chhiahhlawh Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chu ka rawn tîr ang a, hêng lung; he laia ka phûmtîr che chungahte hian a lalṭhutthlêng a hûng ang a, a puan in a kaih bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chu a lo kal ang a, Aigupta ram chu a rawn la dâwn a ni. Thi tûra an ruat chu an thi ang a, sala hruai tûra a tihte salah a hruai ang a, khandaiha thah tûr a tihte chu a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta mite pathian inte chu a hâl chhe vek ang a, an pathian chu a la bo vek bawk ang. Berâmpuin a kawr ata hrik a enfai angin Aigupta ram chu a thian fai vek ang a, ngaihngam takin a hâwnsan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta rama ni pathian an biakna in ban lung an cheite chu a titliak ang a, Aigupta mite pathian biak inte chu a hâl chhe vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta rama Juda awm zawng zawng, Migdol khuaa awm te, Tahfanes khuaa awm te, Nof khuaa awm te, Pathros rama awmte chungchânga Lalpa thu Jeremia hnêna lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Jerusalem leh Judai ram khawpui zawng zawng ka tihchhiat in hmu a, tûnah hian a ram vek a, tu mah an awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil sual tiin min tithinur a, anni leh in thlahtute pawhin in hriat ngai loh pathiante biaa rimtui in hâl avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite in hnênah ka rawn tîr fo va, hêng thil tenawm, ka huatzâwng hi ti lo tûrin an hrilh ṭhîn che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, in ngaithla lo va, in pawisa hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thinur nasa tak chu ka leihbua a, Juda khawpuite leh Jerusalem kawtthlêrte chu a kâng ta a ni. Vawiina a awm ang hian nasa takin a chhe ta a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan tûnah thu a sawi e: “Engati nge in zînga mipa leh hmeichhia, naupang leh nausên, Juda-te zînga tu mah zuah lova lâk bo vekna khawp hetiang thil ṭha lo in tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In khawsakna Aigupta ram pathiante hnênah rimtui in hâl a, in siamchawp milemte ngei chuan min tithinur ta a nih hi. Khawvêl hnam tin sawichhiat leh ânchhe dawng atân in insiam a, in intichhe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judai ram leh Jerusalem kawtthlêra in thlahtute suahsualna te, Juda lalte leh an nupuite thil sual tihte leh in nupuite nêna in bawhchhiatnate chu in theihnghilh ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vawiin thlengin in la sim lo va, min ṭih chuang hek lo. Nangni leh in thlahtute tâna ka dân leh ka thupêk in zâwm lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, in tâna thil ṭha lo, Juda zawng zawng boral vekna tûr ka thlentîr dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda mi la dam chhun, Aigupta rama pêm tumte chu ka la bo vang. Aigupta ramah chuan khandaih an tuar ang a, ṭhenkhat rilṭâmin an thi ang a, an boral vek ang. A tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin khandaih leh ṭâm tuarin an thi ang. Mi ânchhia an dawng ang a, hlauh te, sawichhiat te, hau te an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem-a awmte ka hrem ang bawkin Aigupta-a awmte chu khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri tein ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta rama Juda mi la dam chhunte chuan kîr an châk êm êm ang a; mahse, tu mah Judai ramah nungdamin an kîr lo vang; mi tlêm tê, tlânchhuakte chauh lo chu.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta rama Pathros hmuna Juda awm zawng zawng, an nupuiten pathian dang hnênahte rimtui an hlân ṭhîn tih hre reng pahote leh an zînga hmeichhe tel ve zawng zawng, mipui nasa tak pung khâwm chuan Jeremia chu an chhâng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa hminga kan hnêna thu i sawite kha kan ngaithla lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu kan lo tiam tawh angin kan awm zâwk ang a, vân lalnu hnênah rimtui kan hâl ang a, in tûr thilhlante a tân kan bun chhuak ang. Keini leh min thlahtute, kan lalte leh kan hotuten Judai ram khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem kawtthlêra an tih ṭhin ang khân kan ti ve ang. Chûng lai chuan ei tûr kan ngah a, kan hmuingîl a, chhiat pawh kan tâwk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vân lalnu hnêna rimtui hâl leh a tâna in tûr thilhlan bun chhuah kan bânsan chinah erawh chuan eng mah kan nei ta lo va, khandaih leh ṭâm tuarin kan boral ta a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmeichhiate chuan, “Vân lalnu hnêna rimtui hâla, in tûr thilhlan kan bun chhuah te, a lim anga chhang kan ur te, a tâna in tûr thilhlan kan bun chhuah te kha kan pasalte hriatpuia ti kan ni lo vem ni?” an ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeremia chuan hetianga amah chhângtu, a hmei a pa, mi zawng zawng hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan Judai ram khawpuiah te, Jerusalem kawtthlêrah te nangni leh in lalte, in hotute, in thlahtute ram chhûng mi zawng zawngin rimtui in hâl ṭhîn tih a hre reng a, a theihnghilh lo tih in hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In thil sual tihte Lalpa chuan a tuar thei ta lo va, thil tenawm tak in tih avângin ram chu a chhe zo va, ânchhe dawng, tu ma luah lohvin tûnah a lo awm ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tûna in chan chhiatna hi pathian dangte hnênah in inthawi a, Lalpa thupêk te, a dân te leh a thu hriattîr te zâwm lovin in sualsan vâng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jeremia chuan mipuite leh hmeichhiate hnênah chuan, “Nangni Juda mi, Aigupta rama awm zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Vân lalnu hnêna rimtui hâl leh in tûr thilhlan bun chhuah, kan nupuite nên kan lo tiam tawh chu kan hlen ngei ang,’ tiin in ṭawng a, in thiltihin in tilang bawk a. In sawi ang chuan ti ula, in thutiam chu hlen mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nangni Aigupta rama Juda mi zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh u: ‘Ngai teh u, ka hming ropui tak chhâlin thu ka tiam ta,’ Lalpa chuan a ti. Aigupta rama Juda awmten, ‘Engkim Lalpa chu mi nung alâwm,’ tiin ka hming an chhâl tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai teh u, an ṭhatna tûr ni lovin an chhiatna tûr zâwkin anni chu ka châng reng a ni. An boral vek hma chu Aigupta rama Juda zawng zawng chuan khandaih te, ṭâm te an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khandaih pumpelha Aigupta ram aṭanga Judai rama kîr lehte chu tlêm tê chauh an ni ang. Aigupta rama awm tum, la dam chhunte chuan ka thu nge dik an thu an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />He hmunah hian ka hrem dâwn che u a ni; tichuan, ka thute hi in chhiatna tûr a lo ni ngei tih in hria ang, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Hre rawh u, Aigupta lal Hofra Farawa chu amah thah tumtu, a hmêlmate kutah ka pe ang, Judai lal Zedekia, amah thah tumtu, Babulon lal Nabukadnezara kuta ka pe ang khân,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josia fapa Jehoiakima, Judai rama a lal kum linaah, Beria fapa Barukan zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu lehkhabu-ah a ziak chhuak a, chutih lai chuan Jeremian a hnênah heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang Baruk, Israel-te Pathian chuan i chungchâng heti hian a sawi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nang chuan, ‘Mang a va ang êm! Lalpa chuan ka thil tuara chungah lungngaihna min rawn belhchhah ta si a; mangangin ka rûm a, hahchawlhna rêng ka hmu ta lo a nih hi,’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘Ngai teh, ram pumah ka lo sak tawh chu ka ṭhiat ang a, ka lo phun tawh pawh ka pawt leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I tân chauhva thil ṭha i zawng em ni? Zawng tawh suh. Ngai teh, mi tin chungah thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr dâwn,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Mahse, khawiah pawh kal la, i nun zawng ka zuahsak ang che, tiin a hnênah sawi rawh min ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam dangte chungchânga zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aigupta chungthu: Juda lal Josia fapa, Jehoiakima lal kum lina Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran Eufretis lui kam Karkhemis hmuna a hneh tâk, Aigupta lal Neko Farawa sipai rual chungchâng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Phaw lian leh phaw tê peih diamin Indo tûrin kal chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakawrte thuam ula, a chungah chuang rawh u, Thîr lukhum khumin intlar ula, Feite tât hriam ula, thîr kawr ha rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engtizia nge ni le, an zâma an tawlhkîr tâk? An mi huaisente an tlu a, Hmanhmawh takin an tlânchhe zo ta, Hnung lam hawi lêk lovin baklêngin an tlân a, Ram tinah râl a ṭi,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mi ṭuanṭha an tlânchhe hman lo va, Mi chak an him hek lo. Saw hmâr Eufretis lui kamah sâwn an pai a, an tlu zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nail lui anga lo lian ta hi tu nge ni? Luipui so bulh bulh ang hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta chu Nail lui angin a lo lian a, Luipui tui so bulh bulh ang hian, Ka lian ang a, lei chung dâpin khawpuite chu a chhûnga chêngte nên ka tichhia ang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakawrte u, tâwn ru, tawlailîrte u, tlân chiam rawh u, Nangni sipai huaisen, Ethiopia mite, Put mi, phaw kengtu te, Ludia mi, thal kâp thiamte u, tâwn zêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu ni chu, Engkim Lalpa , Pathian ta a ni. Phuba lâk ni, a hmêlmate chunga phuba a lâk ni chu; Khandaih chuan duh tâwkin a ei ang a, An thisen pawh tlai khawpin a in ang. Saw hmâr Eufretis lui kamah sâwn, Engkim Lalpa , Pathian chuan Inthawi nân mi tam tak a hlân ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Aigupta fanu, nula thianghlim, Gilead-ah chho la, thinghnai damdawi han la rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnamten i mualphona an hria a, ‘Mi hrâng leh mi hrâng an insu a, an tlu dûn reng mai,’ Ti-a i ṭap thâwm chu lei pum puiah a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara a lo kal a, Aigupta ram a rawn nghaisak tûr thu zâwlnei Jeremian Lalpa thu a sawi chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta-ah puang ula, Migdol-ah hril rawh u, Nof-ah leh Tahfanes-ah puang ula, ‘Inring ula, invêng ṭha rawh u, Kan vêla mite chu khandaihin a eizo ta,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engati nge i mi chak chu a tlûk tâk? A ding thei ta lo, Lalpa nam thlûk a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An tlu khâwm a, an indelh a, tichuan, an inrâwn ta, ‘Hmêlma khandaiha kan thih loh nân kan ram, Kan chhûngte hnênah i tlân haw ang u,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Aigupta lal Farawa hi thâwm chang lian mai, A hun ṭha a hloh ta a nih hi’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Kei hi mi nung ka nih hi, Lalber,’ a hming Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti; ‘Tlâng zînga Tabor a lawr ang leh Tuipui kama Karmel tlâng a awm luah angin A lo kal dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni Aigupta mite u, saltâng tûrin in thawmhnaw têl rawh u, Nof khua chu a ṭiau vang a, a chhe vek ang. Luahtu rêng an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aigupta chu bâwngla nalh tak ang a ni, Mahse, hmâr lam ata tlip lo thlâwkin a rawn bâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An sipai rawihte pawh bâwng châwm thau ang an ni, A ni, an hnungtawlh a, an tlânchhia; ding lovin. An chhiatna ni chuan a rawn nang ta, hrem an tuarna ni chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An tlânchhe thâwm chu rûlpui tlânchhe ri ang a ni, An hmêlmate an lo hnai zêl, thingkittu angin Hreipui nên an lo thawk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ngawpui chu an rawn ṭhiat ang, Kal tlang theih loh khawpa pik chu,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. ‘Anni chu khau puang aiin an tam zâwk, Chhiar sên rual an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu an mualpho ta, Hmâr lam mite kutah pêk an ni tawh si a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, Thebes khaw pathian Amon te, Farawa te, Aigupta leh a pathian te, an lalte leh Farawa rinchhantu zawng zawngte chu ka hrem dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anmahni thah tumtu Babulon lal Nebukadnezara leh a ṭhuihruaite kutah ka pe ang. Chumi hunah chuan Aigupta ramah, hmânlai ang khân an awm leh ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Jakob, nang zawngin hlau suh, Aw Israel, zâm hek suh, Ram hla tak ata ka chhan chhuak ang che a, I thlahte pawh an saltânna ata ka hruai chhuak ang, Jakoba chu a lo hâwng ang a, Him tak leh thlamuang takin a awm ang; Tu man an tithlabâr tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Jakob, ka chhiahhlawh, hlau suh, I hnênah ka awm hi,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. Ka hnawhchhuahna che hnam zawng zawng ka tiboral ang a, Nangni zawng ka tiboral vek lo vang che u, Dik takin ka hrem ang che u, Hrem loh erawh chuan ka chhuah lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Faraw-an Gaza a beih hmaa Filistia mite chungchânga zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, hmâr lam aṭangin tui a lo lian a, A kuang a khat ang a, a luang liam ang a, Ram pum a chîm vek ang. Mangangin mi an au vang a, ram chhûnga mi tin an rûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sakawr per ri ṭuk ṭukah te, a tawlailîr tlan ri dur durahte leh A ke inkhak bur bur thâwmahte chuan Pate kut a zawi zo vang a, an fate pawh an ngaihsak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni chu a lo thleng ta, Filistia mi zawng zawng chhiatna ni chu, Tura leh Sidon ata ṭanpuitu an awm ta lo; Tuipuia thliarkâr, Kapthora Filistia mi la dam chhunte chu, Lalpa chuan a tiboral dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza tân lu ziah kawlh a hun ta, Askelon a chhe zo va, Phaizâwla la dam chhunte u, eng chen nge in sûn dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa khandaih, eng hunah nge i chawlh dâwn? I paiah inkhung la, châwl la, awm hle hle rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpan tih tûr a tuk si chuan, Engtin nge a chawlh theih ang? Askelon leh tuipui kama chêngte bei tûrin thu a pe miau si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab chungthu: Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Nebo chung a pik e, a chhe zo ta si a, Kiriathaim chu a mualpho va, an hneh ta si a, kulhte a chhe rem rum a, a luahtute an mualpho zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab hmingthanna a nêp ta, Babulon-ah a chhiatna tûr an rêl. “Hawh u, hnama chhiar tlâk loh khawpin i siam ang u,” an ti. Nangni Madmen khaw mite u, in reh ṭhiap ang, Khandaihin a ûmzui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Horonaim aṭanga au thâwm, Chhiatna nasa tak thâwm chu ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab a chhia a, a fate an ṭap chuah chuah mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Luhit-ah ṭap chungin an chho va, Horonaim chhukah mangang au thâwm an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In him theih nân tlânchhe rawh u, Thlalêra ram sabengtung ang maia chakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In kutkawih, in sum leh pai in rinchhan avângin, Nangni pawh an man ang che u; Khemosa chu a puithiamte leh a hotute nên Sala hruai an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawpui tinah tichhetu a lo thleng ang a, Khaw khat mahin an pumpelh lo vang. Phaizâwl chu a chhia ang a, Hmun zâwl zaute pawh a chhe vek ang, Lalpa sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thlawh bo nân Moab chu thla pe ula, A khawpuite a chhe vek ang a, Tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dâwngdah taka Lalpa hna thawk chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se; Thisen chhuah nâna khandaih hmang duh lo chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab chu a tleirâwl lai ata Nuamsa takin a awm ṭhîn a. Uain bun chhuah loh, a mawng nawi nêna inchiah, Bun chhuah ngai loh angin a awm a, Sala hruai a ni ngai lo. A thlum dân a pangngai reng a, A rim a chhe chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, ni chu a lo thleng ta, Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. A hnênah bun chhuaktu ka tîr ang a, A bêl ata a bun chhuak ang. A bêl chu a bun ruak ang a, a tikeh sawm vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel chhûngten an innghahna Bethel an zahpui angin, Moab pawhin Khemosa an zahpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Pasalṭha, râl laka huaisen kan nei,’ Engtin nge in tih theih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab tichhetute chu, khawpuiah an chho va, An tlangvâl chhuanvâwrte thah tûrin an hruai chhuak ang. Tih hi, a hming Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab chhiatna tûr chu a lo thleng ṭêp, A tuar tûr chuan a rawn hnaih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A chhehvêla awm zawng zawngten ani chu ṭah rawh se, A hming hretu zawng zawngten, ‘Engtizia nge, tiang khauh leh tiang mawi chu a tliah tâk mai le!’ ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw nangni, Dibon mite u, in khaw ropui tak ata lo chhuak ula, Ram rovah hian ṭhu rawh u. Bei tûr chein Moab tichhetu a lo thleng ta. I kulhte pawh a tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aroer mite u, kawngahte ding ula, Paho tlânchhia leh nuho relhrute chu lo châng ula, ‘Engtizia nge ni ta?’ lo ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moab chu a mualpho va, a chhe zo ta, Lungchhe takin ṭap chiam rawh u. Arnon luiah, ‘Moab a chhe ta,’ tiin puang r’u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tlâng chung zâwla khawpui, Holon te, Jahza te, Mefaat te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dibon te, Nebo te, Beth-diblataim te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kiriathaim te, Beth-gamul te, Beth-meon te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keriot te, Bozra te, Moab rama khua zawng zawng, kilkhâwr taka awm chenin an chungthu rêl a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ki chu râwtchhum a ni a, a bân pawh tihtliah a ni ta, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab chu hrai rui rawh, Lalpa aia lian zâwkah a inngai a, mahse, Moab chu ama luakah a tâl ang a, nuihzatbûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel chu i nuihzat ṭhîn a ni lâwm ni? Rûkru zînga tel em a niha, a chungchâng i sawi apianga i lu i thin ṭhin le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moab-a chêngte u, khawpui chhuahsan ula, Lungpui kârah tawm rawh u. Pûk kawngka sîra bu chhep ṭhîn ṭhuro angin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab chapozia kan hria, chapo tak an ni, An induhzia te, mahni thu an duhzia te, An chaltlaizia te, an intihveizia te, An inlulinzia te ka hria, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mahse, eng mah a sâwt lo, A uang thlâwn mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, Moab ka tuarpui ang, Moab mi zawng zawng tân ka ṭap ang. Kir-heres mite pawh ka sûn bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aw Sibmah grep kûng, Jazer mite ṭap aia nasain ka ṭah ang che, I zârte chuan tuipui a thleng a, Jezer a thlen hial ṭhin kha. Ei chhetuin i thei leh grep rahte a ei chhe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moab ram ṭha tak aṭangin Hlimna leh lâwmna a reh zo ta, Uain sâwr tûr ka titâwp a, Tu man hlim takin an sâwr tawh lo vang. An au thâwm pawh hlim thâwm a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hesbon leh Elealeh-a an au thâwm chu Jahaz aṭangin a hriat a, Zoar mite pawhin an lo hria a, Horonaim leh Eglath-selisia thlengin an hre phâk. Nimrim tuikhurte pawh a kang zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Moab rama an hmunsâng te, an pathian hnêna rimtui an hâl ṭhinnate chu ka tichhe vek ang,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />‘Lusûnte tâna phênglâwng tum rîk angin Moab avângin ka lungngai a, Kir-heres mite tân pawh ka ngui zo ta. An sum leh pai chhêkkhâwl a ral zo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An lu an mêt kawlh vek a, an khabehmul pawh an ziat kawlh vek a ni. An kutte an zai a, saiip puan an veng ṭheuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab-ho in chung zâwl zawng zawngah leh an khawlaiahte chuan an ṭap chuah chuah a, bêl chhe paih angin Moab chu a keh sawm ta,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A va han chhe hneh êm! An ṭap tlawk tlawk mai. Moab chu a mualpho va, Moab chu miten an nuihzat a, a vêla mi zawng zawngin râpthlâk an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, mupui angin a lo thlâwk ang, Moab chungah a lo bir ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keriot chu lâk a ni a, a kulhte pawh lâk vek a ni, Chumi ni-ah chuan Moab Pasalṭhate an zâm ang a, Hmeichhe nau vei thlaphâng ang mai an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moab a boral ta, hnama chhiar tlâk a ni ta lo, Lalpa lakah a inluling êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hlauhawm te, khuarkhurum te, thang te chuan A châng reng che u a ni, Moab mite u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Hlauhawm tlânsantu chu khuarkhurumah a tla ang a, Khuarkhurum ata chhuak chu thangah a âwk ang. Moab ka hrem hun chu ka thlentîr dâwn,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Hesbon phênah râltlânho chau takin an ding. Mahse, Hesbon aṭangin mei a lo chhuak a, Lal Sihona in aṭangin meipui a chhuak. Moab mite baksam a kâng a, Indo chak mite chhîpsam chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moab mite u, in va khawngaihthlâk tak êm, Khemosa mite an ral zo ta, I fapate salah an hruai a, I fanute an man zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûngahte erawh chuan Moab dinhmun ka siam ṭha leh ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Hei zawng hi Moab hremna tûr thu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Amon mite chungchâng heti hian a sawi: “Israelan fate a nei lo vem ni? Rokhâwmtu a nei na nge? Engati nge Gad-ho ram chu Milkoman a luaha, a mite pawh an khawpuiah an chên tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh, nite a lo thleng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Indo thâwm ri ka hriattîr ang, Amon mite khua Raba an bei thâwm chu! Bawlhhlawh vawm khâwm mai an ni ang a, A chhehvêl khuate pawh meiin a kâng ang. Israel-te chuan anmahni hnawt chhuaktute chu an hnawt chhuak ve thung ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Hesbon, chiau vak vak rawh, Ai khua chu a chhe zo ta si a. Raba mite u, ṭap chiam ula, saiip puan sin rawh u, Hung chhûngah chuan tlân kual rawh u, Milkoma chu a puithiamte leh a miliante nên Salah an hruai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fa rinawm lote u, engtizia nge in phai ram ṭha in chhuan le? In sum leh paia innghatin, ‘Tu nge mi bei ang?’ i ti maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, kil tin aṭangin I chungah hlauhawm ka rawn thlentîr dâwn, Tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Mi tin an tlân darh chum chum ang a, Tu man tlândarhte chu an ko khâwm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan Amon mite chu ka tungding leh ang, Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom chungchâng: Engkim Lalpa thu chu hei hi a ni: Teman-ah finna a awm ta na nge? In zîngah remhria an awm ta lo vem ni? An finna a bo zo ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dedan mite u, lêt ula, tlânchhe rawh u, Khuarkhurumahte biru rawh u. Esauva chungah chhiatna ka thlentîr dâwn, Anmahni ka hrem hun a thleng ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Grep rah sengtu i rawihte chuan A rah tlêm tal an zuah ṭhîn a. Zâna rûkrute pawhin An duhzâwng chauh an la ṭhîn a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Esauva erawh chu a neih zawng zawng ka lâksak ang a, A thil thuhrûkna hmun chu ka haihawng vek ang, Tichuan, a thukru thei tawh lo vang a, A fa te, a laichîn te, a ṭhenawm te nên an boral ang a, Tu mah ka zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zînga fahrah awmte chu ka hnênah hnutchhiah rawh u, Keiman ka enkawl ang. In hmeithaite pawhin mi ring rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In lo tûrte pawhin no chu an in si chuan, Nang hi hrem lohvin i chhuak ang maw? Hrem lohvin i chhuak hauh lo vang. I in ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin thu ka tiam ta,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Bozra chu mite hlauh, mak tih huai huai, Sawichhiat leh ânchhe dawng a ni ang, An khua zawng zawng pawh a ram hlen hlauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa hnên ata thu ka dawng a, ‘Pung khâwm ula, anni chu bei tûrin lo kal ula, Indo tûrin lo thawk rawh u,’ tiin. Hnamte hnênah palai an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, mite hmuhsit atân, Hnamte zîngah ka titê ta che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I vaupûm leh i chapona chuan a bum ta che a ni, Nang, lungpui keh kâra awm ṭhîn, Tlângchhîp sânga awmhmun khuar, Mupui angin sâng takah bu chhep mah la, Chuta ṭang chuan ka hnûk thla ang che, Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edom chan chu miten râpthlâk an ti ang a, mi veivâk apiangin an hlau vang, a chhiat nasat êm avângin an chek tlawk tlawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomora leh a kianga khaw tihchhiatte ang khân, ‘Tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, tu man an luah tawh hek lo vang,’ Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh, Jordan ngawa sakeibakneiin phûla berâm tla a ṭhâwng thut angin vawilehkhatah anni chu an ram ata ka ûm chhuak ang a; tichuan, an chungah thu nei tûr ka duh duh ka dah ang. Kei ang hi tu nge awma, tu nge mi cho ngam le? Mi khing ngam berâmpu tu nge awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thiltum, Edom chunga tih a tum leh Teman mite chunga hlen a tum hi ngaithla rawh u: ran notête chu a hnûk bo vang a, an tlatna hmunte chu a ṭiau vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An tlu thâwmah lei a nghîng ang a, an ṭap thâwm pawh Tuipui Sen thlengin an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />En teh u, Bozra chungah a thlâwk a, mupui angin a lo bir dâwn. Chumi ni chuan Edom mi huaisente thinlung chu hmeichhe nau vei angin a zâm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Damaska chungchâng: Hamat leh Arpat an mualpho ta, Chanchin lâwmawm lo an hria a, an zâm zo ta. Tuipui fâwn awm hle hle thei lo ang hian an buai zo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damaska a chau va, tlânchhiat tumin a lehhawi, Buainain a nangchîng a, lungngaihnain a tlâkbuak ta, Hmeichhe nau vei na tuar ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawpui hmingthang, Mi tilâwmtu chu a chhe zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuta tlangvâlte chu kawtthlêrah an tlu ang a, Chumi ni chuan sipaite pawh an boral vek ang, Tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damaska kulh bang ka hâl ang a, An lal Ben-hadada inte a kâng vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kedar leh Hazor ram, Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran a rûn thu: Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Tho la, Kedar mite bei la, Khawchhak mite tiboral vek rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An puan in te, an ran rual te lâksak la, An puanzâr te, an bungrua te, An sanghâwngsei te nên la bo vek rawh. ‘Kil tinah râl a ṭi,’ tiin mite chu an au vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hazor mite u, tlân sawk sawk ula, pûkahte tawm rawh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran a phiar che u a, Tihchhiat che u a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tho ula, râlmuang tak leh him taka awm ṭhîn, kulh kawngkhâr leh a kalhna pawh nei lo, Awm hle hle ṭhîn hnamte chu Bei rawh u,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“An sanghâwngseite râlin an man ang a, An ranrual pawh an kawisak ang a, Lumêthote chu kil tinah ka tidarh ang. Kil tin aṭangin an chhiatna tûr ka thlentîr dâwn,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor chu sihalte tualchaina hmun a ni ang a, A ram kumkhua ang. Tah chuan tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, Tu mah an awm leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judai rama Zedekia a lal ṭan tirha Elam chungchânga Lalpa thu, zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, Elam thalngul, an chakna thahrui ngei chu, ka titliak dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kâwlkil li ata thli pali, Elam bei tûrin ka rawn tîr ang. Kil tinah ka tidarh ang a, Elam mi darhte chu an kal lohna ram rêng a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An hmêlma, anmahni thah tumtute hmaah chuan Elam mite chu ka tizâm ang a, thinur takin an chungah thil ṭha lo ka thlentîr ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Ka tihral vek hma chu khandaihin ka ûm zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An lalte leh hotute ka tiboral ang a, Elam-ah chuan ka lalṭhutthlêng ka hûng ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Mahse, ni hnuhnûngahte chuan Elam chu ka din thar leh ang a, ka siam ṭha leh ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon chungchâng leh Kaldai mite chungchâng, Zâwlnei Jeremia hmanga Lalpa sawi chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnamte hnênah hril ula, puang rawh u, Puanzâr târ ula, puang rawh u, eng mah zêp suh u, ‘Babulon chu a tlâwm ta, An pathian Bela chu a mualpho va, Marduka chu a zâm a, An pathian limte a mualpho, An milemte a chhe zo ta,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chu hmâr lama hnam Pakhatin a rawn bei ang a, A ram chu a rawn tichhe vek ang. Tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, Mihring leh ramsa an tlân bo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hun leh ni a lo thlen chuan Israel mite leh Juda mite chu an lo kal ho vang a, ṭap chungin Lalpa an Pathian an rawn zawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion kawng an zâwt ang a, a lam an pan ang. ‘Hawh u, kumkhaw thuthlung, theihnghilh tawh loh tûr chu Lalpa nên i thlung ang u,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite chu berâm bo ang an ni, an vêngtuten an hruai bo va, tlângahte an vâkvai a, tlâng leh mual dungte zawhin an huang pawh an hre tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmu apiangin an ei zêl a, an hmêlmate chuan, ‘Thil kan tisual hlei nêm, Lalpa , anmahni vêngtu dik tak, an thlahtute innghahna Lalpa lakah chuan thil an tisual a ni zâwk,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Babulon khua tlânchhuahsan ula, Kaldai ram chu chhuahsan rawh u. A rual zînga kêlchal angin hma hruai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Babulon rawn bei tûrin hmâr lam ata hnam ropui tak pung khâwm chu ka chawktho vang a, amah chu do tûrin an insingsa ang. Chûng mite chuan an rawn hneh ang a, an thalte chu, râltuk thiam tak hlawhchham ngai lo ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Kaldai-ho chu an rawk ang a, a rawktute chu an hlawhtling hle ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang ka hnam thlan rawktu, i hlimin i lâwm hle na a, Bâwngla, hnimno zînga tla melh melh ang leh, Sakawrpa hrâm nghur nghur ang hi ni mah la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I nu chu a zak hle ang a, Hringtu che chu a kun tlawk tlawk ang. Ngai teh, hnamte zîngah a tê ber ang a, Thlalêr ramro ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thinurna avângin tu mah an awm lo vang a, A ram vek ang, Babulon-a kal tlang apiangin mak an ti ang a, A chhiat nasat avângin an chek tlawk tlawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thal kâp mi zawng zawngte u, Babulon hual rawh u, Kâp ula, in thalte ren suh u, Lalpa lakah an sual si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kil tin aṭangin au khum ula: a inpe ta! A kulhte a chim a, a bangte a sawp ta, Lalpa chuan phuba a la a ni. Nangni pawhin phuba la ula, A tih angin a chungah ti ve rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Buh chi thehtu chu Babulon ata la bo ula, Buh seng laia favah kengtu nên chuan, Mi nunrâwng khandaih hlauvin Mi tinin mahni mite pan sela, Mahni ramah tlân ṭheuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel chu berâm rual, sakeibaknei ûm darh ang hi a ni. Asuria lalin a han ei phawt a, Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran a ruh a ṭhei sawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh, Asuria ram ka hrem angin Babulon lal leh a ram chu ka hrem dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel chu a chênna ramah ka hruai kîr ang a, Karmel leh Basan-ah an tân ei tûr a tam ang a, Efraim tlâng leh Gilead thlaite chu duh tâwkin an tlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hun leh ni a lo thlen chuan Israel-te bawhchhiatna hmuh tumin an zawng ang a, an hmu lo vang; Juda-te sualna pawh hmuh tûr a awm tawh lo vang. Ka mi zuah, la dam chhunte chu, ka ngaidam dâwn si a,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Merathaim ram leh Pekod mite chu bei rawh u, That ula, tiboral vek rawh u. Thu ka pêk che u ang zêlin ti ang che u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan indo thâwm a awm, Chhiatna nasa tak thâwm chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawvêl pum pui tidarhtu tuboh chu, a phel a, a kehdarh ta, Babulon chan chu hnamte chuan râpthlâk an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Babulon, i awh nân thang ka kam a, i âwk ta a, Chu chu i hre si lo, Lalpa i dodâl hi an hre chhuak che a, An man ta che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a râlthuam bâwm a hawng a, A thinurna hriamhrei a la chhuak ta. Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa chuan Kaldai ramah Thil tih tûr a nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kil tin aṭanga bei tûrin lo kal rawh u, A thil dah khâwmna hawng ula, Buhpâwl angin tiang khâwm ula, tichhe vek rawh u, Eng mah rêng zuah suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sipaite chu tihlum vek rawh u, An chung a va pik êm! An ni a thleng ta si, Hrem an tuar hun chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu! Babulon ram aṭanga Tempul tichhetute chungah kan Pathian, Lalpa chuan phuba a lâk tâk thu Zion-ah an puan tâk chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Babulon bei tûrin thal kâp mi, thal kâp thiam zawng zawng ko khâwm ula, tu mah chhuak thei lo tûrin hual tlat rawh u. A thil lo tih tawh ang zêlin thungrûl ula, a tih ang chiahin a chungah ti ang che u, Lalpa , Israel Mi Thianghlima chu an pawisak loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, an tlangvâlte chu kawtthlêrah an tlu ang a, an sipaite pawh chumi ni chuan an boral vek ang,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, chapopa, ka ngaithei lo che a ni,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. I ni a lo thleng ta, hrem i tuar hun chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi chapo chu a pai ang a, a tlu ang, Tu man an kaitho lo vang, A khawpuite ka hâl ang a, A vêla awm zawng zawng a kâng vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel-te leh Juda-te chu hnehchhiahin an awm a, mantuten an chelh tlat a, an thlah duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An tlantu erawh chu mi chak tak, a hming Engkim Lalpa a ni. Ani chuan a ṭan tlat ang a, leiah remna a lêntîr ang a, Babulon mite chungah erawh chuan buaina a thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Kaldai mite chungah khandaih a lêng e, Babulon mite, an hruaitu te, an mi fing te chungah nên,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zâwlnei derte chungah khandaih a lêng e, An lo va â tak êm! A sipaite chungah khandaih a thleng a, An va han hlau tak êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An sakawr leh tawlailîrte chungah pawh khandaih a lêng, Hnam dang sipai an rawihte chungah pawh Hmeichhia ang mai an ni ta, An sum leh pai chungah pawh khandaih a thleng, Rawk an tâwk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khua a khêng a, tuite a kang zo ta, Milim tamna ram, milem âtchilhtute an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuvângin, thlalêr sanghar leh chinghniate chutah chuan an chêng ang a, vanghâwngseite pawh an awm ang a, tu man an luah lo vang a, tu mah rêng an awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pathianin Sodom te, Gomora te leh a chhehvêl khua te a tiram ang khân, chutah chuan tu mah an awm lo vang a, mi tu mah an chêng tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ngai teh, hmâr lam aṭangin mi an lo kal, Hnam chak tak leh lal tam tak, kâwlkil ata lo thawkte chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thal leh fei an keng a, nunrâwng tak, lainatna nei lo an ni, An thâwm chu tuipui ri hum hum ang a ni, An sakawr chungahte an rawn chuang. Mite chu inrâlring sa vekin an lo kal, Aw Babulon mite u, an bei dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Babulon lalin an chanchin a lo hriatin A kut a zâwi a, hmeichhe nau vei angin Natna leh manganna chuan a man ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai teh, Jordan ngawa sakeibakneiin phûla berâm tla a ṭhâwng thut angin vawilehkhatah anni chu an ram ata ka ûm chhuak ang a; tichuan, an chunga thunei tûr ka duh duh ka dah ang. Kei ang hi tu nge awma, tu nge mi cho ngam le? Mi khing ngam berâmpu tu nge awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thiltum, Babulon mite chunga a tih tum leh Kaldai mite chunga hlen a tum chu ngaithla rawh u; ran notête chu a hnûk bo vang a, anmahni angin an tlatna hmunte chu a ṭiau vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babulon an lâk thâwmah lei hi a nghîng ang a, an ṭap thâwm chu hnamte chuan an hria ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon chungah leh Kaldai mite chungah thlichhia ka tlehtîr dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anmahni zâp bova, an ram tiruak vek tûr hnam dangte Babulon-ah chuan ka tîr ang. Chhiatniah chuan kil tin aṭangin an rawn bei ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thal kâptuin a thalngul kuai hman lovin A thir kawr pawh ha hman hek suh se. Tlangvâlte zuah sú, sipaite pawh tiboral vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ramah ngei Kaldai mite chu an that phung ang a, Kawtthlêrahte pawh râpthlâk takin an vit hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ram chu Israel Mi Thianghlima hmaah lo sual hle ṭhîn mah se, An Pathian, Engkim Lalpa chuan Israel leh Juda-te chu a thlahthlam ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon tlân chhuahsan rú, in him theih nân tlân rawh u, An suahsualna avângin boral ve suh u. Lalpa phuba lâk hun a thleng ta a, An phu tâwkin a thungrûl dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babulon chu Lalpa kuta rangkachak no a ni, Lei pum pui a tirui a, Hnamten a uain an in a, an â zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon chu a tlu thut ang a, a kehsawm vek ang, Ṭah vak vak rawh u, A hliamah thinghnai damdawi hnawih ula, A lo dam mial mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babulon chu tihdam ka tum a, a dam thei si lo, Ani chu hnuchhawn ila, mahni ram ṭheuh i pan ang u, A thiam lohnain vân a tawng a, chhûm anga sâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan kan dikzia a târlang ta a, ‘Lo kal ula, kan Pathian Lalpa thiltih hi, Zion-ah i hril ang u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thalte tât hriam ula, phawte chuh rawh u, Lalpa chuan Media lalte a chawk tho va, Babulon tihchhiat a tum ta a ni. Lalpa chuan phuba a la dâwn, a Tempul phuba chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babulon kulh bang epah puanzâr zâr rawh u, Vêngtu pawh chah belh ula, enthlatu dah ula, Chân rûkna siam rawh u. Lalpa chuan a thiltum a hlen dâwn, Babulon mite chunga a lo sawi tawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang, tui tam tak hmuna cheng, sum leh pai ngah êm êm, I tâwpna a lo thleng ta, i hun a liam ta e.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan a hming chhâlin heti hian a ti: “Khau rual anga tam mipui ka rawn hruai lût ang a, Hnehna hla an sak khum ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thiltihtheihnain lei a siam a, A finnain khawvêl a din, A hriatnain vân a kai pharh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu a pe a, tuite chu a ri hum hum a, Kâwlkil aṭangin chhûm a chhohtîr a, Ruah leh kâwlphe a siam a, A hmun aṭangin thli a tlehtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tin an mâwl a, hriatna reng an nei lo, Rangkachak chhertuten an milem an zahpui ang a, An milem chhûnte chu a lem, nunna nei lo an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hlutna nei lo, hmuhsitawm mai an ni, Hrem an nih hun chuan an boral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakoba Pathian chu hêng ang hi a ni ve lo, Ani zawng engkim siamtu a ni, Israel pawh a rochan hnam an ni, a hming chu Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nang hi ka hreipui, indona hriamhrei i ni, Nangmah hmangin hnamte ka tidarh ang a, Nangmah hmangin lalramte ka tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah hmangin sakawr leh a chungchuang ka tidarh ang a, Nangmah hmangin tawlailîr leh a chungchuang ka tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmah hmangin mipa leh hmeichhia ka that ang a, Nangmah hmangin putarte leh ṭhalaite ka tihlum ang a, Nangmah hmangin nula leh tlangval ka that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah hmangin berâmte leh a pute ka that ang a, Nangmah hmangin loneitu leh an bâwng chhawrte ka tihlum ang a, Nangmah hmangin ramawptute leh hotute ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zion chunga an thil tihsual tâkte chu, in hmuh ngeiah Babulon leh a chhûnga Kaldai mite chungah Ka thungrûl dâwn,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nang, khawvêl tichhetu tlâng lian, ka ngaithei lo che a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Bei tûr chein i chungah ka kut ka lek ta, Khâmah ka nam lum ang chia, Tlâng kâng ût kawlh angin ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I hnên ata a kil lung tûr leh a lungphum tûr, Lâk a ni lo vang, Kumkhuain i ram hlen tawh ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan puanzâr zâr ula, Hnamte hriat tûrin tawtawrâwt hâm rawh u, Anni chu do tûrin hnamte chu inbuatsaihtîr ula, Bei tûrin Ararat te, Mini te, Askana ram te ko ula, An hotu tûr ruat bawk ula, Khau puang anga tam sakawr man khâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babulon bei tûrin hnamte chu inbuatsaihtîr rawh u, Media lalte, ramawptute, an hruaitute, An ram awp zawng zawng te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu ram chu na tuarin a khûr hlawk hlawk a, Babulon ram tichhiaa, luahtu awm lova siam hi Babulon chunga Lalpa thiltum, a hlen mêk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babulon mi huaisente an râlbâng ta, kulh chhûngah an tawm tlat a, An dawih zo ta, hmeichhia ang mai an ni. An in te a kâng zo va, Kulh kawngkhâr kalhnate a bung zo ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Babulon khawpui chu kil tin aṭangin an la ta,’ Tih thu hrilh tûrin lal hnênah Zualko an tlân zut zut mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Luikaite an la a, lui kam phairuangte an hâl fai, Sipaite chu an zâm zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon mite chu hruihzâwla buh chîl ang hi an ni ang, Rei lo têah chîl hrep an ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran mi ei zo ta, Bêl ruak ang mai ka ni. Rûlpui angin min dawlh a, ka sa tui tui eiin a intipuar a, Tichuan, mi chhâk chhuak leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zion-a awmte chuan, ‘Min sawisak angin Babulon chu sawisak nek ni rawh se,’ ti sela, Jerusalem-a awmte pawhin, ‘Kan thisen mawh chu, Kaldai-hovin phur rawh se,’ ti teh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, i lamah ka ṭang ang a, phuba ka laksak ang che Luipui chu ka ti kang ang a, a tuikhurte chu ka tikang vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Babulon chu thil chhe vawm khâwm, sihalte tualchaina, Mite hmuhsit leh endawng, Mi rêng rêng awm tawh lohnaah ka chantîr ang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A mite chu sakeibaknei vânglai angin an rûm ang a, Sakeibaknei note angin an hrâm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An râwp lai takin ruai ka buatsaihsak ang a, Ka hrai rui hnêp ang. An sa bual bual ang a, an muhîl hlen ang a, An harh leh tawh lo vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Ran talhna hmuna berâmpa leh kêlpa talh tûr angin Anni chu ka hruai chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Sesak chu man a ni ta, Lei pum pui chawimawi ṭhin chu a tlâwm ta. Hnam tinin Babulon chan chu rapthlâk an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Babulon chu tuipuiin a chîm ang a, A fâwn nasa tak chuan a khuh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A khawpuite chu a ram vek ang a, Thlalêr, mihring rêng awm lohna, Tu ma tlawh loh ram a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babulon pathian Bela chu ka hrem dâwn, A dawlh tawh chu ka luak chhuahtîr ang a, Hnamte chuan an bêl tawh lo vang a, Babulon kulh bangte pawh a chim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ka mite u, a chhûng ata lo chhuak rawh u, Lalpa thinur nasa tak laka in him nân tlân chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ram chhûnga thuthang in hriat hunah Zâm suh ula, hlau hek suh u, Kuminah thuthang pakhat a awm a, Kum lehah a dang. Ram chhûngah inpâwngnêkna thu a thang vêl, Rorêltu leh rorêltu insual thâwm chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng ngei dâwn, Babulon milem ka hrem ni leh a ram pum pui mualpho ni chu, Mi ṭhate chu an tlu phung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭangin tichhetuin Babulon chu a rawn tihchhiat hunah, Lei leh vân leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng lâwmin an au vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Israel-te a thah chiam avângin Babulon chu a tlu ngei ang, Khawvel pum puia mi tam tak thihna thlentu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nangni khandaih pumpelhtute u, kal ula, ding suh u, Hla takah pawh Lalpa hre reng ula, Jerusalem theihnghilh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kan mualpho ta, min hmuhsitzia kan hriatin zahthlâk kan ti, Lalpa ina hmun thianghlimahte hnam dang an luh tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nite a lo thleng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “An milemte ka sawisa ang a, ram pum puiah Hliam tuar an rûm chuah chuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babulon chu vân tawngin sâng mah se, a kulhte pawh sâng hle mah sela, Tichhetu tûr a hnênah ka tîr ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Babulon aṭanga ṭap thâwm leh Kaldai ram aṭanga chhiatna nasa tak thâwm chu Ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Babulon a tiboral dâwn, An thâwm ri mur mur chu a tireh ang a. An thâwm chu tuifâwn ri hum hum ang hi a ni, An au chu a khâwk rum rum mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tichhetu chu Babulon-ah a lo kal ang a, An mi huaisente chu a man ang, An thalngulte chu a titliak vek ang a, Lalpa chu thungrûl ṭhîntu Pathian a ni. A thungrûl ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“An hotute leh mi fing te, a ramawptu te chu, An hruaitute leh mi huaisente nên Ka hrai rui vek ang a, An muhîl hlen ang a, an harh leh tawh lo vang,” A hming Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon lal kulh bang chhah tak chu a chim vek ang a, A kawngka sâng takte pawh a kâng ral vek ang. Mipui thawhrimna chu a thlâwn a, Hnamte pawh kâng ral leh mai tûr atân an buai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia lal kum linaa Babulon-a a kal laiin a hnêna kal ve, Seraia, Neria fapa, Maaseia tupa hnêna zâwlnei Jeremia thupêk chu: Seraia chu lal chhungkaw enkawltu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Babulon chunga chhiatna lo thleng tûr zawng zawng leh Babulon chungchâng lehkhabu-ah a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Seraia hnenah, “Babulon i thlen hunah hêng thu zawng zawng hi chhiar chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Hetiangin sawi ang che, ‘Aw Lalpa , he hnam hi tihchhiat i tum thu i lo sawi tawh a; chuvângin, tu mah, mihring leh ramsa pawh, a chhûngah an chêng tawh lo vang a, kumkhuain a ram dêr tawh ang,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />He lehkhabu hi i chhiar chhuah zawhah, lungtum nên ṭâwn belhbawm la, Eufretis luiah paih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />‘Babulon chu hetiang hian a pil ang a, a tho leh tawh lo vang. A chunga chhiatna ka thlentîr avângin a tlu dêr ang,’ tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a. Hei zawng hi Jeremia thute chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pakhat a nihin Zedekia chu a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pakhat ro a rêl a. A nu hming chu Hamutali a ni, Libna khaw mi Jeremia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoiakima angin Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa a thinur avângin hêng thilte hi Jerusalem leh Judai ram chungah a lo thleng ta a, a hma ata anni chu a paih chhuak ta nge nge a ni. Tichuan, Zedekia chu Babulon lal chungah a hel ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekia lal kum kuana, a thla sâwmna, ni sâwm ni chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chu, a sipai zawng zawng nên Jerusalem bei tûrin a lo thawk a. Khawpui chu an hual a, a vêlah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekia lal kum sâwm leh pakhatna thlengin khawpui chu an hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭâm chu a na ta hle a; thla lina, ni kua ni chuan ei tûr an nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui hungna bang chu an tipawp a, sipai pâwlho chu an tlânchhe ta a. Kaldai miten khawpui chu an hual chungin lal huan kiang bang pahnih inkâr kawngah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, Kaldai sipaite chuan an ûm a, Zedekia chu Jeriko phaiah an ûm phâk a, a sipai zawng zawng chuan an tlânsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu an man a, Hamath rama Ribla khuaah Babulon lal hnênah an hruai a, ani chuan a chungthu a lo rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ribla khuaah chuan Babulon lal chuan a fate chu Zedekia hmuh lai ngeiin a thahsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekia pawh a mitmu a kher chhuahsak a, thîr kawl a buntîr a, Babulon-ah a hruai chho va, a thih ni thlengin lung inah a tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara a lal kum sâwm leh pakuana, thla ngana, ni sâwm ni chuan lal vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana, Babulon lal kianga ding ṭhîn chu Jerusalem-ah a lo lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa in leh lal in a hâl a, Jerusalem-a in zawng zawng, in pawimawh dang zawng zawng nên a hâl chhe vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaldai sipai rual, lal vêngtu pâwl hotu hnuaia mite chuan Jerusalem hungna kulhte chu an tichhe vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal vêngtu pâwl hotu, Nebuzaradana chuan mipui rethei tak tak, khawpuia hnutchhiah te, Babulon lal kuta inpeho te, kut themthiam la awm zawng zawngte nên salah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chuan ram chhûng mi retheiho ṭhenkhat chu grep huan leh lo lama hnathawk atân a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kaldai mite chuan Lalpa ina dâr ban te, a nghahchhan te, Lalpa ina dâr tuizêm te an tikeh vek a. Dâr zawng zawng chu Babulon-ah an phur chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bêl te, vutlawh te, khâwnvâr tihmihna te, maihûn te, rimtui hâlna berhbute leh dâr bungrua zawng zawng chu an la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal in vêngtu hotu chuan maihûn te, berhbu te, thlêng te, bêl te, khâwnvâr dahna te, thîrfian te, in tûr thilhlan dahna te, rangkachak leh tangkaruaa siam te chu a la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in atâna Lal Solomona siam - dâr ban pahnih, tuizêm pakhat leh a hûnna dâra siam, bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih leh bungbêl dang dâra siam zawng zawng chu bûk sên rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bante chu tawng sâwm leh pariata sâng a ni, a len lam tawng sâwm leh pahnih bial a ni. A lai a kawrawng a, a chhah lam chu zungza bêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ban hmawrah chuan lu bâwk tawng ngaa sâng a awm, a vêl chuan dâr leh theibuhfaia chei mawi vek a ni. Ban pahnihna pawh chu theibuhfaia chei bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pangah chuan theibuhfai sawmkua leh pahnih lai a awm a. A vêla chei mawina theibuhfai zawng zawng chu za zet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan puithiam lal ber Seraia te, a puitu puithiam Zefania te leh kawngkhâr vêngtu pathum chu a man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Indo mite, hotute leh lal khâwnbâwl ṭhîn mi pasarih, khawpuia la awm a hmuhte chu a man a; ram chhûnga sipai latu hotu lal ber leh chumi rama mi sawmruk, khawpuia awmte chu a hruai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana chuan an vaiin a man a, Ribla khuaa Babulon lal hnênah a rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Babulon lal chuan Hamat ram Ribla khuaah chuan anni chu a sawisa a, a tihlum a. Tichuan, Juda mite chu an ram ata sala hruai an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebukadnezaran sala a hruai mipui zât chu hei hi a ni: kum sarihnaah Juda mi sângthum leh sawmhnih leh pathum a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebukadnezara lal kum sâwm leh pariatnaah Jerusalem aṭangin mi zariat leh sawmthum leh pahnih a hruai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pathumnaah vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chuan Juda mi zasarih leh sawmli leh panga a hruai leh a, an vaiin sângli leh zaruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Juda lal Jehoiakina chu kum sâwm thum leh pasarih sala a tân hnuin Evil-merodaka chu Babulon-ah a lo lal a. Chumi kum thla sâwm leh pahnihna, ni sawmhnih leh panga ni chuan Juda lal Jehoiakina chu lung in ata a chhuah a, zalên takin a awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu a tiṭha hle a, Babulon-a a hnêna awm ve lal dangte aia dinhmun ṭha zâwkin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, tân in kawrte chu a hlîp a, a dam chhûng zawng lal hnênah a eiin a in ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A ni tin mamawh chu Babulon lal chuan a pe a, chutiangin a dam chhûng zawng, a thih thlengin, ṭha takin a enkawl a.
  </para>
</usx>
